[4686]={"Thaliollang en la ruina de los Elfos de Meluinen en Lin Giliath requiere la devolución del corazón de madera con cicatrices.","Se necesita: Corazón de madera con cicatrices recogido de los acechadores de pantano que se encuentran en Meluinen. Entregue los artículos a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath.","Tienes la tarea de recoger el corazón de madera con cicatrices de los acechadores de pantano de Meluinen y entregárselo a Thaliollang. Thaliollang se encuentra en Lin Giliath, las ruinas de los Elfos de Meluinen.","'Me duele ver a criaturas tan nobles tan retorcidas. Espero que mi investigación encuentre una manera de traer la paz a las criaturas; tienes mi agradecimiento.'","'He aprendido que muchos de los acechadores de pantano que habitan en Meluinen están retorcidos y doloridos. Aunque me duela decirlo, la única cura para ellos requiere que encontremos la fuente del dolor dentro de su duramen.'","Se necesita: Corazón de madera con cicatrices recogido de los acechadores de pantano que se encuentran en Meluinen.","Recoger corazón de madera con cicatrices (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entregar el corazón de madera con cicatrices a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath","Corazón de madera con cicatrices recogido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Corazón de madera con cicatrices"},
[4687]={"Recoger garras afiladas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar las garras afiladas a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath","Tienes la tarea de recoger garras afiladas de los enormes sapos que plagan Meluinen y entregárselas a Thaliollang. Thaliollang se encuentra en Lin Giliath, las ruinas de los Elfos de Meluinen.","Thaliollang en la ruina de los Elfos de Meluinen en Lin Giliath requiere la devolución de garras afiladas.","'Los sapos no son normales y necesitaban ser purgados. Gracias por tus esfuerzos.'","Se necesita: Garras afiladas de los enormes sapos que plagan Meluinen.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se necesita: Garras afiladas de los enormes sapos que plagan Meluinen. Entregue los artículos a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath.","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Garras afiladas","Garras afiladas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Debemos saber qué ha hecho que estos sapos crezcan tanto y qué les ha dado garras tan afiladas.'"},
[4688]={"Has aceptado la tarea de recoger suciedad sedosa de las arañas en las áreas que rodean Thorenhad. Los artículos deben ser entregados en una caja de recolección. Hay una caja de recolección en Thorenhad en el Bosque de los Trolls.","Los Elfos de Thorenhad te agradecen tus esfuerzos.","Se busca: Suciedad sedosa de las arañas que rodean Thorenhad. Los artículos deben ser entregados en una caja de recolección. Hay una caja de recolección en Thorenhad en el Bosque de los Trolls.","Recoger suciedad sedosa (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los Elfos de Thorenhad desean que se les entregue un cargamento de suciedad sedosa.","Se busca: Suciedad sedosa de las arañas que rodean Thorenhad.","Entregar la suciedad sedosa a la caja de recolección","Suciedad sedosa recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Suciedad sedosa","No has recuperado suficiente suciedad sedosa para los Elfos en Thorenhad."},
[4689]={"Has aceptado la tarea de recoger suciedad sedosa de los insectos que rodean Echad Candelleth. Debes entregar los artículos a Bainthir en el campamento o en una caja de recolección.","Recoger suciedad sedosa (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Una colección de suciedad sedosa de los insectos que rodean Echad Candelleth. Todos los artículos deben ser entregados a Bainthir en las ruinas.","'Sabed que esto se usará bien. Gracias.'","Entregar la suciedad sedosa a Bainthir en Echad Candelleth en el Bosque de los Trolls","'Los Hombres que están aquí necesitan lecciones, y yo necesito artículos que les enseñen tal lección. Si puedes recolectar la suciedad, los caparazones y la sustancia pegajosa de los insectos de la zona, sería una buena recuperación.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Suciedad sedosa recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Suciedad sedosa","Bainthir, un Elfo en el campamento de Echad Candelleth, está esperando una entrega de suciedad sedosa."},
[4690]={"Entregar las escamas lisas a Bainthir en Echad Candelleth en el Bosque de los Trolls","Se busca: Una colección de escamas lisas de los sierpes que rodean Echad Candelleth.","'Hay criaturas viles cerca y al otro lado del lecho del río que deben ser destruidas. Recoge las escamas y la piel de estas criaturas y entrégamelas.'","Recoger escamas lisas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bainthir, un Elfo en el campamento de Echad Candelleth, está esperando una entrega de escamas lisas.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger escamas lisas de los sierpes que rodean Echad Candelleth. Debes entregar los artículos a Bainthir en el campamento.","Se busca: Una colección de escamas lisas de los sierpes que rodean Echad Candelleth. Todos los artículos deben ser entregados a Bainthir en el campamento.","'Es bueno saber que estos han sido destruidos. Gracias.'","Escamas lisas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Escamas lisas"},
[4691]={"Has aceptado la tarea de recoger alas lisas de los pájaros en las áreas que rodean Thorenhad. Los artículos deben ser entregados en la caja de recolección en el puesto de avanzada.","Se busca: Alas lisas de los pájaros que rodean Thorenhad.","Se busca: Alas lisas de los pájaros que rodean Thorenhad. Todos los artículos deben ser entregados en la caja de recolección en el puesto de avanzada en el Bosque de los Trolls.","Los Elfos de Thorenhad desean que se les entregue un cargamento de alas lisas.","Recoger alas lisas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","No has recuperado suficientes alas lisas para los Elfos en Thorenhad.","Alas lisas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar las alas lisas a la caja de recolección en Thorenhad en el Bosque de los Trolls","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Alas lisas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."},
[4692]={"Thaliollang en la ruina de los Elfos de Meluinen en Lin Giliath requiere la devolución de caparazones resistentes.","'Deseo estudiar los efectos de la plaga que se arrastra hacia Meluinen desde el Poniente sobre los insectos y los acechadores de pantano. La plaga parece estar afectando más a sus caparazones.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se necesita: Caparazones resistentes de los insectos y acechadores de pantano de Meluinen.","Se necesita: Caparazones resistentes de los insectos y acechadores de pantano de Meluinen. Entregue los artículos a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath.","Recoger caparazones resistentes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar los caparazones resistentes a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Caparazones resistentes","Caparazones resistentes recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Estos servirán bien a mi propósito, gracias.'","Tienes la tarea de recoger caparazones resistentes de los acechadores de pantano e insectos que se encuentran en Meluinen y entregárselos a Thaliollang. Thaliollang se encuentra en Lin Giliath, las ruinas de los Elfos de Meluinen."},
[4693]={"Entregar las vainas de espada resistentes a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Vainas de espada resistentes","Se necesita: Vainas de espada resistentes de los orcos que plagan Meluinen.","'Es bueno ver que estás dispuesto a enfrentarte a los orcos. Agradecemos tu ayuda.'","Se necesita: Vainas de espada resistentes de los orcos que plagan Meluinen. Entregue los artículos a Thaliollang en Lin Giliath.","Recolecta vainas de espada resistentes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Thaliollang en la ruina de los Elfos de Meluinen en Lin Giliath requiere la devolución de vainas de espada resistentes.","Tienes la tarea de recoger vainas de espada resistentes de los orcos que plagan Meluinen y entregárselas a Thaliollang. Thaliollang se encuentra en Lin Giliath, las ruinas de los Elfos de Meluinen.","Vainas de espada resistentes recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los orcos que infestan el área de Meluinen deben ser rechazados, ¿puedes demostrarnos que estás ayudando en estos esfuerzos?'"},
[4694]={"Has aceptado la tarea de recoger picos muy afilados de los pájaros en las áreas que rodean Thorenhad. Los artículos deben ser entregados en la caja de recolección en el puesto de avanzada.","Recoger picos muy afilados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Picos muy afilados de los pájaros que rodean Thorenhad. Todos los artículos deben ser entregados en la caja de recolección en el puesto de avanzada en el Bosque de los Trolls.","No has recuperado suficientes picos muy afilados para los Elfos en Thorenhad.","Se busca: Picos muy afilados de los pájaros que rodean Thorenhad.","Picos muy afilados recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Los Elfos de Thorenhad desean que se les entregue un cargamento de picos muy afilados.","Entregar los picos muy afilados a la caja de recolección en Thorenhad en el Bosque de los Trolls","Tarea de los Elfos de Rivendel: Picos muy afilados"},
[4695]={"Destroyed Orkish catapults on the battlefield around Zudramdân (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Desperate to keep the Gabil'akkâ from drawing any nearer to Mount Gundabad, the Orcs have brought many siege engines onto the battlefield.","Destroyed Orkish ballistae on the battlefield around Zudramdân (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroyed Orkish trebuchets on the battlefield around Zudramdân (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Reithvald Red-ember","'If Gorgar has even half the cunning of his forebears, those siege engines will not be the last obstacles in our path. Even so, he cannot slow our advance forever!\
\
'You have done well, ${PLAYER}.'","Orkish ballistae, catapults, and trebuchets can be found on the battlefield around Zudramdân in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Reithvald Red-ember has tasked you with destroying the siege engines used by the Orcs of Gundabad.","Destroy Orkish ballistae on the battlefield around Zudramdân (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy Orkish trebuchets on the battlefield around Zudramdân (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Reithvald Red-ember can be found at Ifbar-athrâkh.\
\
You have destroyed many Orkish siege engines. You should report your success to Reithvald Red-ember.","Destroy Orkish catapults on the battlefield around Zudramdân (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Embedded in the Battlefield","'It is good to see you again, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'After hearing a number of reports from our scouts, I believe the Orcs' siege weapons are well-prepared to repel an assault on Zudramdân and the surrounding lands in Elderslade. The Gabil'akkâ would be undone if we pressed a direct attack, but I have seen a few of our dwarves gain ground against Gorgar's Orcs by... unusual means.\
\
'I am told you are a most clever ${RACE}, and so I have a task for you.\
\
'Find a way behind the Orcs' lines and destroy their siege engines. When that is done, report back to me!'"},
[4696]={"Talk to Darfin","'Hail, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'It was a long battle, but Zarkul-sulûn has been won for the Gabil'akkâ. However, the fires of battle still burn among our ranks... and too near to our supplies for my liking!\
\
'Would you aid me and douse some of the fires that still linger?'","Douse lingering fires at Zarkul-sulûn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fires can be found throughout Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
Darfin has asked you to douse lingering fires throughout Zarkul-sulûn.","'You have my thanks, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Zarkul-sulûn must not be allowed to fall to the Orcs!'","Embers of Battle","Darfin can be found at Zarkul-sulûn.\
\
You have doused many lingering fires at Zarkul-sulûn. You should report to Darfin.","Doused lingering fires at Zarkul-sulûn (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Although the Gabil'akkâ were able to win a foothold at Zarkul-sulûn, lingering fires from the battle endanger the dwarves and their supplies at Zarkul-sulûn."},
[4699]={"Los uruks de la Mano Blanca pueden encontrarse entre los trasgos y orcos que habitan en el Camino de Durin. Uno fue visto en Ninknakh Faltor, al norte de la Cámara de la Encrucijada. Otro en Gloku-ru, al noreste. El último fue avistado en el camino de Jazârgund hacia el Cruce de Durin, al noreste.\
\
Kalman te ha pedido que derrotes a los emisarios de la Mano Blanca.","Emisario derrotado en Gloku-ru","Emisario derrotado en el Cruce de Durin","Habla con Kalman en la entrada a Zirakzigil","Los exploradores enanos han avistado a un puñado de uruks de la Mano Blanca que han entrado de alguna forma en Moria, por caminos desconocidos. Parecen estar intentando aliarse con las tribus de trasgos del Camino de Durin.","'¡No debemos permitir que la Mano Blanca ponga bajo su mando a los trasgos de Moria!","Derrota al emisario en el Cruce de Durin","Derrota al emisario en Gloku-ru","Emisarios de la Mano Blanca","'Así que los emisarios de la Mano Blanca ya no están... y que no vuelvan. Nuestra única esperanza para con la situación actual es mantener a los trasgos desorganizados y animarlos a luchar entre ellos tanto como lo hacen contra nosotros.\
\
'¡La última cosa que necesitamos es que un líder fuerte se alce y los una a todos contra nosotros!'","'Los uruks de la Mano Blanca me tienen preocupado, ${PLAYER}. Están intentando aliar a los trasgos con los líderes del ejército de la Mano Blanca. ¡Aunque es algo bueno que los trasgos luchen entre ellos, no podemos permitir que ganen un punto de apoyo aquí, dentro de los límites de Khazad-dûm, cuando ya controlan fuerzas considerables fuera!\
\
'¡Necesito que des caza y derrotes a los emisarios de la Mano Blanca antes de que puedan convencer o intimidar a los trasgos para que se unan a ellos!\
\
'Mis exploradores han avistado a uno en el campamento trasgo de Ninknakh Faltor, otro en Gloku-ru y el tercero en el Cruce de Durin, entre aquí y Jazârgund.'","Derrota el emisario en Ninknakh Faltor","Derrota al emisario en Ninknakh Faltor","Kalman está en la Puerta de las Nubes, en el Camino de Durin.\
\
Deberías informar a Kalman de que los emisarios de la Mano Blanca que se encontraban en el Camino de Durin han sido derrotados."},
[4700]={"Shenzâmin raises his hand in greeting","The ruler of Jiret-menêsh is inside the fortress.","Shenzâmin is in the fortress of Jiret-menêsh.","Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, asked you to help her people deal with the creatures at either the gredbyg camp to the west or the worm camp to the east.","'Move along! There is nothing for you here!'\
\
Habâti spits onto the ground and places a hand on the hilt of his sword.\
\
'The sooner you return to the road and depart, the better it will be for all of you! Go now, and return not!'","'Thank you for your help getting this audience. We can now take it from here, and will convey Shâra Mizâdi's friendship and good wishes to the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh.\
\
'I am relieved to learn the impolite manner of the dwarf Habâti at Khanâg Valoyar was an exception and not the rule, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Travel safely, and I hope to see you again when our missions are complete, my friend!'","A Temámir dwarf with thunder in his eyes shouts at you to watch yourself","Talk to Shenzâmin at Khanâg Valoyar","Find Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, inside the fortress","'We continue northward to Jiret-menêsh. It would seem Dejemûl was correct about the relationship between dwarves and Men in An Shêru.'","Habâti glowers at you.","The entrance to Jiret-menêsh is along the road north of Khanâg Valoyar.","'Dejemûl may be right, but I hope to prove him wrong. Let us speak with the Temámir he mentioned at the khanâg nearby. The name of the Shâra may open doors for us that remained closed to Dejemûl.'","'Get out of here! There is nothing for you here! Move along!'","Shenzâmin is at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh.","Defeat gredbyg at the Slopes of Shâlahin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Dejemûl at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh","'I will hear the words of Renewed Hamât, but it is customary for such dignitaries to lend some assistance when they arrive, as a showing of good faith. Two such problems currently trouble my people: an infestation of gredbyg and a host of worms. Does Hamât intend to help us with these matters?'","'I will now listen to the words of the emissaries of Shâra Mizâdi of Renewed Hamât.'","Shenzâmin and Kishâtal agreed to meet you at the cross-roads south of Jiret-menêsh.","Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, is inside the fortress.","Talk to Shenzâmin in the fortress of Jiret-menêsh","Shenzâmin is at Khanâg Valoyar, bristling with anger at your treatment by the Temámir Habâti.","Talk to Kishâtal at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh","Find the entrance to Jiret-menêsh far north of Khanâg Valoyar","Collect misplaced axes at the Seething-wells (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'If this is the custom, we should see it done. I leave the choice to you, ${PLAYER}. The Temámir wish for us to help them deal with either the gredbyg or the worms? We will help them with both!\
\
'Choose the threat with which you will deal, and Kishâtal and I will handle the other. Each of these foes can be found outside Jiret-menêsh, to the east and to the west.'","'This insult cannot be allowed to stand! How dare this dwarf speak so to the emissaries of Renewed Hamât?'\
\
Shenzâmin shakes with fury, but before drawing his blade he draws a long, calming breath instead, visibly settling his rage.\
\
'The insulting manner of this Temámir has no bearing upon our mission, ${PLAYER}. He is not the leader of Jiret-menêsh, and he has no authority to treat with us. We speak with the voice of Shâra Mizâdi; he rules only this khanâg, and perhaps not even that!\
\
'We continue northward to Jiret-menêsh. It would seem Dejemûl was correct about the relationship between dwarves and Men in An Shêru.'","Dejemûl is at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh.","Meet up with Shenzâmin and Kishâtal at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh","Sierpes derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Shenzâmin at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh","'Dejemûl may be right, ${PLAYER}, but I hope to prove him wrong. Let us speak with the Temámir he mentioned at the khanâg nearby. The name of the Shâra may open doors for us that remained closed to Dejemûl.'","Shenzâmin is in the fortress of Jiret-menêsh, near Châmelek Gêta.","Defeat worms at the Seething-wells (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, listens as you introduce yourself and the Hamâti soldiers Kishâtal and Shenzâmin. You go on to relay your treatment at Khanâg Valoyar, and the dwarf-leader frowns.\
\
'This dwarf Habâti is not immediately known to me, but I have been most busy with affairs within Jiret-menêsh itself. The operation of distant outposts on the surface I leave to others.\
\
'I will hear the words of Renewed Hamât, but it is customary for such dignitaries to lend some assistance when they arrive, as a showing of good faith. Two such problems currently trouble my people: an infestation of gredbyg and a host of worms. Does Hamât intend to help us with these matters?'","You have found the grand entrance to Jiret-menêsh","Collected egg clusters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Habâti at Khanâg Valoyar","Shenzâmin stands here.","'I stopped first at the khanâg just over there, and the Temámir there insulted me and waved me along. If the others of his people behave as does he, you might as well save yourselves the walking. They will just turn you away, whether you were sent to them by a Shâr, a Hûl, or by any king or queen of Men!'","Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh, is at her throne within the fortress.","'Choose the threat with which you will deal, and Kishâtal and I will handle the other. Each of these foes can be found outside Jiret-menêsh, to the east and to the west.'","'Shâra Mizâdi has asked Kishâtal and I to treat with the Temámir who dwell in this land, that we may open lines of friendly communication between the dwarves and Renewed Hamât. Judging from the maps I have seen, there is a cross-road south of their settlement in An Shêru. Let us travel there and plan for our encounter with the Temámir.'","'I told your companions what I will tell you, stranger: the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh may not receive you with open arms; their relationship with Men is strained. They blame some long ago war with the kingdom of Nísaka for that, claiming the Men of that land tried to seize their mines. For all I know that could be true, but that was centuries ago!\
\
'What I do know is that I stopped first at the khanâg just over there, and one of the Temámir insulted me and waved me along. If the others of his people behave as does he, you might as well save yourselves the walking. They will just turn you away, whether you were sent to them by a Shâr, a Hûl, or by any king or queen of Men!'","Mizâdi entrusted her soldiers Shenzâmin and Kishâtal to meet with the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh, and they will not let her down.","Emissaries to Jiret-menêsh","Collect egg clusters at the Slopes of Shâlahin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Châmelek Gêta smiles magnanimously at you.\
\
'Very good, very good! I have been informed of your work on behalf of the Temámir of Jiret-menêsh, and will now listen to the words of the emissaries of Shâra Mizâdi of Renewed Hamât.'","Shenzâmin suggested that you first visit Khanâg Valoyar before you go to Jiret-menêsh.","The Temámir dwarf Habâti at Khanâg Valoyar has accosted you with shouted insults.","Talk to Châmelek Gêta, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh","Gredbyg derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Kishâtal at the cross-road south of Jiret-menêsh has listened to the merchant's words and wants to speak to you.","Visit Khanâg Valoyar before you go to Jiret-menêsh","Collected misplaced axes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","If fortune is with you, the ruler of Jiret-menêsh will be more polite than Habâti","'Before we make our way to Jiret-menêsh we should speak with this man Dejemûl. He is a merchant, and he says the Temámir may not welcome us, despite our authority to speak on behalf of Shâra Mizâdi!'","'Jiret-menêsh, the settlement of the Temámir in An Shêru, is to the north. But before we make our way there we should speak with this man Dejemûl. He is a merchant, and he says the Temámir may not welcome us, despite our authority to speak on behalf of Shâra Mizâdi!'","'Shâra Mizâdi has brought great strength of arms into Mûr Ghala to oppose the Empire of Ordâkh, but when the fighting is done she will need to ensure a good relationship with the powers who remain.\
\
'She has asked Kishâtal and I to treat with the Temámir who dwell in this land, that we may open lines of friendly communication between the dwarves and Renewed Hamât. Judging from the maps I have seen, there is a cross-road south of their settlement in An Shêru. Let us travel there and plan for our encounter with the Temámir.'"},
[4701]={"Defeated the Rogmul Emissary","Defeat the Rogmul Emissary","Defeat foes in Fushaum Tûm (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated foes in Fushaum Tûm (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I did not believe my own eyes when I saw a nameless creature of flame enter Fushaum Tûm. It must be another one of these emissaries from Nargroth that I have heard about. We can not let Fushaum Tûm and Nargroth join forces. It would spell doom for the Gondorian presence here.'","Ingold has asked you to defeat the Rogmul Emissary visiting Fushaum Tûm and to defeat those who may be persuaded by the Nameless creature.","A notice is pinned to the board, signed by Ingold:\
\
'An emissary from Nargroth has been spotted in Fushaum Tûm. A brave adventurer is needed to defeat the Rogmul emissary and those of Fushaum Tûm.'","Emissary of Flame","Ingold, a soldier of Gondor, has scouted Dor Amarth and is concerned with the growing numbers of foes gathering at the encampment of Fushaum Tûm."},
[4702]={"'El texto que has recuperado habla de una alianza entre Angmar y los trasgos de la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Se rumorea que Angmar y la Ciudad de los Trasgos han tenido problemas para entablar tratos en el pasado. Es extraño encontrar a los trasgos aquí. Quizás este emisario esté aquí sin el conocimiento de sus líderes.\
\
'Deberías investigar el asunto. Hay muchos informes de trasgos cerca de la torre de Minas Maur, cerca de Barad Gularan. Debemos impedir que esta alianza suceda, sin importar el costo.\
\
'Derrota al emisario y regresa a verme cuando la tarea esté hecha. Si quieres tener éxito, probablemente quieras llevar aliados contigo.'","Entra en Minas Maur y derrota al emisario de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","Minas Maur es una de las grandes torres de Barad Gularan, al sur de Gath Forthnir.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gularan y derrotar al emisario de la Ciudad de los Trasgos dentro de Minas Maur. Brúnfair te sugirió que llevaras aliados contigo.","La Ciudad de los Trasgos ha enviado un emisario a Minas Maur para negociar con Angmar.","'Debes derrotar al trasgo Prakhum y detener la alianza entre la Corona de Hierro y los trasgos de las Montañas Nubladas.'","'¡Has ayudado a los Pueblos Libres a evitar la más terrible de las amenazas! Una alianza entre los trasgos de las Montañas Nubladas y la Corona de Hierro habría sido desastrosa!'","Gath Forthnir está al norte de Barad Gularan.\
\
Habiendo derrotado a Prakhum, regresa a Gath Forthnir y avisa a Brúnfair sobre lo que has hecho.","Emisario de la Ciudad de los Trasgos"},
[4703]={"'Laugi Lenguadorada debe ser derrotado, o bien la Corona de Hierro y los Duramano forjarán una alianza más fuerte.'","Brúnfair está en Gath Forthnir, al norte de Barad Gularan.\
\
Habiendo derrotado a Laugi Lenguadorada, debes regresar a Brúnfair y contarle sobre tu éxito.","'El texto que has recuperado habla de una alianza entre Angmar y los Duramano. Nuestros exploradores nos han informado que un emisario de los Duramano ha venido a negociar con Angmar.\
\
'Deberías investigar el asunto. Hay muchos informes de enanos cerca de la torre de Minas Angos, cerca de Barad Gularan. Debemos impedir que esta alianza suceda, sin importar el costo.\
\
'Derrota al emisario, Laugi Lenguadorada, luego regresa a verme cuando la tarea esté hecha. Si quieres tener éxito, deberías llevar aliados contigo.'","Habiendo descubierto un juramento de los Duramano, debes entrar en Minas Angos y derrotar a su emisario para detener una alianza entre ellos y la Corona de Hierro.","Entra en Minas Angos y derrota al emisario de los Duramano.","'La caída del emisario de los Duramano seguramente pondrá fin a la alianza entre estas dos fuerzas del mal. Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}.'","Emisario de los Duramano","Minas Angos es una torre en Barad Gularan, al sur de Gath Forthnir.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gularan y derrotar a Laugi Lenguadorada , el emisario de los Duramano, dentro de Minas Angos. Brúnfair te sugirió que llevaras aliados."},
[4704]={"'Aye, he's a dwarf all right. Not that I doubted you, ${PLAYER}, but I am just as surprised as you to find dwarves here in Mordor!\
\
'The Stout-axes... I must admit, I have many questions I wish to ask about the early years of their folk and how they came to dwell here. There is so much to be learned from them! Even if they toiled under the Dark Lord, I'd wager they're still a better lot than the Dourhands.\
\
'See, Legolas? It's not like he's got evil eyes painted all over him!\
\
'I think it's time we properly introduce ourselves, wouldn't you say?'","Emissary of the Stout-axes","Gimli can be found at his camp-site within Dor Amarth.\
\
Spakorth has told the tale of his people's enslavement by a Black Númenórean and how the House that belonged to his ancestors was slowly brought to ruin by Sauron. You should speak to Gimli about what is to be done.","'Gimli seems a fine dwarf, and I am glad to have met him. He has many questions, and I am pleased to say that I can provide him many of the answers he seeks. If there is time enough, I have questions of my own!\
\
'We Stout-axes hold little sway in Mordor, but we dwell in peace within the Flaming Spire under the rule of Mistress Zôreth. We are no Dwarf-kingdom of old, but we are not so few as to be forgotten in this land -- for even Sauron could not forget us!\
\
'If you or Gimli wish it, you are welcome to visit our home in Lûghash - provided the Mistress does not find out, of course.\
\
'Hah! But if she didn't know you were there....'","Talk to Spakorth at Blozronk","Talk to Gimli at Blozronk","Gimli can be found at the ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth.\
\
Spakorth of the Stout-axes has offered to treat with Gimli at Blozronk. You should return to Gimli and Legolas.","Talk to Gimli at the ruins of Díngarth","'It has been long since my folk last spoke to outsiders... especially those with the might to bring him low.\
\
'For what purpose have you come to these lands? To liberate its peoples? Conquest? I suppose it does not matter now. You are here, and so that is that! The Deathless may not see it so, but their quarrels are their own!\
\
'I must ask... in your vast armies, were there any dwarves? We have seen naught of our kin and cousins in the lands beyond Mordor since the early days of our folk in the mountains to the East, and I would be gladdened to learn that we are not the last dwarves in this realm.'\
\
You tell Spakorth of Gimli and of the House of Durin's Folk.\
\
'Ah! So one of my kin has come to these lands? If he so wishes it, I would much desire to meet him!\
\
'Tell this Gimli of the Stout-axes of Mordor! If he wishes to meet with me, I would have us forge a new peace free of Sauron's influence.\
\
'Go! I shall wait here for a time, and if you do not return, I shall honour his choice.'","Spakorth can be found at Blozronk in Dor Amarth.\
\
Gimli and Legolas have discussed their concerns, but Gimli appears eager to help the Dwarves of Lûghash despite Legolas's reticence. You should now speak to Spakorth and learn how best to aid his folk.","After encountering the Stout-axe Dwarves of Mordor, Legolas and Gimli hope to establish peace with this long-lost House.","'You found them after all, ${PLAYER}? Oh ho! Tell me of them!'\
\
You tell Gimli of the Stout-axe Dwarves of Mordor and of their origins in the mountains to the East. You also mention that Spakorth has asked to meet with Gimli at the muddied cistern of Blozronk to the east.\
\
'Stout-axe Dwarves? I have never heard of a House by that name in all my years. Perhaps it was a name given to them by the Dark Lord, or their line was broken...'\
\
Gimli appears initially perplexed by this news, but a wave of merriment soon washes over his face.\
\
'Still, they did you no harm, so I shall hear this Spakorth's words.'\
\
Legolas lets out a stern cough.\
\
'Oh, you think they're up to something, do you? Well, for all I know of them, they might well be. Why don't you come along too, Legolas?\
\
'Let us go to Blozronk, ${PLAYER}. Lead the way!'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You will swiftly travel to Blozronk when you continue this quest.</rgb>"},
[4705]={"Emisario de los Trev Duvárdain","Minas Agar se encuentra en el lado occidental de Barad Gularan, al sur de Gath Forthnir.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gularan y derrotar a Karstíona, el emisario de los Trev Duvárdain, dentro de Minas Agar.","'¡De todas las alianzas que la Corona de Hierro podría haber forjado, esta era la más terrible. Si hubieran prestado un mayor apoyo a los Trev Duvardain, nuestros esfuerzos aquí habrían sido en vano.\
\
'¡Bien hecho!'","Brúnfair está en Gath Forthnir, al norte de Barad Gularan.\
\
Habiendo derrotado a Karstíona, debes regresar a Brúnfair y contarle sobre tu éxito.","Los Trev Duvardain han enviado un emisario a Minas Agar para negociar con los sirvientes de la Corona de Hierro.","'Karstíona debe ser derrotada y la alianza entre la Corona de Hierro y los Montañeses destruida.'","'El texto que has recuperado habla de una alianza entre Angmar y los Trev Duvardain. He realizado algunas investigaciones y he descubierto que Domongart ha enviado un emisario para negociar con Angmar. \
\
'Deberías investigar el asunto. Hay muchos informes de Montañeses de la tribu de los Trev Duvardain cerca de la torre de Minas Agar, cerca de Barad Gularan. Debemos impedir que esta alianza suceda, sin importar el costo.\
\
'Derrota a Karstíona, el emisario, luego regresa a verme. Si deseas entrar en Minas Agar, te sugiero que lleves aliados confiables contigo.'","Entra en Minas Agar y derrota a Karstíona"},
[4706]={"Habiendo interceptado una promesa de Saruman de Isengard, debes entrar en Minas Caul y derrotar a su emisario para detener una alianza entre la Corona de Hierro y la Mano Blanca.","Bâlak derrotado","'El texto que has recuperado habla de una alianza entre Angmar y Saruman. He investigado el asunto y he descubierto que la Mano Blanca ha enviado un emisario para negociar con Angmar.\
\
'Como resultado, hay muchos informes de Orcos reuniéndose cerca de la torre de Minas Caul, cerca de Barad Gúlaran. Debemos impedir que esta alianza suceda, sin importar el costo.\
\
'Derrota al emisario, el semiorco Bâlak, y regresa a verme cuando la tarea esté hecha. ¡Querrás llevar aliados si quieres tener éxito!'","'¡Has ayudado a los Pueblos Libres a evitar la peor de las amenazas en el Norte! Una alianza de esta magnitud ciertamente habría significado la caída de Eriador.\
\
'Gracias por ayudarnos a repeler el mal en este día.'","Brúnfair está en Gath Forthnir, al norte de Barad Gularan.\
\
Habiendo derrotado a Bâlak, debes regresar a Gath Forthnir y decirle a Brúnfair que has cumplido la tarea.","'Debes derrotar a Bâlak y evitar que la Mano Blanca se alíe con la Corona de Hierro.'","Entra en Minas Caul y derrota a Bâlak.","Minas Caul es una de las grandes torres de Barad Gularan, al sur de Gath Forthnir.\
\
Debes viajar a Barad Gularan y desafiar a Bâlak, el emisario de la Mano Blanca, dentro de Minas Caul.","Emisario de la Mano Blanca"},
[4707]={"The occupants of this shelter left no trace of their whereabouts","The quiet here is oppressive, as if not a breath stirs for leagues","'Interesting. There are no signs of the enemy in town, but something scared these people off.\
\
'I would like to know more.'","Cyneberg is at Dunfast.\
\
You should tell Cyneberg what you found.","This home is colder and draughtier than the others...","The village of Dunfast is in the centre of the Whitshaws.\
\
You should examine Dunfast for clues as to why it is empty.","Explore Dunfast (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Apparently a violent scuffle broke out in this home","A mess was left here, as if belongings were hastily gathered","Vacío","This barn is empty; even the horses are gone","Return to Cyneberg","You and Cyneberg have come to the village of Dunfast, but it is empty....","'Here we are, and here is Dunfast... but where is everyone?\
\
'Let us have a look around. I can see no sign of, well... anything.'","Explore Dunfast","It is clear that supplies were gathered before this shelter was abandoned","The lock has been broken right off this door, as if entry was forced","This satchel has been abandoned in the middle of the floor"},
[4708]={"Empty chairs can be found in the rear of the Mead Hall of Middlemead.\
\
You have gathered the keepsakes of Thane Mágla's councilmen. You should continue to place them at Mágla's side.","Thane Mágla can be found in the Mead Hall of Middlemead.","Empty chairs can be found in the rear of the Mead Hall of Middlemead.\
\
You have gathered the keepsakes of Thane Mágla's councilmen. You should now return them to Mágla's side.","'My council... is gone. Each of them has fallen to disease or blade, and now none remain to dissuade me from the truth.\
\
'This war is over, ${PLAYER}, even though others cannot see this. We merely delay our deaths, and no matter where we choose to hide, the White Hand will find us.\
\
'My men would sit amongst me here as we talked of strategy and glory... Bah! What glory is there now?\
\
'If you would, travel to my home. I have left keepsakes from each of my men at my bedside. Bring them here, and they can join Egbalth's horn at my side one last time.'","Empty Chairs","Placed the sword","Thane Mágla's home can be found directly to the south-east of the Mead Hall in Middlemead.\
\
Thane Mágla has asked that you gather keepsakes from his bedside and return them to him, so his council might gather once last time.","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}...\
\
'My council has again rallied at my command, but for all your effort, they have nothing left to say.'\
\
Mágla's eyes glaze over as he glances fruitlessly to the chairs at his side.","Talk to Thane Mágla","Place the horseshoe at Mágla's side","'Have you gathered the keepsakes of my men?'","Collect keepsakes of Mágla's councilmen (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Placed the horn","Place the horn at Mágla's side","Placed the shield","Collected keepsakes of Mágla's councilmen (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Heartbroken to learn the last of his council was slain, Thane Mágla wishes to sit amongst his men once more before the war's end.","Place the shield at Mágla's side","Place the sword at Mágla's side","Placed the horseshoe"},
[4710]={"El pescado que Nôra necesita puede encontrarse en la bahía de hielo al oeste del campamento de Olavi.\
\
Olavi te ha pedido que recojas una de sus cañas de pescar y consigas el pescado que Nôra necesita.","La despensa comunal de Sûri-kylä está agotándose, debido a los difíciles tiempos que corren en Forochel.","'¿Ya has conseguido el pescado? El único lugar donde seguramente consigas encontrar ese pescado el particular es al oeste de aquí en la costa de la bahía.'","'¿Nôra te ha enviado a por más pescado? Eso podría ser difícil.\
\
'Se me ha negado el acceso a la costa, tanto por los Rauta-väki como por los kantâ que han llegado a la zona. He sido completamente incapaz de pescar, pero parece que tienes buena mano y paciencia inquebrantable... quizá puedas ir a pescar por mí.\
\
'Toma una caña de pescar y ve a la costa de la bahía de hielo al oeste de aquí: ahí es donde el pescado concreto que Nôra suele buscar abunda.'","'¡El pescado! Espero que no te haya dado muchos problemas. Sé cómo es Olavi en lo referente al pescado.'","Despensa vacía","Nôra está en Sûri-kylä.\
\
Has conseguido el pescado donde Olavi te dijo que fueras. Ahora debes llevárselo a Nôra, que se encuentra en Sûri-kylä.","'Este pescado servirá. Llévaselos a Nôra. Está en Sûri-kylä, al norte de aquí. ¡Llévale el pescado antes de que se eche a perder!'","Atrapa pescado graso (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva el pescado a Nôra","Encontrarás a Olavi al este y ligeramente al sur de Sûri-kylä en su campamento de pesca junto al camino de Itä-mâ.\
\
Nôra te ha pedido que le digas a Olavi que le lleve tantos cubos de pescado seco como pueda.","'¿Has llevado ya mi mensaje a Olavi? Está hacia el este y ligeramente al sur de Sûri-kylä en su campamento de pesca junto al camino de Itä-mâ.'","Pescado graso atrapado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'${RACE}, ¿buscas ayudar a los Lumi-väki? Entonces me ayudarás.\
\
'Debido a estos tiempos difíciles, nuestras despensas se están quedando sin pescado seco, y necesitamos más. ¿Podrías ir a hablar con Olavi y decirle que me traiga tantos cubos como pueda?\
\
'Encontrarás a Olavi al este y ligeramente al sur de Sûri-kylä en su campamento de pesca junto al camino a Itä-mâ.'","Habla con Olavi","'Espero que conseguir el pescado no te diera muchos problemas. Sé cómo es Olavi en lo referente al pescado.'"},
[4713]={"Repair rotting scaffold (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak to Lhossil","Lhossil can be found in Dol Amroth.\
\
Lhossil will be pleased to hear the scaffold has been shored up.","Repaired rotting scaffold (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Once we are rid of these Corsairs we'll need to go in and do a proper job of replacing them fully. For now, spot fixes like this will have to do.'","'The caves within Emyn Ernil don't simply support themselves, they are held up by networks of scaffolding. This scaffolding is decades old and surely has started to rot and fail. If it does, the entire cave will come collapsing down and anything of value within will be lost.\
\
'While we cannot replace all of the scaffolding, we can do some spot repairs on some of the worst areas. Look around in the cave for scaffolding that appears particularly bad and shore it up.'","The scaffolding holding up the ceiling of the large cave in Emyn Ernil is old and rotting.","Emyn Ernil Cave - Shaky Scaffolds","Rotting scaffolding may be found in the large cave beneath Emyn Ernil.\
\
Lhossil asked you to venture beneath Emyn Ernil and repair some of the scaffold within that is rotting away."},
[4715]={"Deep-claws are digging in the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil.\
\
Gelloth asked you to defeat the deep-claws that are threatening to collapse the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil.","Defeat deep-claw diggers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gelloth can be found in Dol Amroth.\
\
Gelloth will be very pleased to hear the tunnels are safe from collapse.","'I am sure there are more down there sleeping, waiting to be awoken. But for now, the tunnels should be safe.'","Defeated deep-claw diggers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Emyn Ernil Tunnels - Claws of the Deep","Speak to Gelloth","'The Corsairs know not what trouble they awaken, nor do I think they care. Their explorations of the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil have awoken several beasts from the depths, deep-claws. Large lumbering creatures that, when awake, serve only to dig.\
\
'We cannot allow the tunnels to collapse from their work. The deep-claws must be stopped so we can continue to search and recover whatever of value is beneath. Head into the tunnels and defeat the creatures.'","The Corsair intrusion has awoken the deep-claws beneath Emyn Ernil, threatening the stability of the tunnels."},
[4718]={"'Any map of the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil has long since been lost. That makes exploration a dangerous endeavour. The tunnels are a maze of twists and turns, intersections and dead-ends. It is easy to find yourself suddenly turned around and lost.\
\
'There are beams to be found amongst the scaffolding holding most of the tunnels up. As you descend, mark the beams you come across. This will help others who follow in your stead to map their route and find their way back out.'","Emyn Ernil Tunnels - Twists and Turns","The tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil are a maze of twists and turns.","Marked posts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak to Gelloth","Mark posts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Posts can be found in the tunnels beneath Emyn Ernil.\
\
Gelloth asked you to venture beneath Emyn Ernil and mark the posts throughout the tunnels to aid in navigation.","Gelloth can be found in Dol Amroth.\
\
Gelloth will be pleased to hear the posts have been marked.","'Hopefully that will lead to fewer lost explorers over the next several days.'"},
[4719]={"'Has hecho un gran servicio a Eregion, ${PLAYER}.'","Habla con Tinúriel en Echad Dúnann","Plagas de Emyn Naer","Gusanos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los gusanos pueden encontrarse por todo Emyn Naer, al suroeste de Echad Dúnann.'","'Aunque no serán completamente destruidos mientras la corrupción de Saruman permanezca en Eregion, has aliviado la carga sobre la tierra.'","Derrota a los gusanos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Una plaga de gusanos ha sido motivo de preocupación para los Elfos de Echad Dúnann.","'Aunque el más pequeño de los gusanos tiene su lugar en la Tierra Media, parece que la corrupción de Saruman puede alcanzar tanto a los grandes como a los pequeños.\
\
'Los gusanos de Emyn Naer se han estado alimentando de la carne corrupta de los asesinatos sin sentido de los sirvientes de Saruman. Se han vuelto pesados con la carne vil, y ya no se alimentan solo de los restos de los muertos, sino que se les ha visto festinando con los vivos.\
\
'Esta plaga debe ser erradicada, ${PLAYER}. Los gusanos pueden encontrarse por todo Emyn Naer, al suroeste de Echad Dúnann.'","Tinúriel está en Echad Dúnann, al noreste de Emyn Naer.\
\
Debes regresar de inmediato a Tinúriel e informarle de tu éxito.","Los gusanos pueden encontrarse en Emyn Naer, al suroeste de Echad Dúnann.\
\
Tinúriel te ha pedido que elimines a los corruptos gusanos de Emyn Naer."},
[4723]={"Habla con Âtos","Kalpa-kita derrotados en Itä-mâ (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota kalpa-kita en Itä-mâ (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Parece que, por el momento, nuestros guardias podrán encargarse de los kalpa-kita restantes. ¡Esta noche celebraremos un festín!\
\
'No hay forma de que puedan lanzar otro ataque al menos durante algunos días.'","'Los kalpa-kita deben aprender a temer a los Lumi-väki. Sé su maestro…'","Los kalpa-kita pueden encontrarse por toda la tundra de Itä-mâ.\
\
Âtos te ha pedido que ayudes a purgar Itä-mâ de la plaga de los kalpa-kita.","Âtos se encuentra en Pynti-leiri.\
\
Ahora que has derrotado a muchos kalpa-kita, deberías regresar con Âtos.","Los kalpa-kita han ido adentrándose poco a poco en territorio lossoth y ahora empiezan a lanzar pequeñas incursiones contra los puestos avanzados de los Lossoth prácticamente cada noche.","La amenaza de los kalpa-kita","'¡Increíble! ¿Cómo han podido presionar de nuevo contra nuestro campamento? Desde hace muchos meses, los kalpa-kita se adentran en Itä-mâ, cazando a las pequeñas criaturas que buscan refugio cerca de nuestro puesto avanzado. A medida que sus presas escasean, se acercan cada vez más a nosotros. Los vigilamos sin descanso, pero sus pellejos son blancos como la nieve y saben permanecer inmóviles cuando acechan.\
\
'Anoche nos atacaron, y ha llegado el momento de que comprendan el precio de enfrentarse a los Lumi-väki.\
\
'Hazlos huir como las bestias salvajes que son. Encuentra a los kalpa-kita por toda Itä-mâ y haz que lamenten el día en que llegaron aquí.'"},
[4724]={"Defeat Spiders (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have defeated many Spiders in Western Osgiliath.","Encroaching Spiders","Defeated Spider (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Edenos has tasked you with defeating encroaching spiders from the Morgul Vale that have recently crossed the river.","You have defeated many Spiders thus making the Western side of the city a safer place to defend against the enemy.","Spiders can be found on the Western side of Osgiliath.\
\
You should defeat the encroaching Spiders.","'Spiders from the East have marched into the city, most likely under command of the Morgul army. It seems they found a way to cross the river.\
\
'I'm sending you out there to kill any of those creatures you can find. I don't need those beasts ambushing my soldiers.'"},
[4725]={"Esgaroth-of-old can be found east of Loeglond, on the Long Lake.\
\
You should travel to Esgaroth-of-old.","Talk to Mervárth","One last thing must be done to make the trading routes safe. Esgaroth-of-old, the ruins of the previous Lake-town, must be cleared of brigands.","Encroaching on Esgaroth","Travel to Esgaroth-of-old","Mervárth is standing guard outside Esgaroth-of-old.\
\
You should talk to Mervárth.","A man standing nearby whistles at you and beckons you over","'Esgaroth-of-old, the charred ruins of Lake-town that was, has been invaded by smugglers. They have been known to mix their ill-gotten goods in with honest shipments as they pass by. As if that were not enough, one of my raft-elves has been kidnapped! Please, you must intervene before something terrible befalls him!'","'Who are you, then? State your business here!'\
\
You tell him you aim to clear out the smugglers and rescue the raft-elf. He looks you over, and then his demeanor suddenly changes.\
\
'Listen, I am not your enemy. I am Mervárth, Market-ward from the Lake-town Council of Wares. I've disguised myself to see what these smugglers are up to in Esgaroth. Nothing good, of course.'"},
[4726]={"'It is good that you have come to us, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'The war has brought few ills to the people of Malbarth, but with each passing day, we seem drawn closer to the invasion on the coast. Men lurk in the trees... just beyond our sight. In the dark of this morn, I slew one attempting to pillage my home and where there is one Corsair, there shall always be more.\
\
'We are not weak folk, traveller, but we are few. If you would aid us in driving them back for even one day more, we would all be thankful.'","Defeat Corsair scouts near Malbarth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Melawen can be found in Malbarth in north-western Lebennin.\
\
You have defeated many Corsair scouts and should now return to Melawen.","Talk to Melawen","A scouting force of Corsairs has been lurking nearby the small settlement of Malbarth and seeks to pillage and overpower the few people that dwell there.","Corsair scouts can be found on the outskirts of Malbarth in north-western Lebennin.\
\
Melawen has asked you to search for and defeat any Corsair scouts encroaching on Malbarth.","Encroaching on the Sisters' Lands","Defeated Corsair scouts near Malbarth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","DNT -- will not be seen","'I am grateful you have driven them back once more, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'We enjoy a peace here that few others in Lebennin can claim in these dark times, and through your aid, we shall be free of those raiders for another day.'"},
[4727]={"Hemos recibido noticias preocupantes, ${PLAYER}. Parece que Dolvaethor, uno de los tenientes Númenóreanos negros de Amarthiel, ha entrado en Haudh Valandil. No se me ocurre ninguna buena razón para que Dolvaethor entre en la tumba, ¡pero sí muchas terribles!\
\
Lo que quiera que Dolvaethor planea en las profundidades del sabio Valandil, debe ser detenido. Debes encargarte de esto, ${PLAYER}. Abrirte paso por el puente de Ariant hacia la isla en la que Ost Elendil y Haudh Valandil se encuentran será terible, pero los Dúnedain carecen de la fuerza necesaria para esta tarea. Tus aliados y tú, sin embargo, podríais ser capaces de abriros paso.\
\
Una vez hayas derrotado a Dolvaethor en Haudh Valandil, pon remedio a cualquier daño que haya causado y vuelve a mí. Si el curso de la batalla me ha reclamado a otro lugar, habla con el capitán general Daerdan en Echad Garthadir.","Dolvaethor está en el interior de Haudh Valandil en la isla donde se encuentra Ost Elendil, más llá del puente de Ariant, en Annúminas.\
\
Glangilith te ha pedido que derrotes a Dolvaethor y pongas fin a sus malvados planes en Haudh Valandil.","Termina con la amenaza de Dolvaethor","Devuelve la paz a los restos de Valandil","Valandil está de nuevo en paz."},
[4729]={"'You will find the Wintersebb-drakes north of here in the land called Arador's end. Seek out and destroy the drakes and drakelings you find there. A word of caution, friend: you will not want to venture there alone.'","Far to the north, where the Isendeep Mine runs beneath the shadow of the Mountains of Angmar, a brood of Drakes threatens the workers within the mine.","Return to Lieutenant Swithulf at the Grimwood Lumber Camp","'A great victory is earned this day, and it is by your hand that it has been gained. You have proven your worth to the Free Peoples and deserve this reward for your efforts. \
\
'Should you wish to claim your ultimate prize, seek out Quartermaster Ash at Glân Vraig. \
\
'You have earned your honour well, ${PLAYER}.'","Lieutenant Swithulf awaits your return at the Grimwood Lumber-yard.\
\
Climbing high into the foothills of the Mountains of Angmar in Arador's end, you faced down many foes from the Wintersebb-brood and emerged to collect your reward.","'In the north, at the edge of the Mountains of Angmar, there are drakes the Hobbits of Hoarhallow call Wintersebb. So named for their trek down the mountain when the winter breaks and the Hoardale flows strong again.\
\
'These drakes have become active since the arrival of the Free Peoples, and often they hamper our efforts to mine the Isendeep. We are in need of help culling their number to ensure that our efforts there go smoothly.\
\
'If you are willing, gather allies and make your way north to confront the Wintersebb brood.'","End of the Wintersebb","Wintersebb-drakes can be found north in the area of Arador's End.\
\
Lieutenant Swithulf directed you to make your way north with others in search of a way to destroy the Wintersebb-drakes."},
[4730]={"'¿Mi Dírdrë está a salvo? ¡Oh, gracias! ¡Gracias, valiente ${PLAYERNAME:forastero[m]|forastera[f]}!'","Éa está en Tármunn Súrsa, cerca de Carn Dûm.\
\
Has devuelto a Dírdrë con los Montaraces. Deberías hablar con Éa, su madre, de inmediato.","Has encontrado a Dírdrë, hija de Éa, viva y a salvo.","Escolta a Dírdrë a un lugar seguro","Éa está en Tármunn Súrsa, cerca de Carn Dûm.\
\
Dírdrë te ha pedido ayuda para regresar con su madre, Éa.","Has escoltado a Dírdrë a un lugar seguro","Fin de la pesadilla","'No puedo creer que alguien haya venido en mi ayuda. Pensé que esta pesadilla nunca terminaría. Mi madre es Éa, ¿quizás hayas oído hablar de ella? Ha pasado tanto tiempo sin mis seres queridos.\
\
'Por favor, ayúdame a regresar con ella. Temo que no pueda volver sola.'"},
[4731]={"'Así que está hecho. No devolverá la vida a los caídos, pero tal vez me dé paz saber que mi pueblo ha sido vengado.'","El fin del terror","Has derrotado a muchos orcos en Urugarth, pero tu tarea aún no está completa. El líder uruk sigue en pie.","'Entra en Urugarth y derrota a su general.'","Donaith está en Gath Forthnír, al este de Urugarth.\
\
Deberías regresar a Gath Forthnír y contarle a Donaith la buena noticia de tu victoria.","'Los uruks son criaturas detestables y viciosas, sin pizca de honor ni valor... solo una furia irracional y sed de sangre.\
\
'Su general no es diferente, salvo por el fervor de su odio. Sirve a la Corona de Hierro sin cuestionar y lidera su ejército en batalla sin piedad. Derrótalo y demostrarás tu valía.\
\
'Lo encontrarás en las profundidades de Urugarth, al oeste.'","El líder del ejército orco reside en las profundidades de Urugarth, al oeste de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Donaith te habló de un poderoso general uruk que debe ser derrotado."},
[4732]={"Las sierpes que infestan las ruinas de Fornost están liderados por un anciano al que los orcos llaman Gajarpan. Hay que destruir a Gajarpan si queremos expulsar a las sierpes de Fornost.","Erl Pescador está en el campamento de los cazatesoros de las ruinas de Fornost.\
\
Deberías hablar con Erl Pescador.","Derrota a Gajarpan","Acabando con el anciano","'¡Muy bien hecho, ${RACE}! No es pequeña hazaña.'","'Elsie odia a todas esas sierpes, pero déjame decirte que Gajarpan es el peor de todos. Oimos a los orcos una noche susurrar... Asustados de acercarse demasiado. No quería que Gajarpan se los comiera.\
\
'No he visto a la gran sierpe, pero debe ser terrible para asustar así a esos orcos.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Se recomienda una compañía pequeña.</rgb>","Vuelve junto a Erl Pescador","Has derrotado a Gajarpan","Puedes encontrar a Gajarpan muy al norte del campamento de los cazatesoros.\
\
Erl Pescador te ha pedido que mates a Gajarpan, el más viejo y terrible de las sierpes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Se recomienda una compañía pequeña.</rgb>"},
[4733]={"There is great rumour about the Abominations stealing children, and they also have been attacking Lhan Rhos.","'We must put an end to the Abominations, once and for all. They are naught but an evil hindrance. We also need to discover if there is any evidence that these truly are created by Saruman himself. If so, then the situation is much graver than we had feared.\
\
'Come with us. We attack at night and will destroy these Abominations once and for all.\
\
'Speak with me when you are ready to depart.'","'You did well, ${PLAYER}. The important part is that we found evidence that Saruman is behind the creation of these Abominations. The Elders must call Assembly and unite the Avanc-lûth!\
\
'We will meet you there as soon as we prepare our camp. Thank you for all of your help.'","Talk to Blaire at the Boar-clan encampment","Talk to Blaire when you are ready to leave for Lhan Colvarn","Blaire is at the Boar-clan encampment, south of Lhan Colvarn.\
\
Blaire has asked you to accompany him to Lhan Colvarn for a night raid.","Blaire is at the Boar-clan encampment, south of Lhan Colvarn.\
\
You should talk to Blaire now that you have ended the Abomination threat.","'Are you ready to end the terror of the Abominations and defeat their leader? Knotfist will be in the cellar of the largest hut. He rarely shows his face.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: This is a solo instance and cannot be completed in a fellowship.</rgb>","Ending the Nightmare"},
[4734]={"Tended to wounded soldiers (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Wounded soldiers can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should tend to the wounded soldiers.","Enduring The War","Círdan can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should talk to Círdan.","Gather salves (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Círdan","Salves can be found in Díngarth.\
\
You should gather salves for wounded soldiers.","'Did your skill at healing prove up to the challenge, and the wounded begin to recover? Good. I am glad to hear their injuries fade and their spirits improve. Let not this gift of yours go to waste during the years of the siege!'","Gathered salves (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tend to the wounded soldiers (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Círdan has seen many injured over the years. Currently, many of those wounded remain untreated.","'I have known war, but I am not a warrior. No, I have always been, and will always be, a builder and a sailor of ships. And yet the call to war must be heeded, so I brought to the Great Alliance my skills as a healer and a bringer of wisdom.\
\
'I have seen more injured soldiers of late, a greater number than I am accustomed to treating at once. You have some skill tending to the wounded? That is good. I ask you to collect some salves and see to these injured soldiers. Your assistance will be greatly appreciated by both healers and healed alike.'"},
[4740]={"You delivered the signet of Torsbury to Thane Tordag as Fríthild required, but you have found the people of Torsbury already routed from their town.","Enemies Abound","'I must ask your pardon for my father's harshness. He is a good man, but none too clever, and is embarrassed that he allowed Torsbury to fall. The Dunlendings came upon us silently in the night and had already put the town to the torch before anyone could sound the alarm. It seemed like they came from nearly every direction and without warning.\
\
'Now he plans to retake Torsbury and has put me in charge of gathering information. I may be young -- only eighteen summers -- but I have seen my share of battles and know the habits of the Orcs.\
\
'I need you to ride out to Torsbury and through the fields to the south to learn what kinds of forces are arrayed against us. With that information, we can lay the best plan for our counterassault.'","Servants of the White Hand can be found at Torsbury and in the fields south of Torsbury.\
\
Torferth asked you to ride to Torsbury and the field to the south of the village and learn what kinds of forces are arrayed against his father's garrison.","DNT -- Will not be seen","Torferth is at Tordag's encampment, north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke.\
\
You should return to Torferth with your report.","Determine the composition of the enemy's forces (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Torferth is at Tordag's encampment north of the road between Torsbury and Stoke.\
\
Tordag told you to lend your aid to his son, Torferth.","Talk to Torferth in Tordag's encampment","'It is as I feared. They have a great array of warriors...but your news is not all bad. It appears that most of the enemy army is comprised of wild Dunlendings -- with whom we have much experience in battle -- and half-orc raiders. If their only support is a small contingent of goblin Warg-riders, this should not be terribly difficult.'","Talk to Torferth at Tordag's encampment","Determined the composition of the enemy's forces (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Bah! Fríthild will have to wait. I have lost Torsbury! Nay, I am not disloyal, whatever it may seem. I just know Fríthild...she can hold fast without me. I should know! Look at my nose...she broke it herself, she did!\
\
'We will attend to Stoke, do not worry! But first I must reclaim my town. I cannot bandy words any longer. My son, Torferth, is in charge of gathering information we can use to form our counterassault. Speak with him and help him as you may.\
\
'The sooner Torsbury belongs to us, the sooner we can drive Saruman's lackeys back to Isengard!'"},
[4743]={"'¿Has visto la cantidad de trasgos que hay? Eres ${PLAYERNAME:un[m]|una[f]}  tan valiente como ${PLAYERNAME:habilidoso[m]|habilidosa[f]}, así que no te costará nada reducir un poco su número. Tenemos que empezar por algún sitio.\
\
'Ten cuidado, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. No me gusta el aspecto de este lugar. Los trasgos parecen más organizados de lo habitual.'","Los trasgos han infestado Gazatmur en números alarmantes y representan una gran amenaza para el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación.","Wigfast está en su escondite cerca de Gazatmur, el campamento de trasgos del este de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes regresar con Wigfast ahora que has reducido el número de trasgos.","'¡Eso fue un buen comienzo, ${PLAYER}! Te agradezco tu ayuda para hacer que estos pasillos sean más seguros para nuestra expedición.'","'Hay algo inusualmente malo en Gazatmur. No me gusta la forma en que los trasgos parecen tan organizados en sus movimientos.'","Trasgos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Enemigos para siempre","Los trasgos se encuentran en Gazatmur, una gran zona al este de la Gran Excavación.\
\
Debes derrotar a muchos trasgos en Gazatmur para reducir su número.","Regresa con Wigfast en su escondite","Derrota a los trasgos en Gazatmur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4744]={"Search the Palace of Eldacar","Search the House of Healing","Searched the Dome of Stars","Search interiors within after-battle Osgiliath for enemies and hidden supplies.","Talk to Mablung","Mablung has asked you to search Osgiliath's ruined buildings for enemies and hidden supplies.","Search the Dome of Stars","You should talk to Mablung, who can be found at the Ranger encampment in after-battle Osgiliath.","Searched the Palace of Eldacar","Enemies Within the Ruins","Searched the House of Healing","'Good, you found some supplies and saw that the buildings were clear of enemies. These goods will be most useful for us in the days and weeks ahead.'","'Many of the buildings in Osgiliath are no longer standing or are partially collapsed from the conflict here. I would like you to search the few remaining structures for any supplies you might find. The Easterlings or Haradrim may have stashed supplies in these buildings before they marched on the Pelennor. I hope that no foes remain in these buildings.'","Found hidden supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Find hidden supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4746]={"You have defeated a vast number of the forces of Gundabad at Azgh-buzru.","Overrun with the forces of Gorgar the Ruthless, the War of Three Peaks rages at Azgh-buzru.\
\
If the Gabil'akkâ hope to continue their march on Mount Gundabad, their enemies at the war-fell must be defeated to the last.","Overrun with the forces of Gorgar the Ruthless, Azgh-buzru has become the site of many skirmishes in the War of Three Peaks.","Defeat the forces of Gundabad at Azgh-buzru (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Enemies at the War-fell","Gorgar's forces can be found throughout Azgh-buzru.\
\
You have encountered a vast number of Gorgar's forces at Azgh-buzru, the war-fell. You should defeat them and aid the march on Gundabad.","Completado","You have defeated a vast number of the forces of Gundabad at Azgh-buzru and granted a brief advantage to the dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ."},
[4749]={"Defeat enemies in the Entwash (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has derrotado a un enemigo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You should defeat the Orcs and Variags you find in the Mouths of Entwash.","Enemies in the Mouths of Entwash","Forces of the enemy now creep through the Mouths of Entwash and should be rooted out.","Root out forces of the enemy that have taken to the Mouths of Entwash."},
[4751]={"Narfi se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca y de Anazârmekhem.\
\
Tras muchas incursiones difíciles en el corazón mismo de las fortalezas orcas de Moria, has logrado victorias decisivas y frustrado los intentos de las criaturas de asestar un golpe devastador contra los elfos de Lothlórien.","'Mis exploradores me han traído rumores de un enemigo llamado Mazog que da órdenes a las fuerzas del mal en Moria. Me atrevería a decir que pretenden llevar la guerra hacia el este, arrasando el bosque a su paso. Esto no puede permitirse… mientras yo respire, ni tampoco ninguno de los enanos aquí en Moria.\
\
'Durante demasiado tiempo hemos permanecido exiliados de este lugar, y sufriremos aún más si los elfos resultan dañados por nuestra ausencia. He enviado a mis hermanos a explorar dos zonas donde hemos visto un mayor número de orcos.\
\
'El primero se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de aquí. Deberías ir allí y hablar con Avar, el mayor. Mi segundo hermano está en Anazârmekhem y se llama Pálmar. El más joven, Teitur, también se encuentra en algún lugar de Anazârmekhem. Cuando hayas cumplido con todo lo que te pidan, regresa conmigo.'","Completa las tareas de Pálmar en las forjas de Khazad-dûm","'Hay pocas palabras más importantes para los enanos que el respeto y el honor. Honor no te falta, ${PLAYER}, y por ello te has ganado nuestro mayor respeto. Tus gestas serán cantadas en nuestros anales, para que no olvidemos el gran servicio prestado a enanos y elfos en estos tiempos difíciles.\
\
'Con este gran deber cumplido, te digo que quedo profundamente en deuda contigo, al igual que todos los pueblos libres que habitan en estas grandes salas.'","'¡Ahí camina un héroe verdadero y honorable! ¡Gloria a ${PLAYER}!'","Habla con Narfi en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Los orcos se reúnen bajo diversos estandartes, pero acuden a una sola causa. Esto resulta inquietante para los enanos, y la intención de la hueste de guerra de Moria impulsa incluso a los más firmes del Pueblo de Durin a actuar contra los orcos en las salas que han ocupado durante tantos años.","Completa las tareas de Avar en la Gran Escalera","Enemigos de Lothlórien","'Encontrarás primero a Avar en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Vigila las tropas reunidas en la Gran Escalera. Después, busca a Pálmar en Anazârmekhem; observa a los orcos trabajar sin descanso en las forjas de Khazad-dûm. Por último, habla con Teitur, también en Anazârmekhem, y pídele que te informe sobre Fil Gashan, donde un general orco reúne un ejército y prepara su hueste para la batalla.\
\
'Date prisa, ${PLAYER}. No hay tiempo que perder.'","Los hermanos de Narfi pueden encontrarse en la Guardia Orca y en Anazârmekhem, al suroeste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, donde Narfi ocupa su puesto.\
\
Narfi te ha pedido que visites a sus hermanos Avar, Pálmar y Teitur en la Guardia Orca y en Anazârmekhem, y averigües qué ayuda necesitan.","Completa las tareas de Teitur en Fil Gashan"},
[4752]={"Collected Thistledown-haunches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Get those haunches, and I'll tell you the rest of my plan.'","Sergeant-at-Arms Thorfinn has an idea that could give the Free Peoples the ability to drive the forces of Angmar from the Isendeep, but the plan is not without grave danger.","Thistledown grazers are found on the southern side of the Hoarwell River or on the plains of the Steps of Gram. The grazing land near the Hoarwell is south and west from the dwarf camp and the grazing land in the Steps of Gram is to the south and east.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Thorfinn believes that with some clever tactics, the Free Peoples may use the drakes against Angmar's host and sweep through the mines behind them to recover the position.","'These will do very nicely. Now you must make your way into the mine and find the flat stone near the War-tyrant watching over the mine. Place the haunches on this stone, and I'll bet the smell draws the drakes to the location.'","Deliver the haunches to Sergeant-at-Arms Thorfinn at the camp west of the Isendeep","'Angmar has got hold of the mine, and we need to get back in there. There are not enough forces to call from the south to storm such a large place, but all may not be lost yet.\
\
'Our enemy here has enemies, and if we are smart about how we handle this, we might yet turn the enemy of our enemy into an ally, at least for a moment.\
\
'I'm talking about the drakes that make the mine and the surrounding areas their home. We might get them to fight against the Orcs if we can draw their attention to them. To do that we need to get some meat...Thistledown haunches ought to do, ${CLASS}. Collect some and bring them back to me.'","Collect Thistledown-haunches (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Place the haunches on the flat stone near the War-tyrant","The flat stone is very near where the War-tyrant commands his forces within the Isendeep Mine.\
\
Sergeant-at-Arms Thorfinn wants to drive the forces of Angmar from the Isendeep. He believes with some clever placement, the Free Peoples may use the drakes against Angmar's host and sweep through the mines behind them to recover the position.","The meat has been placed","Enemies of our Enemy"},
[4753]={"'¿Has visto a esos orcos en el cruce de Sudulthurkh, ${PLAYER}? Estaban empujando carros por el camino. ¡Creo que están llevando suministros de guerra hacia el este!\
\
No puedo imaginar por qué... ¿por qué los orcos de Moria querrían enfrentarse al sol? Puede que nunca sepa la respuesta, pero deberíamos detenerlos, si podemos.'","Vuelve con Svanr en Sudulthurkh","Enemigos del Cruce de Caminos","Svanr se encuentra en un rincón del camino justo al este de Sudulthurkh.\
\
Debes hablar con Svanr.","'Los orcos se encuentran justo al sur de aquí, en el cruce de Sudulthurkh.'","Tú y Svanr vieron a un gran número de orcos empujando carros en Sudulthurkh, claramente transportando suministros de guerra hacia el este.","Los orcos se encuentran empujando carros en el cruce de Sudulthurkh en Nud-melek, al norte del gran abismo.\
\
Debes derrotar a los orcos belicosos de Moria antes de que puedan causar estragos en el Valle.","'Me alegra que hayas reducido su número, ${PLAYER}! El Valle será más seguro, al igual que el camino hacia el este.'","Derrota a los orcos en Sudulthurkh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Orco derrotado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4754]={"Stíling está explorando las afueras de Gamil Filik, en las Vetas del  Cuerno de Plata, al sur y luego ligeramente al este del Descenso Profundo.\
\
Deberías hablar con Stíling y ofrecerle tus servicios para hacer frente a la amenaza de los trasgos","'Stíling se encuentra cerca del campamento de trasgos de Gamil Filik, al sur y al este de aquí'","Enemigos del Descenso Profundo","Encuentra a Stíling en Gamil Filik","'Me alegro de verte, ${RACE}. Como ves, me he topado con unos vecinos muy hostiles cerca del Descenso Profundo...'","'Si estás buscando misiones, tenemos muchas, ${PLAYER}. El problema más urgente es probablemente el de nuestros vecinos más cercanos...\
\
'Stíling, uno de nuestros mineros, nos ha enviado informes sobre un gran asentamiento de trasgos que, por desgracia, está demasiado cerca de aquí. El nombre del lugar es Gamil Filik, y allí encontrarás a Stíling evaluando la amenaza.\
\
'Dirígete al sur desde el Descenso Profundo y luego toma el camino del este en el cruce, y allí deberías encontrar a Stíling.'","Thettmár te ha pedido que busques a Stíling, que se ha ido a explorar las vías del este."},
[4755]={"El supervisor de los Duramano puede encontrarse en las ruinas de Mithrenost, al sur de Refr Mercurio.\
\
Refr Mercurio te ha pedido que localices y derrotes al supervisor de los Duramano en Mithrenost, con la esperanza de que sus seguidores se aparten de sus malos caminos. Te pidió que le lleves pruebas de la derrota del supervisor.","'Hunulf y Gadaric hicieron bien al elegirte. Resultaste ser una persona de gran rectitud.\
\
'Aunque me duele saber que mis hermanos han caído tan bajo, me complace haber ganado la amistad que me ofreces, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Me tomé la libertad de reutilizar parte del metal de las hachas que recolectaste y forjé esta hermosa pieza para ti. Haz con ella lo que desees. Te la has ganado.'","Medallón del supervisor de los Duramano recuperado","Entrega el medallón del supervisor de los Duramano a Refr Mercurio","'Busca cerca del centro de Mithrenost tierra removida o una mayor congregación de enanos. El supervisor estará allí. Recuerda, no seas imprudente y no intentes esta tarea por tu cuenta.'","Recupera el medallón del supervisor de los Duramano","Enemigos de los Eglain","'No olvidaré pronto lo que hiciste contra los Duramano.'","En Annunlos hay una ruina, abandonada desde hace mucho por los Eglain. Los Eglain se llevaron todo lo que pudieron sin explorar las tumbas bajo la ruina, como es su costumbre. Sin embargo, la ruina vuelve a rebosar de vida, ya que enanos, aliados con orcos, la registran en busca de tesoros en sus profundidades.","'Me alegra verte de nuevo, ${PLAYER}.'","'En algún lugar de Mithrenost hay un enano que supervisa las labores de los Duramano. Aunque los Duramano se han apartado de su naturaleza al asociarse con los orcos, quizá no todo esté perdido para ellos.\
\
'Encuentra al supervisor de los Duramano y derrotalo. Su derrota podría quebrar la determinación de sus seguidores y bien podrían apartarse del oscuro camino que siguen. Tráeme pruebas de la caída del supervisor y te honraré por tus esfuerzos en nombre de los Eglain.\
\
'El supervisor será astuto y fuerte... ten cuidado si esperas derrotarlo.'"},
[4756]={"Has derrotado a un enemigo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Muchos enemigos merodean por la Segunda Sala de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes derrotar a las fuerzas del mal que rondan esta sala.","Enemigos de la Segunda Sala","Enemigos y criaturas viles se encuentran en la Segunda Sala de Nud-melek.\
\
Debes derrotar a los enemigos en la Segunda Sala.","Completado","Muchos enemigos merodean por la Segunda Sala de Nud-melek.","Has derrotado a varios enemigos en la Segunda Sala de Nud-melek.","Derrota a enemigos y monstruos en la Segunda Sala (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4757]={"In the ruins beside the gates of Mount Gundabad, the forces of Gorgar the Ruthless have built twin encampments known as Hanksar-mokh, the sword-home, and Kulûg-mokh, the spear-home. From these encampments, countless Orcs keep watch on Elderslade, where they remain ever-prepared to slay any who would dare to approach the domain of Gorgar the Ruthless.\
\
You should defeat many of the forces of Gorgar at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh.","Defeated Gorgar's forces at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Enemies on the Threshold","Gorgar the Ruthless has rallied his forces to Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh, twin encampments built beside the very gates of Mount Gundabad.","You have defeated a significant number of Gorgar's forces at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh and done much to clear the path to the gates of Mount Gundabad for the Gabil'akkâ.","Defeat Gorgar's forces at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","The forces of Gorgar the Ruthless can be found in Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh, Orc-encampments that straddle the gates of Mount Gundabad.\
\
Countless numbers of Orcs, trolls, and goblins loyal to Gorgar the Ruthless inhabit Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh. You should defeat as many as you can to aid the Gabil'akkâ in reclaiming Mount Gundabad.","You have defeated a significant number of Gorgar's forces at Hanksar-mokh and Kulûg-mokh."},
[4758]={"'¡Excelente! Uf, qué mal huele. Yo me lo quedo, gracias.'","Consigue carne de jabalí enfermo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Enemigo tras enemigo","Lleva la carne a Merruth","Los jabalíes que habitan en el este de Cardolan portan una enfermedad mortal.","Carne de jabalí enfermo conseguida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}","Merruth te ha pedido que caces jabalíes enfermos en el este de Cardolan y que coloques su carne en el camino a los cubiles de huargos cercanos.","'¡Tú! Pareces fuerte y capaz. Tengo una propuesta si te interesa ganar algunas monedas.\
\
'Al este de aquí vive un gran número de jabalíes. Normalmente no prestaría atención a estas criaturas, pero este grupo está enfermo y ataca nada más verte.\
\
'Ve a su guarida y acaba con todos los que puedas. Trae su carne también. Tengo una idea que puede ser de utilidad.'","Deberías llevarle la carne de jabalí enfermo a Merruth.\
\
Merruth está en el este de Cardolan."},
[4759]={"Habla con Glamodúd en Echad Glamodúd","Habla con Aemeldir en Echad Sirion","The presence of goblin-spies in the Mirk-eaves also infers the presence of an enemy encampment somewhere in the vicinity.","'You should meet with Glamodúd at Echad Glamodúd, south-east from here, at the southern foot of Amon Angened, where the main way-post of the Malledhrim has been established. He will tell you what aid he may need.\
\
'Aemeldir here at Echad Sirion will know more about Dúrburz-stazg.'","Glamodúd is at Echad Glamodúd, south-east from Echad Sirion, at the southern foot of Amon Angened. Aemeldir is at Echad Sirion.\
\
Farasgon has asked you to speak with Glamodúd regarding the Orc-camp to the south and Aemeldir regarding Dúrburz-stazg, the encampment to the north.","'${PLAYER}, while you were gone, one of our scouts discovered the location of an Orc-encampment to the south and another to the north. However, these tokens you brought me belong to four different tribes or companies. I fear there are other camps we may not have found yet.\
\
'While I send more patrols out to find the other encampments, you should travel to Echad Glamodúd, near the Orc-camp, and speak with Glamodúd, the chief scout there. He will give you further instruction.\
\
'You should also speak with Aemeldir here at Echad Sirion... he was involved on the initial attack against Durbúrz-stazg and may know more about the remnant of the Orcs there. We must not be caught unaware between enemy forces!'","'¿Has venido desde Echad Sirion? Eso está bien, pues necesitamos desesperadamente tu ayuda.'","El enemigo a las puertas","'Saludos, ${PLAYER}. Sí, Falasgon tiene razón. Me vendría bien tu ayuda...'"},
[4760]={"'While I've been watching, I've seen quite a few runners come and go with scraps of paper to deliver to Captain Zúrthrug. I assume they are then passed on to the warlord and his closest advisors. Some of this intelligence is probably still in the camp, and will be useful to the war effort!\
\
'Intelligence? In hobgoblins? Bah, there has to be a better word. Well, it will do for now.'","Stazg Vozag, the main out-camp in the Pit of Stonejaws, receives messages from hobgoblins elsewhere in Gundabad.","\\qDwarves have breached gates of Gundabad. Máttugard under siege.\\q","Talk to Klúso near Stazg Vozag","Scraps of paper inside the out-camp might hold information intended for the hobgoblin leadership... but they might be intercepted by a daring adventurer.","\\qThing-fold wards remain intact. Do not attempt to enter!\\q","Collect the first hobgoblin report","Collect the second hobgoblin report","Collect the fourth hobgoblin report","Klúso is scouting near Stazg Vozag.","\\qGloomingtarn wards being attacked. Orcs maybe free to enter.\\q","Collect the fifth hobgoblin report","Enemy \\qIntelligence\\q","\\qMorale low among Orc soldiers. Gorgar is failing.\\q","\\qAngmarim continuing experiments in Clovengap. Keeping watch.\\q","'What did you find?'\
\
You hand the parchments to Klúso. He quickly reads the messages, squinting at the crude Orc-scrawls.\
\
'Some of these tidings are old, but some of this is news to me. It is interesting to hear that some lose faith in Gorgar... I wager we can take advantage of that, and wouldn't that be quite the Beard Bonus?\
\
'I'll make sure these get to Ausma!'","Collect the third hobgoblin report"},
[4762]={"Melethon is at the Causeway Forts.\
\
You should speak to Melethon.","'You have done much for the Gondorian army. Victory will surely be ours!'","Speak with Melethon","Defeat minions of Mordor at the Eastern Wharf (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Eastern Wharf is located on the Eastern side of Osgiliath.\
\
You should fight and slaughter foes around the Eastern Wharf.","Melethon has ordered you to fight and slaughter foes around the Eastern Wharf in the goal to retake Osgiliath.","Defeated minion of Mordor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The time has come to retake the Eastern Wharf! I need every soldier to stand with me as we march upon the enemy.\
\
'Go and defeat as many foes as you can at the Eastern Wharf. We shall take back this city!'","Enemy at the Eastern Wharf"},
[4763]={"Lieva Lirioagrio espera tu regreso en la Posada Abandonada, al suroeste de la Ladera de los Vientos.\
\
Añadiste el brebaje de Lieva a los barriles de comida en los campamentos de trasgos al noreste de la Posada Abandonada. Lieva querrá saber de tu éxito.","Habrá barriles de comida sin comer en los campamentos de trasgos de la Ladera de los Vientos, al noreste de la Posada Abandonada y al suroeste de la Cima de los Vientos.\
\
Lieva Lirioagrio te ha pedido que lleves un brebaje especial que preparó a los campamentos de trasgos del noreste e introducirlo en su suministro de comida. Se supone que el brebaje tiene propiedades que, según Lieva, animarán a los trasgos a abandonar las Tierras Solitarias.","'¡Odio a los trasgos, sí! Ladrones furtivos, todos ellos, merodeando por la noche para recoger las mejores hierbas y hongos. ¡Pronto dejarán las Tierras Solitarias sin nada si no se les detiene -- aunque tampoco había mucho aquí al principio!\
\
Sin embargo, les preparé un brebaje especial. Los hará lentos y revoltosos -- ¡quizá lo suficiente como para pelear entre ellos! Y si no... bueno, tendrá otros efectos que podrían hacerles cambiar de opinión sobre quedarse aquí.\
\
Toma estos brebajes y viértelos en los barriles ubicados en los campamentos de trasgos al noreste de la posada en la Ladera de los Vientos, al pie de la Cima de los Vientos. Vuelve cuando hayas terminado.'","Debilitando al enemigo","'¡Esos trasgos tienen que irse! Pon mi brebaje en su comida, y rápido, antes de que se lleven todos los buenos hongos y especias. Tienen campamentos al noreste en la Ladera de los Vientos, al suroeste de la Cima de los Vientos.'","'¿El brebaje no funcionó, verdad? ¡Maldita sea! Los trasgos deben tener estómagos de hierro.'","Lieva Lirioagrio tiene una gran aversión por los trasgos que han llegado recientemente a las Tierras Solitarias y busca ahuyentarlos.","Añade brebaje maloliente a los barriles de comida de trasgo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Añadiste brebaje maloliente a los barriles de comida de trasgo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Qué desgracia! Si los trasgos no se van, recogerán todas las mejores hierbas!'","'¿Los trasgos no mostraron ningún efecto negativo por el brebaje? Bueno, supongo que no debería sorprenderme. ¡Los trasgos comen cualquier cosa!\
\
No tiene sentido preocuparse por eso ahora. Lo hiciste bien, ${PLAYER}. Te debo al menos unas monedas.'","Habla con Lieva Lirioagrio en la Posada Abandonada"},
[4764]={"'You have returned! What did you learn, ${PLAYER}?'","Engaging the Enemy","Defeated a servant of the Enemy (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Aemeldir en Echad Sirion","Durbúrz-stazg lies to the north of Echad Sirion.\
\
Aemeldir has asked you to defeat servants of the Enemy at Durbúrz-stazg. You will need to enter the encampment through the eastern gate.","The Elves of the Golden Host seek a way to cripple the Orcs of Durbúrz-stazg.","'Return to Durbúrz-stazg and defeat many of the Enemy there. You may learn something of value to us.'","'It appears we may take advantage of the weaker defences at the eastern gate at Durbúrz-stazg, ${PLAYER}. It is time to test their strength.\
\
'Enter Durbúrz-stazg by the eastern gate and engage the Enemy there. Test their mettle, then return to me. We may learn something about the encampment which may aid us.\
\
'Durbúrz-stazg lies to the north, and the gate you seek opens through the eastern bulwark.'","Echad Sirion lies to the south of Durbúrz-stazg.\
\
You should return to Aemeldir with news of your success.","Defeat servants of the Enemy at Durbúrz-stazg (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4765]={"Talk to Órug at Drenghól","Destroy Orkish trebuchets at Azgh-buzru (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'${PLAYER}! Did Lord Náin send you?\
\
'It is as we feared. Gorgar's forces have erected siege-engines across Azgh-buzru and have begun to set siege to all of Elderslade. As you might expect, Gorgar's weapons are deeply entrenched within his forces. Until their lines are broken, it is likely we shall again find ourselves at a stalemate.\
\
'Find a way through their defences and destroy those siege-engines. When your task is finished, report to me at Drenghól!'","Órug can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have destroyed many trebuchets and ballistae at Azgh-buzru. You should report to Órug at Drenghól.","Orkish trebuchets and ballistae can be found at Azgh-buzru.\
\
Órug has asked you to destroy trebuchets and ballistae at Azgh-buzru.","Destroy Orkish ballistae at Azgh-buzru (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroyed Orkish ballistae at Azgh-buzru (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You have done well, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'With fewer siege-engines to slow our advance, we might soon be able to march to the gates of Mount Gundabad!'","Gorgar's forces have erected terrible siege-engines to halt the advance of the Gabil'akkâ at Azgh-buzru.","Engines of Destruction","Destroyed Orkish trebuchets at Azgh-buzru (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4766]={"'The special merchandise I offer is rare indeed, so you understand that I cannot offer you a discount. Return with the 50 tokens I asked for and we can make a deal.'","'Excellent. Our business is concluded for now.'","The Host of the West Quartermaster asked you to bring them fifty Host of the West Silver Pieces.","'I have some special inventory on offer. If you bring me 50 Host of the West Silver pieces, I will give you Enhancement Runes. I can offer you this deal once a day at most.'","Enhancement Runes for Host of the West Silver Pieces (Daily)","Deliver 50 Host of the West Silver Pieces to the Host of the West Quartermaster","The Host of the West has many fine wares for those who would aid them."},
[4767]={"'The special merchandise I offer is rare indeed, so you understand that I cannot offer you a discount. Return with the 100 tokens I asked for and we can make a deal.'","'Excellent. Our business is concluded for now.'","'I have some special inventory on offer. If you bring me 100 Host of the West Silver pieces, I will give you Enhancement Runes. I can offer you this deal once a week at most.'","Enhancement Runes for Host of the West Silver Pieces (Weekly)","The Host of the West Quartermaster asked you to bring them one-hundred Host of the West Silver Pieces.","Deliver 100 Host of the West Silver Pieces to the Host of the West Quartermaster","The Host of the West has many fine wares for those who would aid them."},
[4768]={"Irsinith, inspired by your story, will commune with the Mother Tree. While she does, she asks that you visit her father and mother at Sul Madásh.","Viznak wants you to bring the tale and news of the king's story to Irsinith, the Warden of the Mother Tree in Adagím.","Viznak is curious and precocious, a frightening combination. He directs you to seek Irsinith's counsel at the Mother Tree.","Present your story to Ildimár at Sul Madásh","Irsinith, inspired by your story, will commune with the Mother Tree. You have spoken with Irsinith's father. He asked that you speak with her mother before returning to Irsinith at the Mother Tree.","Speak with Irsinith at the Mother Tree","Irsinith bids you seek counsel from her parents in Sul Madásh","'When the blight returned, it was as in the old tale of the forgotten king: a thin, devouring veil that left naught but ruin behind.\
\
'If the tale holds true, the place of its binding was sealed. But Ordâkh came with sorcery, broke the land's back, and the blight was loosed again.\
\
'If dark things now stir in the North, seeking its source, they must be stayed 'ere all falls. Go to our daughter, Irsinith, upon the Hill of the Mother, and hear what Amûma has revealed to her.'","Enlightenment of the Suspicious Mind","You learned some more about the blight from Ildimár and Dáthlil, return to Irsinith at the Mother Tree in Adagím and see what she learned from her communion with the ancient tree.","Return to Irsinith at the Mother Tree and see what she learned","Dáthlil responds and bids you return to Irsinith","Irsinith listens to the tale of the King's Folly with great interest. As you explain the variance in maps from the Temámír and Men, she nods in assent. When you finish, she pauses and looks to the Mother Tree.\
\
'The Temámír map speaks true. In elder days, we held pacts with the dwarves; the defence of Nisigím was a charge borne by all. There were peaks even they dared not climb.\
\
'The Kinta stood firm in that age, though it lies beyond my remembering. My father and mother may recall what I cannot.\
\
'Take your tale to them at Sul Madásh. I shall seek Amûma's counsel—if her grief permits, she may yet speak.'","You shared your story with Ildimár","'Amûma remains silent; her pain is too great. We should heed my parents' words. Viznak's insight may prove invaluable.'","After your explanation and description of the enemies setting upon you on the return to him, Viznak looks off into the distance before speaking.\
\
'Morvul, troll, Orcs, all pawns for Blight Lady. Not spiders, though. Not that I ever see. My bodyguards are smart to send you. We should tell the sad Elf-lady about Blight Lady. Her name is Irsinith. She is a very sad Elf-lady. This news will not cheer her up, but maybe give her a new purpose. You go and talk to her and see if she can teach you more.'","Hear Dáthlil's response to your story","Ildimár and Dáthlil listen to the retelling of the King's Folly, and all you have learned since. They share a glance, and Ildimár speaks.\
\
'Men tell this story in a manner different from what we recall. Ages have passed, the king's bones have long been dust, but a persistent memory endures.\
\
'Bitter woe came to Nisigím, and many reaches of the great wood went unwatched after. Our people fought not only the cruelty of Men, but also the endless creep of Sívigush, the blight that rises now to consume all. In truth, we have always striven against Sívigush. It is as old as the stars.'"},
[4769]={"Hostigadores baltmau derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Un supervisor baltmau ha llegado para defender el campamento!","Derrota al supervisor baltmau","Derrota a los hostigadores baltmau (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tu misión es viajar a Mokh Grazádh al oeste y reducir el número de orcos en el campamento antes de que continúen atacando Laivárth. Si puedes, destruye también cualquier suministro que encuentres.","'Has hecho un buen trabajo aquí, ${CLASS}. Laivárth puede descansar tranquilo por ahora.'","Derrota a los acechadores baltmau (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Basta de problemas!","Destruye los suministros de los orcos en Mokh Grazádh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Suministros de los orcos destruidos en Mokh Grazádh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Acechadores baltmau derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Supervisor baltmau derrotado"},
[4770]={"'Greetings, ${PLAYER}. You have not come at a particularly auspicious time. Most of our number is already lost to us out in the lands that we call the Scuttledells.\
\
'We were sent out to scout the terrain but a few days ago, but only a few of our small company have yet returned, and they tell of twisted ravines crawling with evil things. To the north, in particular, are the spiders that give this place its name, and it is there that I believe several of our comrades have been ensnared by the spiders.\
\
'There may yet be time to free them before they are slain, if we are fortunate. Can you assist with this deed?'","A number of Ivorel's scouts have not returned from their mission in the Scuttledells. Miluimil saw some of them entrapped by the spiders to the north.","Habla con Miluimil en el campamento de Ivorel","Entangled Elves","The ensnared Elves may be found in the nests of the spiders to the north of Ivorel's camp.\
\
Miluimil has asked you to set forth to free his ensnared companions.","'It appears that some of the scouts did not survive...I had feared as much, but at least you were able to rescue most of them.\
\
'Unfortunately, even among those who returned, most were too ill from the spiders' venom and their entrapment to continue, and I had to send them back to Ost Galadh to recover.\
\
'Could I have you stay here for a while longer to aid us? The Scuttledells are too dangerous for us to leave unattended while facing the forces in Dol Guldur.'","'Fuirgam has forbidden his troops from entering the Scuttledells. He gauges the odds of a band of regular soldiers facing ambush and entrapment too great to risk so many Elves.\
\
'I cannot say that our scouts have fared much better though, and it leaves us to dig our way out of our own mess without the help of soldiers from Ost Galadh.'","Free Elves from the cocoons (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Miluimil is at Ivorel's camp, south of the spider-nests.\
\
You should speak with Miluimil and tell him that the scouts have been freed.","Elf freed (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4771]={"'Te envía Elladan, ¿verdad? Escribe que has ayudado a nuestra causa y que eres de fiar. Muy bien. Si tienes disposición para ello, me vendría muy bien tu ayuda.'","'Te doy la bienvenida a Haudh Erthaid, la Tumba de los Reinos. Esto es Gaerond, un campamento desde el que vigilamos la zona septentrional del Ángulo. Llegas justo a tiempo. Mi padre me ha llamado junto a él, pero me resistía a abandonar el Ángulo, pues queda mucho trabajo por hacer. No obstante, si puedes ocuparte de mis tareas, regresaré a Rivendel con el corazón ligero.\
\
'Al sur de este campamento, en lo alto sobre el río, se encuentra Eitheldir. Durante mucho tiempo, hordas de enemigos han mancillado esa otrora grandiosa fortaleza de los Noldor. Te ruego que sigas el sinuoso camino hacia Eitheldir. En algún lugar ante sus puertas encontrarás a mi exploradora, Merileg, que ha estado esperando refuerzos. Entrégale esta carta de presentación y préstale toda la ayuda que puedas'.","Encuentra el camino a Eitheldir","'Si puedes ocuparte de mis tareas, regresaré a Rivendel con el corazón ligero'.","El camino a Eitheldir se halla en el norte del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías buscar el camino que lleva a Eitheldir.","Busca a Merileg","Durante milenios, el Ángulo fue escenario de innumerables y devastadoras batallas, lo que le valió el nombre de Haudh Erthaid, la Tumba de los Reinos. Convertido de nuevo en un paraje natural, ofrece refugio a quienes no desean ser encontrados. Resguardado por dos ríos difíciles de vadear, el Ángulo es el hogar de montaraces, elfos y refugiados por igual. Pero una reciente incursión de orcos, forajidos y otros siervos del Enemigo ha devuelto la guerra a las colinas y las riberas del Ángulo.","¡Arcos antiguos a lo lejos! Sin duda, este es el camino.","Merileg se encuentra cerca de las ruinas de Eitheldir, en el norte del Ángulo.\
\
Elladan te ha pedido que le entregues una carta de presentación.","Entra en el Ángulo"},
[4772]={"Este guerrero sostiene un pergamino sellado con cera azul","'Ya he aprendido algo sobre los rohirrim, ${PLAYER}. ¡Parece que no creen que exista un peligro hasta que lo tienen encima! Los hombres aquí saben que el enemigo acampa en las Tierras Pardas, pero ¿envían aviso a los hombres de Stangard? ¡Parece que no!\
\
'Las fuertes murallas de Etheburg me dan algo de tranquilidad, pero si el ejército es tan grande como dijo Landroval, puede que no sean suficientes. Aun así, al menos los hombres de Stangard tendrán algo de advertencia si ocurre algo. Después de todo, Etheburg está entre el ejército y el puesto que acabamos de dejar... ¡al menos por ahora!\
\
'No puedo evitarlo, ${PLAYER}. ¡Sigo nervioso! Creo que deberías ir a enfrentarte a los enemigos que se reúnen en las Tierras Pardas. Yo me quedaré aquí para hablar con los rohirrim. Tal vez alguno me dé un mensaje que pueda llevar a Stangard para convencerlos del peligro.'","Bingo está en el patio superior de Stangard.\
\
Tú y tus aliados han defendido Stangard con éxito del ataque oriental.","'¡Lo logramos!'","Lleva las órdenes secretas a Bingo en Etheburg, en el borde de las Tierras Pardas","Orientales derrotados en las Tierras Pardas (${CURRENT}/12)","Derrota orientales en las Tierras Pardas (11/12)","'¡Lo logramos! ¡Stangard está a salvo, y creo que también les hemos enseñado a los hombres de aquí una valiosa lección sobre el respeto! Quizá la próxima vez que unos extraños bienintencionados vengan a advertirles, estarán atentos, o al menos se mantendrán educados.\
\
'Necesito pensar algunos títulos para este capítulo de mi libro. ¿Quizá 'Una lección de amistad'? ¿'Un tiempo para confiar'? ¿'El mal que vino del Este'? ¿'Platos y discordia'?\
\
'No es sencillo, ${PLAYER}. Si tienes sugerencias, ¡soy todo oídos! También debemos decidir adónde ir ahora, pero aún no me decido. Hay varias posibilidades, pero quiero asegurarme de que tomamos la decisión correcta y no nos lanzamos de cabeza sin evaluar todas nuestras opciones. ¿Sabes a qué me refiero?\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La semana que viene: 'La carga de Bingo' (Nivel recomendado: 78)</rgb>\
'","Habla con Bingo en la puerta este de Stangard y prepárate para la ofensiva oriental","Habla con Bingo dentro de Stangard","'¡Los hombres de Stangard no escucharán nuestra advertencia de que un ejército se reúne ante sus mismas puertas! O no nos creen, o piensan que tienen la fuerza suficiente para sobrevivir a esta amenaza. No sé si ese es el caso, ${PLAYER}; según la descripción de Landroval, el ejército acampado en las Tierras Pardas es grande. ¡Debemos ver qué podemos hacer al respecto! Puede que no te hayas dado cuenta, pero cuando fuimos a Mirkwood con la Hueste Dorada aprendí un par de cosas sobre lo que hace falta para preparar un ejército en marcha. Quizá pueda aplicar ese conocimiento al ejército de las Tierras Pardas.'\
\
Le dices a Bingo que parecía más preocupado por su estómago durante vuestra estancia en Mirkwood.\
\
'Bueno, las apariencias engañan, ¿no? En cualquier caso, Prestadír me dijo que los ejércitos marchan gracias a sus estómagos. Yo simplemente estaba corroborando eso con mi experiencia personal. ¡A las Tierras Pardas!'","'Hablé con algunos de los hombres de aquí y comparten mi preocupación de que los hombres de Stangard no están tomando esta amenaza en serio. Parece que muchos de los hombres de estas tierras fueron enviados aquí por su rey debido a diversas faltas y ofensas, y puede que no sean los defensores más firmes que el reino necesita. ¿Qué has averiguado tú, ${PLAYER}?\
\
Le entregas a Bingo las órdenes secretas. Lee el pergamino rápidamente y se queda blanco como el papel.\
\
'¡Oh no! ¡Parece que un destacamento secreto de orientales planea rodear Etheburg y atacar Stangard en secreto! ¡Tenemos que volver y advertirles... si no es ya demasiado tarde!'","El puesto avanzado de Etheburg está en el borde de las Tierras Pardas, más allá del Juncal.\
\
Bingo ha decidido tomar cartas en el asunto y quiere investigar las Tierras Pardas.","'¡Tenemos que llevar estas órdenes a Stangard!'","Derrota orientales en las Tierras Pardas (${CURRENT}/12)","Se pueden encontrar orientales por todas las Tierras Pardas, y Bingo te ha pedido que luches contra ellos para ayudar a los hombres de Stangard.","'¡Gracias por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}, y te deseo buena fortuna a ti y a Bingo en vuestro viaje! Volveré con Grimbeorn en los Valles del Anduin con noticias de la presencia oriental en las Tierras Pardas. Puede que tenga más trabajo que hacer respecto a ello. ¡Lo espero con ganas!'","'Eres muy persistente, ${PLAYER}. ¿Qué hará falta para que nos dejes y no vuelvas más?'\
\
Sabert toma el pergamino y lo lee lentamente. Cuando vuelve a mirarte, su gesto burlón ha sido reemplazado por algo distinto: miedo.\
\
'No sé qué decir. No ha ocurrido ningún ataque, lo que significa que has traído esta advertencia a tiempo. ¡Y lo hiciste a pesar de mis duras palabras! Espero que aceptes mis disculpas, pero esta es una tierra dura y los hombres deben ser cautelosos al tratar con otros. Si estás dispuesto a ayudarnos a prepararnos para el ataque que debe estar por venir, te estaré muy agradecido. ¿Le preguntarías a tu amigo Bingo si está dispuesto a ayudar?'","'¡Creo que deberías llevar el combate a los enemigos que se reúnen en las Tierras Pardas! Yo me quedaré aquí para hablar con los rohirrim. Tal vez alguno me dé un mensaje que pueda llevar a Stangard para convencerlos del peligro.'","Bingo quiere ayudar a los hombres de Stangard, aunque se negaron a escuchar su advertencia de que un ejército se reúne justo ante sus puertas.","'Según la descripción de Landroval, el ejército acampado en las Tierras Pardas es grande. ¡Debemos ver qué podemos hacer al respecto! ¡A las Tierras Pardas!'","Entran los Orientales","'¡Por supuesto que creo que debemos ayudar a los hombres de Stangard a defender su puesto avanzado! Los ayudaremos a sobrevivir a este ataque sorpresa, ¡y puedes contar conmigo para documentar toda la emoción en mi relato!'","Langhár está en el patio superior de Stangard.\
\
Tú y tus aliados habéis defendido Stangard con éxito del ataque oriental.","Habla con Langhár dentro de Stangard","Sabert está en la puerta este del puesto avanzado de Stangard.\
\
Has encontrado órdenes preocupantes dirigidas a los Orientales, y Bingo quiere que se las muestres a Sabert en Stangard.","'¡La fuerza oriental ha sido derrotada, y los Khundolar en las Tierras Pardas esperan una noticia de victoria que nunca llegará! Me alegra que Stangard siga en pie, pero más aún: ¡me alegra que los hombres de aquí hayan sido puestos en su lugar! ¡Ya no se burlarán de la línea de Beorn!\
\
'No lo andes difundiendo, pero me parece que Sabert ha cambiado sus sentimientos de disgusto por otros completamente distintos. No sé cuál me irrita más, ${PLAYER}, pero creo que me caía mejor cuando temía a los nuestros y no intentaba impresionarme.\
\
'¡Gracias por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}, y te deseo buena fortuna a ti y a Bingo en vuestro viaje! Volveré con Grimbeorn en los Valles del Anduin con noticias de la presencia oriental en las Tierras Pardas. Puede que tenga más trabajo que hacer respecto a ello. ¡Lo espero con ganas!'","Bingo está en el puesto avanzado de Etheburg, en el borde de las Tierras Pardas.\
\
Has encontrado un pergamino que aparentemente contiene órdenes secretas para los Orientales describiendo un ataque encubierto a un puesto que parece ser Stangard.","Sabert está en la puerta este del puesto avanzado de Stangard.\
\
Sabert ha cambiado de opinión ahora que le has mostrado pruebas del plan de los Orientales, y quiere que lo ayudes con las defensas de Stangard.","Lleva las órdenes secretas a Sabert en la puerta este de Stangard","Habla con Bingo en el puesto avanzado de Etheburg, en el borde de las Tierras Pardas"},
[4773]={"Defeated Gragarag of the Queensbrood","Defeat Gamnagol of the Queensbrood","Defeated Rûkhor the Pale Herald","Mablung is awaiting your return in Echad Taerdim, the Ranger camp in Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should report to Mablung when you are able.","The time has come to enter the Remmorchant.\
\
You should enter the Remmorchant with a raid group ready via the Instance Finder panel.","'There are too many of them! You must find a way to stem the tide of spiders and gredbyg so we can press on!'","Enter the Remmorchant","'Forgive my coldness, ${PLAYER}, but was Felgúr even an ally to us in the end? Once he regained his spider-form, he quickly abandoned you.'\
\
You suggest that perhaps Shelob's call was so overwhelming he was forced to obey it. The other Ungoledain were completely entranced by it, after all. Legolas's expression softens slightly.\
\
'Perhaps you are right. It matters little. Felgúr is dead, and all that is in our power now is to avenge him.'","Talk to Mablung","Word has reached you that Celeborn and the Rangers of Ithilien are prepared to enter the Remmorchant. They have called for your aid. You should return to Echad Taerdim in Cirith Ungol and report to Mablung.","Talk to Celeborn inside Torech Ungol","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}, for standing here with me before this terrible darkness. I cannot conquer it alone.'","Bratha Tasakh and her Ungoledain have been defeated.\
\
You should press further into the Remmorchant.","Shelob has been defeated at last.\
\
You should talk to Celeborn.","Defeated Thossulun the Massive","Rûkhor the Pale Herald has unveiled his nefarious plot!\
\
You should defeat Rûkhor the Pale Herald before he succeeds in his plan!","The chieftain of the Ungoledain blocks your path deeper into the Remmorchant.\
\
You should defeat Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms.","Defeated Gamnagol of the Queensbrood","'Welcome back, ${PLAYER}. If you are here, Celeborn's call must have gone out. The time to enter the Remmorchant is upon us.'\
\
You can sense his unease as he says these words. You ask if anything is wrong.\
\
'Ah, worry not, friend, I am just a little on edge. I know not what horrors I am sending my men to fight inside that fell pit. Well, save for one. She might overmatch an army, and we can send but a few into those sprawling tunnels. This is no battle such as that at the Black Gate, no, this will be a fight in cramped spaces and deepest darkness! But, we will do our part, no matter what it costs us.\
\
'We have set up a small staging area near the entrance to the Remmorchant. The Rangers of Ithilien and the Galadhrim of Lothlórien have gathered. You should go on ahead. Legolas and Celeborn will be awaiting your arrival. I will see you there!'","Defeat Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms","Defeat Guruthang of the Queensbrood","The mighty children of Shelob block your path forward.\
\
You should defeat the Queensbrood and Thossulun the Massive.","Defeated Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms","Proceed deeper into the Remmorchant","'Hail, ${PLAYER}. Now that you have arrived safely, final preparations can begin.'\
\
You sense no trepidation in Celeborn's voice, only clarity and focus. He brings a calming presence to the soldiers in the camp.\
\
'The time is nearly upon us, ${PLAYER}. I have only one task for you. You must call forth your most powerful allies and begin your preparations. We will need your great combat-skill if we are to succeed in this endeavour.'\
\
Celeborn turns from you and looks toward the Remmorchant. His face hardens, the first sign of worry you have seen from him since you arrived.\
\
'To be forthright, ${PLAYER}, I am not certain it is within our power to truly defeat her. When last we met, I was only able to seal her away. Our blades were unable to pierce her hide, though they were of finest Beleriand-make. But, I promise you this: we will not leave this place without finding a way to eliminate the danger posed by Ungwetári. It is time for her reign of terror to finally end.'","'It… is done. Together we have done what I could not have accomplished alone. Ungwetári will no longer befoul this world, and I will be able to sail to the Undying Lands with peace in my heart. My sworn duty to defeat her has finally been fulfilled.\
\
'Whether the Free Peoples learn of your heroism here or not, know that you have done them a great service this day. With the fall of another of the ancient evils, the world moves ever closer to the dawn of the Fourth Age. I am gladdened to know that heroes like you will be here to greet it.'","Defeat Gragarag of the Queensbrood","Defeat Shelob","'You and your fellows must defeat Bratha Tasakh while we defend this tunnel. We cannot risk an attack from the rear while we are engaged with such a powerful foe. I will help you however I can.'","Defeat Rûkhor the Pale Herald","Celeborn and the Rangers have set up a small staging camp inside Torech Ungol.\
\
You should find the camp and report to Celeborn.","Celeborn and the Rangers of Ithilien are prepared to enter the depths of the Remmorchant, and have called for your aid. The time has come to once again face Shelob.","Defeated Guruthang of the Queensbrood","Habla con Celeborn","Defeat Thossulun the Massive","Thossulun and the Queensbrood have fallen, finally stemming the tide of spiders and gredbyg.\
\
You should press further into the Remmorchant.","Reach Level 130","'We will hold these Bloodless Uruk-hai at bay! You must defeat Rûkhor at any cost!'","The time has come to face Shelob within the Remmorchant.\
\
You should defeat Shelob."},
[4775]={"Enterrado en Haudh Eärendur","'Estoy seguro de que gran parte del conocimiento sobre los últimos días de Arnor se ha perdido en Haudh Eärendur a lo largo de todos estos siglos.'","Nimbellas se encuentra en el campamento de los Montaraces, en el Camino de los Reyes.\
\
Nimbellas estará deseando examinar los grabados que has recogido.","'Gracias, ${PLAYER}. Estos bocetos nos ayudarán a reconstruir una parte importante de nuestra historia.'","'Ay, la historia del Reino del Norte es una historia trágica. Eärendur, hijo de Elendur, fue el último rey de Arnor, antes de que sus hijos dividieran el Reino del Norte en los reinos de Arthedain, Cardolan y Rhudaur. Por desgracia, gran parte de la tradición de aquellos últimos días se perdió con él.\
\
'Descansa aún en su tumba, Haudh Eärendur, y con él, creemos, algunos fragmentos del conocimiento de los últimos días de Arnor. ¿Te atreverías quizá a adentrarte en la tumba y copiar los grabados que pudieras encontrar allí?\
\
'Ten cuidado, pues no me cabe duda de que enemigos, bestias o los elementos han invadido esa tumba, como han hecho con tantas otras aquí.'","Grabados recopilados en Haudh Eärendur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Nimbellas en el Camino de los Reyes","En Haudh Eärendur descansa el último Rey del Norte que logró mantener unida la Casa de Elendil.","Recopila grabados en Haudh Eärendur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Haudh Eärendur se encuentra en el Camino de los Reyes, al oeste del campamento de los Montaraces.\
\
Nimbellas te ha pedido que copies los grabados de las tumbas de Haudh Eärendur."},
[4776]={"Entradas de Barad Tharsír","'Hasta que no sepamos adónde llevan esas entradas, no podremos conocer el verdadero valor de Barad Tharsír.'","Las profundas rodadas en el suelo y los pequeños trozos de madera identifican esta sala como el viejo almacén","Un leve marcado de espadas y arcos rodea la entrada. Esto debió ser la armería","Descubre la segunda entrada","Habla con Daerol en el Coloso","'Barad Tharsír es un lugar del que sabemos poco. No queda mucho en los registros, pero sé que era un lugar valioso. Controlaba las vías comerciales y acceso al lago desde el Baranduin. Cada bote que viajaba por el río pasaba a través de ella.\
\
'Los saqueadores de allí son un estorbo, pero no deberían distraernos del objetivo mayor: aprender todo lo que podamos y preservar toda la historia que sea posible. Nunca sabremos dónde vamos si no sabemos de dónde venimos.\
\
'Ve a Barad Tharsír y haz algo de trabajo de exploración. Sé que hay cincon entradas, pero no sé a qué conducen. Conocer la disposición de las estructuras sería de gran ayuda.'","Barad Tharsír fue una vez un importante puerto de mercancías que comunicaba Evendim con el sur por el Baranduin.","Una gran cantidad de fragmento de cerámica identifica esta sala como el comedor","Descubre la quinta entrada","Daerol está en el Coloso, al noroeste de Barad Tharsír.\
\
Daerol estará muy interesado en oír lo que has averiguado sobre las puertas de Barad Tharsír.","'Así que un almacén, un comedor, barracones, una armería y una habitación sin identificar... bien intencionadamente o debido al paso del tiempo. Interesante.'","El punto más alto de las ruinas. Los restos dispersos de armamento dejan claro que esto eran los barracones","Barad Tharsír está al sureste del Coloso en la orilla este del río Brandivino.\
\
Daerol te ha pedido que explores las ruinas de Barad Tharsír y le informes de lo que encuentres.","Esta entrada no se identificó, o el tiempo ha borrado cualquier inscripción","Descubre la tercera entrada","Descubre la primera entrada","Descubre la cuarta entrada"},
