[4780]={"Los Ents del Bosque de Fangorn tienen la tarea de recoger trofeos al derrotar a sus enemigos en Oestemnet. Estos pueden ser entregados a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega la masa espesa en una caja de recolección","Se busca: Masa espesa de Oestemnet.","Recoge masa espesa (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Masa espesa recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir trofeos de la batalla.","Tarea de los Ents del Bosque de Fangorn: Masa espesa","Se busca: Masa espesa del oeste de Rohan. Recógela para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en El Valle Emboscado."},
[4781]={"You should bring the Entscloak you gathered back to Narvellon in Ost Rimmon.","'Entscloak? Indeed it is! You have my thanks, ${PLAYER}. My gratitude and thanks!'","Return to Narvellon","Gathered Entscloak (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gather Entscloak (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entwash Greens","The leaves of the Entscloak plant eases the pains of the elderly and Narvellon has requested aid in procuring some for himself and others.","You should gather Entscloak in the Mouths of the Entwash for Narvellon.","'If you should find yourself out amid the Mouths of the Entwash, perhaps you might gather some Entscloak for me? It is of no great consequence, but the leaves of the plant work wonders for the aches of the old, such as myself and Lady Glánhar.\
\
'I will find a way to thank you for your trouble, if you did bring me some.'"},
