[4924]={"Mansig wants you to defeat some of the Orcs and Uruks that ambushed his men in the East Wall.","Orcs and Uruks can be found throughout the East Wall.\
\
Mansig has asked you to defeat Orcs and Uruks throughout the East Wall.","'Look at the state of this camp, ${PLAYER}. My men had not been here for an hour when a band of screaming Orcs fell upon us. The walls were not yet up, and some of my warriors were away seeking firewood.\
\
'The Men of Rohan are made of stern stuff indeed, as are their horses. We did not despair, though we were beset on all sides. My fighting men were able to keep the Orcs at bay until my other warriors returned. Then it became a rout.\
\
'Many of the Orcs still lurk in the surrounding woods. If you are a friend to the Men of Rohan, I ask you to remedy this blight upon the East Wall. Wilferth tells me there are several types of Orc in this area, of different sizes, or types, or loyalties. Orc, Uruk...it is all the same to me. Remove them, ${PLAYER}, and I will count you a friend.'","Talk to Mansig","Expedition to the East Wall","Mansig is at his camp in the East Wall.\
\
You have defeated many of the foes that attacked Mansig's party of Rohirrim and should now return to tell him of your success.","'Very good! An enemy of the Orcs is a friend of mine, ${PLAYER}! There is more to be done, however.'","Defeated Orcs and Uruks throughout the East Wall (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Orcs that attacked my men are still out there! Remedy this situation, ${PLAYER}, and I will count you a friend. You will find them throughout the East Wall.'","Defeat Orcs and Uruks throughout the East Wall (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4925]={"Expedition: A Daring Rescue","Rescue a captured soldier","'Agorin sent you? Here?\
\
'Well, I will not debate your bravery, friend ${RACE}, but let us fly swiftly!'","'I fear that a few of our number have been captured by the Orcs, pathfinders who came across the river in silence before our attack to mark the landing spots and eliminate the Enemy's sentries.\
\
'Most of them have returned since we began our assault in earnest, but a few have not, nor have we seen any sign of their bodies, which the Orcs would have left to rot had they been slain. Thus I must believe that they yet live and are held captive nearby...most likely in the central fortification upon Amon Angened, as they have not had time to move prisoners to Dol Guldur.\
\
'However, once we assault that fortress in earnest, they would most certainly kill any prisoners held there. If you could manage to get them out before then, the Malledhrim would be in your debt.'","Talk to Agorin at Echad Sirion","'Hurry, ${PLAYER}! Fuirgam's assault upon the fortress will begin as soon as his forces are in position! If you cannot rescue our scouts from Amon Angened before he begins his attack, their fates are sealed.'","You have rescued one of the captured soldiers","'So the rescue attempt was a success? My thanks to you, ${PLAYER}! Now Fuirgam can launch his assault upon that fortress without fear for our brethren.'","Agorin is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern bank of the Anduin.\
\
You should return to Agorin with news of your success.","A few Elves who were among the first to cross the Anduin to make way for the main landing were captured by Orcs. If they are not rescued before the Malledhrim make their final assault upon Amon Angened, the prisoners will likely be killed.","Elvish prisoners are being held in the Orc-fortress upon Amon Angened, south-east of Echad Sirion.\
\
Agorin has asked you to mount the rescue of Elvish prisoners from their Orc-captors."},
[4926]={"This bridge has already been destroyed","The two bridges lie to the south of Echad Sirion, along a small tributary to the Anduin.\
\
Ivorel has asked you to take the two bridges allowing access to the Mirk-eaves from the south.","Talk to Ivorel at Echad Sirion","Expedition: Bridging the Gap","'A fine day for battle, do you not agree, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'In any case, Fuirgam has tasked me with ensuring that we are not taken unaware from the south. There is a small river there, with a few bridges leading to Orc-encampments on the far side. We cannot spare the forces to assault those fortifications, so we are going to take the bridges instead and prevent them from crossing over.\
\
'I am certain that you can handle a straightforward task such as that, can you not?'","Ivorel is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin.\
\
You should inform Ivorel that both bridges were already destroyed.","Capture the western bridge","Two bridges ford the stream south of Echad Sirion. By means of these bridges, Orc-reinforcements may flank the Malledhrim.","Capture the eastern bridge","'Celeborn has bidden us make haste in our assault, and so we have come lightly prepared. We have no tools of siege with which to reduce Dol Guldur, and Amrúnwen has prepared supplies for little more than two weeks' effort.\
\
'It seems that our assault is not meant to destroy Dol Guldur at all...so why assault the fortress at all?'","'The bridges were already down by the time you arrived?\
\
'Typical Orc-cowardice. They cut them at the first sign of danger and saved us the trouble of even worrying about them for the moment.'"},
[4927]={"'¡Gracias por ocuparte de los lagartos de las cavernas, ${PLAYER}!'","'La Gruta de las Aguas Negras no es un lugar para aquellos que odian la humedad.'","Expedición: Peligro bajo la superficie","Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","Has derrotado a los lagartos de las cavernas en la Gruta de las Aguas Negras (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Un momento, por favor, ${PLAYER}. Ya hemos perdido contacto con cuatro buenos enanos dentro de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, y quiero asegurarme de que sabes a lo que te enfrentas si te atreves a seguirlos.\
\
'La cueva parece tener muchos túneles sinuosos, y toda la red de pasajes es muy oscura, insalubre. Los lagartos de las cavernas se arrastran de roca en roca en medio de la humedad, y son más feroces de lo que su pequeño tamaño podría hacerte creer.\
\
'Si tienes la intención de adentrarte en la Gruta de las Aguas Negras por algún motivo, ¡sé ${PLAYER:cauteloso[m]|cautelosa[f]}! Reduce la horda de lagartos de las cavernas mientras estés allí. Las criaturas son una amenaza para cualquiera que se acerque demasiado a su guarida, y no sé cuánto tiempo pasará antes de que la puerta esté despejada y podamos salir de este lugar.'","Derrota a los lagartos de las cavernas en la Gruta de las Aguas Negras (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Es bueno verte regresar de las profundidades de esa caverna infame, ${PLAYER}. Demasiados pocos lo han logrado.\
\
'Parece que ahora hay menos lagartos de las cavernas que merodean entre los estanques estancados para amenazar a los imprudentes. Te agradezco por tu servicio, y te recompenso con estas monedas. ¡Que te sean útiles!'","Los lagartos de las cavernas pueden encontrarse por toda la cueva conocida como la Gruta de las Aguas Negras; su entrada está en la colina a lo largo de la pendiente que sube a la Puerta de Acebeda.\
\
Valgút te ha pedido que derrotes a varios lagartos de las cavernas que habitan dentro de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras y amenazan la seguridad de la expedición.","Valgút te ha advertido que los lagartos de las cavernas han hecho su hogar dentro de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, y quiere que derrotes a algunos de ellos si piensas entrar en la cueva.","'No tendrás ningún problema para encontrar a los lagartos de las cavernas dentro de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, ${PLAYER}. De hecho, ¡probablemente te encuentren a ti!'","Valgút se encuentra fuera de la entrada de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, en la pendiente que sube a la Puerta de Acebeda.\
\
Has derrotado a muchos de los peligrosos lagartos de las cavernas dentro de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, y ahora deberías regresar con Valgút."},
[4928]={"Ivorel is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin.\
\
You should return to Ivorel with news of your success.","Talk to Ivorel at Echad Sirion","Goblin-runners can be found throughout the Mirk-eaves.\
\
Ivorel has asked you to intercept and defeat the goblin-runners that carry messages from camp to camp in the Mirk-eaves.","Communication between the Orc-fortifications scattered across the Mirk-eaves are handled by goblin-runners who rush messages from one to another. The defeat of these runners not only would cut the encampments off from each other, but may result in the interception of important information about the Enemy's movements.","'In recent years, my scouts have kept a watchful eye upon Dol Guldur, and in the past, the Lord and Lady have forbidden any assault upon it, believing the risk of defeat too great should our forces prove unable to tumble its obsidian walls.\
\
'What counsel has changed their minds, I wonder? It must have something to do with our recent visitors from afar.'","'So, were you able to learn anything from the goblin-runners? No?\
\
'Do not fret. They are rarely entrusted with anything of import, and this stage of the battle should not last long enough for anything we learned from them to matter much.\
\
'Our main goal is to cut them off from each other and leave them disorganized, and in that, you have performed admirably.'","Defeat goblin-runners (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Expedition: Disrupting Communication","'I have a little challenge for you, ${PLAYER}! Do you see all of those Orc-fortifications out there? They communicate with each other through trained runners -- goblins, usually -- who carry messages from one to another. Defeat those messengers, and their communication will be disrupted.\
\
'If you are fortunate, you might even capture a message or two from them, though they usually memorize the information they are supposed to deliver to avoid such issues.\
\
'When you have done as I have asked, return to me here.'","Defeated goblin-runners (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4929]={"Brogur envió a cuatro enanos a explorar la cueva conocida como la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, pero aún no han regresado con él. Está ansioso por conocer su destino.","Has encontrado a los enanos que entraron en la Gruta de las Aguas Negras (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","Has encontrado el cuerpo de Ogur. Está muerto.","Encuentra a los enanos que entraron en la Gruta de las Aguas Negras (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Brogur se encuentra fuera de la cueva conocida como la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, en la pendiente, al oeste.\
\
Has encontrado a los cuatro enanos que Brogur envió a la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, y deberías informarle de su destino.","'Brogur te envió a ver qué estábamos haciendo, ${PLAYER}? No puedo culparlo, porque ya es hora de que le hagamos nuestro informe.\
\
'Nos separamos poco después de entrar en esta inmunda caverna húmeda -- ¡la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, de hecho! Escuché a Ogur gritar desde algún lugar por encima de aquí sobre algún tipo de tesoro que había encontrado, pero luego sus llamadas se desvanecieron y no he vuelto a saber nada de él desde entonces. No sé dónde terminaron Sulki y Wethur.\
\
'Espero que puedas encontrar a mis compañeros, ${PLAYER}. Nosotros cuatro hemos tenido mala suerte en esta cueva acuática, y Brogur no va a estar contento con nuestro informe.'","Has encontrado el cuerpo de Sulki. Está muerto.","'Me entristece perder a tantos buenos enanos, pero el camino hacia Khazad-dûm debe ser abierto.'","Expedición: Los cuatro enanos","'Estas criaturas son más peligrosas de lo que podrías esperar, ${PLAYER}; ten cuidado mientras buscas al resto de mi grupo. Nos separamos hace poco por culpa de estas bestias feroces, y no he podido localizar a mis compañeros desde entonces.\
\
'Escuché a Sulki pidiendo ayuda hace poco, pero no lo he vuelto a escuchar en horas. Temo que haya caído en peligro.'","'Gracias por las noticias, ${PLAYER}, aunque sean sombrías. Me entristece la pérdida de Sulki y de Ogur. Todavía queda mucho trabajo por hacer antes de que hayamos despejado la Puerta de Acebeda de los escombros que la obstruyen, y eran fuertes de brazo y resistentes como los más duros de nuestra raza.\
\
'Pero tu pago no era solo por buenas noticias, y te has ganado esta recompensa. Tómala y hazte útil. ¡Todavía queda trabajo por hacer!'","'Estas colinas están llenas de cuevas, y las cuevas están llenas de peligro.'","'¡Se está perdiendo el tiempo! ¡Todavía queda mucho trabajo por hacer!'","'La Gruta de las Aguas Negras es la cueva que se encuentra en la pendiente al este, a tu izquierda. Cuatro de mis mejores enanos entraron para explorar la cueva, y no han regresado.'","'Hm, ¿perdón? ¿Puedo ayudarte? Mi primo y yo tenemos muchas cosas que gestionar aquí, y no tengo un momento que perder en otros asuntos.\
\
'¿Quieres ayudar? Bueno, si quieres, a trabajar, ciertamente puedo encontrar un uso para ti. Envié a cuatro de mis mejores enanos a investigar la caverna que fluye con agua; está justo en la pendiente al este, y aún no han regresado con su informe. Si puedes encontrar a estos cuatro dentro de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras y traerme noticias de sus hallazgos, te recompensaré por tu esfuerzo.\
\
'Ahora que tienes una tarea con la que ocuparte, por favor no te quedes por aquí, porque me resulta molesto. ¡Déjame! Hay mucho que debo considerar.'","Los cuatro enanos se encuentran en algún lugar dentro de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, la cueva que se encuentra en la pendiente al este de Brogur.\
\
Brogur quiere saber qué pasó con los cuatro enanos que envió a investigar la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, y te ha encargado de encontrarlos."},
[4930]={"Talk to Agorin at Echad Sirion","'So many of our kindred will die this day, and I do not understand the meaning of it.\
\
'Our strength is far greater in Lothlórien where the Lady's powers confound our enemies...why has Lord Celeborn ordered us against the walls of Dol Guldur?'","'It seems that you have managed to recover our missing soldiers, ${PLAYER}. Excellent.\
\
'We cannot afford to lose too many soldiers this early in the campaign...we have a hard road ahead of us still.'","Rescue exhausted soldier","Rescue wounded soldier","Rescued wounded soldier","Expedition: Lost in the Fray","Rescue desperate soldier","Agorin is at Echad Sirion on the eastern banks of the Anduin.\
\
You should return to Agorin and let her know that you have found and aided the missing soldiers.","'A handful of our soldiers have gone missing and I fear they may have been cut off from our forces during the initial rush of the assault. Keep a watchful eye out for any of them while you are out in the Mirk-eaves and lend them whatever aid you can if you do come across them.\
\
'They are skilled warriors in their own right, but there are a great many Orcs still roaming the area....'","Rescued desperate soldier","A handful of Elves have become separated from the main host during the battle to take the Mirk-Eaves.","The Elf-soldiers may be found among the trees of the Mirk-eaves.\
\
Agorin has asked you to aid the missing Elves should you find them amongst the forests of the Mirk-eaves.","Rescued exhausted soldier"},
[4931]={"'Esta información que me has traído pinta un panorama inquietante, ${PLAYER}. Alguien ha dibujado flechas en este mapa con lo que parece ser sangre, trazando una ruta desde las Colinas de los Trolls hasta Acebeda. Y estas órdenes son difíciles de leer, pero parecen ordenar a los semiorcos que busquen a los semi-Hombres. ¿Podrían referirse a los habitantes de la Comarca? ¿En Acebeda? Confieso que no entiendo el significado de estos acertijos.\
\
'Los semiorcos puede que no estén aquí para detener la expedición, pero aún así amenazan el trabajo de los enanos. Esperemos que tus esfuerzos los hayan dejado desorganizados e incapaces de llevar a cabo una maniobra contra mi gente.'","El enano Símbi te ha pedido que entres en la cueva de Filgogân y obtengas toda la información posible sobre el campamento de los semiorcos.","Deja la información sobre los semiorcos a Símbi","Recoge información sobre los semiorcos (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'No has regresado con toda la información que necesitamos, ${PLAYER}. ¡Vuelve a entrar en la cueva, si te atreves, y encuentra los fuegos de campamento restantes de los semiorcos!'","Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","Expedición: Órdenes para los semiorcos","'Los semiorcos seguramente tendrán el tipo de información que estamos buscando en cada uno de los fuegos de campamento que han construido dentro de la cueva de Filgogân. Órdenes, mapas, planes y cartas, todo nos será útil.'","'¡Ten cuidado, ${RACE}! Esta cueva alberga un gran campamento de semiorcos. No llevan mucho tiempo aquí, pero me parece que están reuniendo sus fuerzas para algún propósito siniestro. ¡Una vez que estén preparados, temo que atacarán a mi gente!\
\
'No podemos permitir que eso suceda. Si la Guarnición de Hierro va a sobrevivir, debemos asegurarnos de que los semiorcos no puedan montar una ofensiva efectiva.\
\
'Busca los fuegos de campamento de los semiorcos dentro de Filgogân, y recoge información de cada uno de ellos. Si puedes recuperar cualquier orden, mapa, informe o carta, seguramente dejaremos a estos semiorcos demasiado desorganizados para representar una gran amenaza para nuestra expedición.'","'Estoy vigilando de cerca a los semiorcos que ocupan la cueva de Filgogân.'","'Los semiorcos están desorganizados y deberían ser incapaces de montar un ataque efectivo.'","La información sobre los semiorcos puede encontrarse en sus fuegos de campamento dentro de la cueva de Filgogân, al suroeste del campamento de Bósi, al otro lado del Sirannon seco.\
\
Símbi te ha pedido que obtengas información de cada uno de los fuegos de campamento de los semiorcos dentro de la cueva de Filgogân.","Símbi se encuentra a las afueras de la cueva de Filgogân, al suroeste del campamento de Bósi, al otro lado del Sirannon seco.\
\
Has recopilado una gran cantidad de información sobre los semiorcos en la cueva de Filgogân, que deberías llevar a Símbi."},
[4932]={"The wounded Elves are at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin.\
\
Now that you have collected enough bandages, you should see to the treatment of the Elf-soldiers who were seriously wounded during the first wave of the assault upon Mirkwood.","'Thank you! I could not have done as well myself... even were my arm not broken!'","This crate is full of military supplies","'You... you have my thanks... good ${RACE}.'","Treat wounded Elves (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Collect bandages (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Expedition: Seeing to the Fallen","The Elf grimaces silently as you try to staunch the bleeding of a severe stomach wound.\
\
After you do the best you can, you move on, unsure whether he will live through the night.","'We have little time here before more wounded arrive or those who have been most sorely injured pass into the West, but we have not even had a chance to unpack our supplies as yet, and in the rush of the landing, these fools have mixed the bandages and other healer's goods in with the rest of the crates!\
\
'I need you to find the bandages in among the other supplies, then see to as many of the wounded as you can... and quickly!\
\
'Return to me when you have completed this task.'","YOU SHOULD NOT SEE THIS","In battles of such a scale as the Mirkwood landing, severe wounds and even death are an inevitable consequence, even among such fine warriors as the Mallhedrim.","Agorin is at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin","Collected bandages (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Do not mourn for us, ${PLAYER}, for our fallen await us in the Halls of the West.\
\
'We regret only the pain that such darkness inflicts and the vast gulf of time during which we must be parted from those we dearly love, and so we fight to live as fiercely as any mortal must.'","'My thanks to you, stranger. That seems to have stopped the bleeding.'","This soldier is having serious trouble breathing and cannot speak. You realize that the left side of his chest has been nearly crushed by some massive blow.\
\
You bandage some of his lesser wounds in an effort to comfort him, but he is clearly dying and beyond aid.","Treated wounded Elves (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Your care for our soldiers is timely and much appreciated, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'With some rest and healing, most of them should be able to return to Lothlórien to recover in a few days.\
\
'Those who cannot, we shall be reunited with in ages to come in the Furthest West....'","The supplies are at Echad Sirion, on the eastern banks of the Anduin.\
\
Agorin has tasked you with finding clean bandages that have been misplaced among the rest of the military supplies that were hastily brought across the Anduin.","Talk to Agorin at Echad Sirion"},
[4933]={"'Graug puede liderar a estos semiorcos, pero rinde cuentas a otro maestro.'","Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","'Debemos impedir que los semiorcos salgan de Filgogân y amenacen a la expedición.'","'Alguien envió a estos semiorcos a Acebeda, ${PLAYER}; me parece evidente que Graug, el jefe que ordenó que el campamento se estableciera dentro de Filgogân, tiene su propio maestro. Quiero saber quién podría ser.\
\
'Te recompensaré generosamente por cualquier prueba de la existencia de este supervisor. Entra en la cueva y lucha contra los semiorcos, y tráeme el punto común que une a estos semiorcos en lealtad al misterioso maestro de Graug.'","Expedición: El punto común","Los semiorcos que se encuentran dentro de la cueva de Filgogân, al suroeste del campamento de Bósi y al otro lado del Sirannon seco, seguramente llevan alguna prueba de su lealtad hacia el maestro de Graug.\
\
Símbi te ha pedido que averigües el punto común que une a estos semiorcos, y que le traigas pruebas de ello.","Símbi quiere saber quién ha enviado a los semiorcos a Filgogân, donde su presencia amenaza la expedición de enanos que ha venido a Acebeda.","'Aún no has encontrado pruebas suficientes de quién supervisa a estos semiorcos, ${PLAYER}. Regresa al interior y deja de perder el tiempo, a menos que esta tarea sea demasiado ardua para ti.'","Lleva las piedras pintadas a Símbi","'¿Dices que los semiorcos llevaban estas piedras, cada una de ellas pintada con este símbolo de mano? Esta no es la marca de Graug; debe ser ciertamente el emblema de su maestro.\
\
'No lo reconozco. Mostraré esta marca a Bósi cuando regrese al campamento; quizás él entienda su significado.\
\
'Gracias por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}, y toma estas monedas como muestra de mi agradecimiento.'","'Quizás los semiorcos llevan algún signo de su lealtad hacia el misterioso maestro de Graug. Deberías entrar en la cueva y traerme pruebas de este punto común.'","Símbi se encuentra fuera de la entrada de la cueva de Filgogân, al suroeste del campamento de Bósi, al otro lado del Sirannon seco.\
\
Has recuperado piedras, pintadas de forma tosca con el emblema de una mano, de muchos de los semiorcos dentro de Filgogân, y ahora deberías llevarlas a Símbi."},
[4934]={"Throttólf se encuentra en la caverna llamada Gruta de las Aguas Negras, cerca de la entrada, por un pasaje desde la base de la cascada.\
\
Encontraste la caja fuerte en lo alto de la cascada, pero cualquier tesoro que pudiera haber contenido se ha convertido en polvo hace mucho tiempo. Deberías regresar con estas noticias a Throttólf.","Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","Throttólf quiere que encuentres el punto más alto de la cascada dentro de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, y veas si puedes recuperar el tesoro mencionado por Ógur.","El tesoro del que habló Ógur podría estar en lo alto de la cascada, en las profundidades de la caverna conocida como la Gruta de las Aguas Negras.\
\
Throttólf te ha pedido que encuentres los pasajes que conducen al punto más alto de la cascada para que puedas investigar la posibilidad de que se pueda encontrar algún tesoro allí.","La caja fuerte no contiene más que polvo.","'¡Imagínate los tesoros que encontraremos dentro de Khazad-dûm!'","'Tenía demasiadas ganas de creer que podría haber un tesoro en la Gruta de las Aguas Negras. Me equivoqué.'","Encuentra la caja fuerte en lo alto de la cascada","Expedición: En lo alto de la cascada","'¿Encontraste la caja fuerte? Bueno, ¿dónde está? ¿Qué tesoro encontró Ógur que pueda justificar las pérdidas que hemos sufrido aquí?'\
\
El rostro de Throttólf se descompone cuando le dices que la caja fuerte no contenía más que polvo.\
\
'Ya veo. Tal vez fui un tonto por esperar un tesoro poderoso, pero como estamos tan cerca de Khazad-dûm, pensé que quizás...\
\
'No importa. Gracias por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}. Las verdaderas riquezas seguramente estarán dentro de las minas, en lugar de en estas cuevas húmedas. Esta caja fuerte debe haber contenido los objetos de algún bandido hace mucho tiempo, y ningún tesoro en absoluto. Es una pena.'","'Me alegra que estés aquí, ${PLAYER}. Mi grupo se separó poco después de entrar en la Gruta de las Aguas Negras, y aún no he podido reunirme con ellos.\
\
'Sin embargo, casi encontré a mi amigo Ógur; parece que logró llegar al punto más alto de la cascada por este pasaje, de alguna manera, y lo escuché gritar sobre una especie de caja fuerte que encontró en la cima. Temo que los lagartos de las cavernas debieron haber sido atraídos por el sonido de sus gritos, porque no he tenido noticias suyas desde entonces.\
\
'Si puedes encontrar los mismos pasajes que él usó para llegar al punto más alto de la cascada, sin embargo, podrías ser capaz de encontrar el tesoro del que habló. Te recompensaré generosamente por cualquier noticia al respecto, ${PLAYER}, y también por cualquier noticia sobre el destino de Ógur, por supuesto.'","'Si Ógur encontró algún pasaje que lo llevó al punto más alto de la cascada por ese pasaje, estoy seguro de que tú puedes hacer lo mismo. Me pregunto qué tesoro podría contener la caja fuerte.'"},
[4935]={"'¡Lofrík será vengado! Yo, Trausti, lo he jurado!'","'¿No has encontrado la dentadura de oro característica de Lofrík? Me alegra, pero debo pedirte que sigas buscando entre los montones de huesos aquí en Filgogân. Algún instinto me dice que debemos temer lo peor.'","Pilas de huesos pueden encontrarse por toda la caverna de Filgogân, y la dentadura de oro de Lofrík podría estar entre ellos.\
\
Trausti te ha pedido que busques en los montones de huesos dentro de la caverna la dentadura de oro característica de su amigo Lofrík.","Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","'¡Baja la voz, ${PLAYER}! He logrado permanecer sin ser visto por los semiorcos hasta ahora, pero acampan por toda Filgogân y no sé cuánto tiempo más podré permanecer sin ser detectado.\
\
He estado buscando a mi amigo Lofrík, que desapareció en las cercanías de Filgogân poco después de que la expedición llegara a Acebeda. Temo que haya sido asesinado por los semiorcos, pero debo saberlo con certeza.\
\
Los semiorcos construyen siniestros montones con los huesos de sus víctimas: puedes verlos en varios lugares dentro de Filgogân. Lofrík tenía una dentadura de oro característica; es un asunto desagradable, pero te recompensaré bien si puedes buscar entre estos montones y devolverme su dentadura, si la encuentras. Espero que no encuentres nada de eso, pero si lo haces, al menos entonces sabré el destino de Lofrík.'","Trausti está preocupado de que su amigo Lofrík pueda haber sido asesinado por los semiorcos, y quiere que busques su dentadura de oro característica.","Has encontrado una dentadura de oro astillada entre los huesos","Trausti se encuentra en algún lugar dentro de la caverna de Filgogân.\
\
Has encontrado la dentadura de oro característica de Lofrík, y deberías regresar con las tristes noticias de la muerte de su amigo a Trausti.","Expedición: Un asunto desagradable","Busca entre los montones de huesos en Filgogân la dentadura de oro de Lofrík","Has fallado en encontrar la dentadura de oro que buscas","'Esperaba que no encontraras nada, ${PLAYER}, pero al menos ahora sé de la muerte de Lofrík y puedo llorar por fin. Soldaré su dentadura en el mango de mi hacha, y de esta manera me ayudará a partir muchos enemigos. Buscaremos venganza, él y yo juntos.\
\
¡Lofrík! Lamentablemente, nunca verás los salones de Khazad-dûm brillando como antes. Te vengaré sobre las cabezas de los semiorcos que invaden esta tierra de nuestros padres, tierra donde su trabajo una vez moldeó la piedra en una esplendor inconmensurable. Que tu memoria arda mucho tiempo bajo la tierra.'","'Te estaría muy agradecido si buscaras entre los montones de cráneos que estos semiorcos han hecho por toda Filgogân la dentadura de oro de mi amigo Lofrík. Espero que no la encuentres, ${PLAYER}, pero si lo haces, al menos sabré su destino.'","Lleva la dentadura de oro astillada a Trausti","'Estos semiorcos nunca saldrán de Filgogân vivos.'"},
[4936]={"'Filgogân puede parecer extensa, pero no es nada comparada con las grandes salas de Khazad-dûm.'","Sandar se encuentra con Bósi en el pequeño campamento de enanos, al noreste de la cueva de Filgogân.\
\
Has diezmado las filas de los semiorcos en la cueva de Filgogân y derrotado a su líder Graug. Ahora solo te queda volver a ver a Sandar.","Has derrotado a los semiorcos en Filgogân (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Semiorcos! ¡Cómo los odio!'","Expedición: No son bienvenidos en Acebeda","El enano Sandar te ha pedido que ayudes a la expedición derrotando a los semiorcos, que han establecido su campamento dentro de la cueva de Filgogân.","Solo puede completarse antes de que la Expedición entre en Moria.","'Filgogân se encuentra en la esquina suroeste de las colinas circundantes; tendrás que cruzar el lecho seco del Sirannon y continuar marchando hacia el suroeste. El campamento de los semiorcos probablemente sea muy extenso, y Graug seguro que se encuentra en su interior.'","'¡Graug y los suyos no son bienvenidos en Acebeda, y se lo has dejado claro!'","'¡Te doy las gracias de todo corazón, ${PLAYER}! Los semiorcos no son bienvenidos en Acebeda, tan cerca de Khazad-dûm, y ahora Graug lo sabe. Aunque no le sirve de mucho ahora, ¿eh? ¡Ja!\
\
'Eres buen ${RACE}, ${PLAYER}, y me alegro de tenerte a nuestro lado. ¡Que demuestres ser tan útil más allá de las puertas cuando entremos en las Minas de Moria!'","'Bósi me ha asegurado que la Puerta de Acebeda será desenterrada pronto, pero aún así me preocupa que nuestra expedición pueda quedarse fuera de Khazad-dûm durante algunos días. Las colinas resuenan con el aullido de los lobos, pero poco más se puede oír; ¡cómo nos hacen estremecer en el silencio! Acebeda en el pasado estaba lleno de vida, pero ahora incluso los pájaros parecen sospechosos y hostiles.\
\
'Estas colinas están llenas de cavernas naturales, aunque ninguna se acerca a la esplendor de los pasajes sin trabajar de Khazad-dûm. Criaturas desagradables han tomado refugio en algunas de estas, y temo que causarán problemas a mi gente si permanecemos aquí demasiado tiempo.\
\
'Al suroeste, al otro lado del lecho seco del Sirannon, está la cueva llamada Filgogân. Una compañía de semiorcos tiene un campamento en lo profundo de ese lugar; si quieres ayudar a los enanos de esta expedición, deberás reducir sus números y derrotar a su líder, Graug.'","'¡Bósi y Brogur nos han traído aquí para reclamar Khazad-dûm. Ojalá logremos la victoria!'","Derrota a los semiorcos en la cueva de Filgogân (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La caverna de Filgogân se encuentra al suroeste de Sandar, al otro lado del lecho seco del Sirannon, en la esquina suroeste de las colinas circundantes.\
\
Sandar te ha pedido que derrotes a los semiorcos que han acampado dentro de Filgogân, así como a su líder Graug."},
[4938]={"Explored the south-eastern chamber","Explored the main chamber","Talk to Yâshri outside of Ghâr Mejet","Ghâr Mejet is a vile place within the underground. Explore its chambers and report on your findings.","Explore the north-eastern chamber","'We do not know much about Ghâr Mejet. While we know the restless dead haunt this place, we have yet to explore the area more closely.\
\
'Could a capable adventurer such as yourself explore its chambers and report on your findings?'","'This information should be useful for any future forays and as a warning to those who might wander too closely to this place.\
\
'Your work has saved the lives of our peoples, and I cannot thank you enough.'","Explored the south-western chamber","Explored the north-western chamber","Explore the south-western chamber","Inform Yâshri of your findings.","Explore the main chamber","Ghâr Mejet is a vile place within the underground. Explore its chambers and report your findings to Yâshri.","Explore the north-western chamber","Explore the south-eastern chamber","The main chamber of Ghâr Mejet is the vilest place in the area. Explore its chambers and report on your findings.","Explore Ghâr Mejet","Explored the north-eastern chamber"},
[4940]={"Varthmath seeks to learn more about the frenzied stone-claws in Máttugard.","Collect bones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I am glad that the runes will be dealt with. The new information that Voina has given us is concerning. Could there be more strange runes on this side of Máttugard as well? We should travel towards the burrows of Ronglagam as soon as we are able and collect some more samples.'","Exploring Ronglagam","Talk to Varthmath at Zidir-nesad","Ronglagam can be found south-east of Zidir-nesad in Máttugard.\
\
You should travel to Ronglagam.","Varthmath can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset, in Máttugard.\
\
You should talk to Varthmath at Zidir-nesad.","Defeated stone-claws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect dirt samples (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Varthmath inspects the samples of the stone-claw burrows.\
\
'Hmm, nothing seems tainted or poisoned here. You would not know that from the way these stone-claws are acting, though!'","Ronglagam can be found south-east of Zidir-nesad in Máttugard.\
\
You should defeat stone-claws and collect samples at Ronglagam.","'${CLASS}, I will see to the destruction of these runes you have given me. You have my word.\
\
'Now, I have just recently been informed about something that might interest you and your Beorning friend. There seems to be more frantic stone-claws nearby in a large burrow called Ronglagam. It might be worth investigating as Ronglagam is not far from the foundation of the Steepset. Dwarf-made buildings are as sturdy as they come, but nothing can last from the continuous gnawing of the stone-claws.'","Travel to Ronglagam","Bring the samples to Varthmath near Ronglagam","The burrows are crawling with stone-claws","Varthmath can be found near Ronglagam in Máttugard.\
\
You should bring the samples to Varthmath.","Collected dirt samples (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected bones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat stone-claws at Ronglagam (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4941]={"Has descubierto los cubiles orcos de Uzbad-bakân","Explorando Uzbad-bakân","Explora la armería de Uzbad-bakân","Uzbad-bakân se encuentra al sur del Salón del Agua que fluye.\
\
Deberías dirigirte al sur a través de Zelem-melek y explorar Uzbad-bakân, la fortaleza de los orcos en Zelem-melek.","Has descubierto las cocinas de Uzbad-bakân","Uzbad-bakân es un vasto campamento lleno de orcos. Deberías explorar todos sus rincones.","Explora las cocinas de Uzbad-bakân","Búi te ha encomendado que explores la vasta ciudad orca de Uzbad-bakân.","'No me gusta cómo suena tu historia, ${PLAYER}. Hay demasiados orcos para mi gusto en Zelem-melek, y solo tendría sentido si hay alguna gran fortaleza de la que salen.\
\
'Continuaré con mi camino prudentemente, tomando notas para mis mapas. Quizá quieras explorar el campamento orco, aunque yo preferiría quedarme bien lejos de él.\
\
'¡Buena suerte!'","Explora las moradas de los orcos de Uzbad-bakân","Has descubierto la forja de Uzbad-bakân","El capataz Mögr se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Has explorado el enorme campamento orco de Uzbad-bakân, encontrándolo fuerte y bien protegido. Deberías compartir eesta información con Mögr cuanto antes.","Explora la forja de Uzbad-bakân","Háblable al capataz Mögr de la presencia de muchos orcos en Zelem-melek","Has descubierto la armería de Uzbad-bakân","'¡Orcos por todas partes! Esto es terrible, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'No me gusta el estado del paso del sur hacia Zelem-melek. El puesto de Guardia Orca ha sido establecido cerca de allí. Si fortificas ese puesto avanzado, creo que estaremos en mejor posición.'"},
[4945]={"¡Has comenzado tu exploración de Zelem-melek!\
\
Mientras exploras esta laberíntica zona, seguro que encuentras muchos peligros y aventuras.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Zelem-melek ofrece muchas misiones que se desbloquearán cuando las descubras. ¡Intenta visitar lugares importantes y puntos de interés para encontrar nuevas misiones!<rgb>","Dirígete hacia el este y comienza tu exploración de Zelem-melek","Completado","Mögr te ha pedido que continúes tu exploración de Zelem-melek para tener una comprensión más detallada de este peligroso sector de Moria, comenzando con los Vastos Salones.","Los Vastos Salones están en el fondo del Gran Salón de Durin.\
\
Deberías comenzar tu exploración de Zelem-melek en los Vastos Salones.","Comienza tu exploración de Zelem-melek reclamando los Vastos Salones (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los grandes pasadizos de Zelem-melek se encuentran dirigiéndose hacia el este por la sala inferior.\
\
Deberías dirigirte hacia el este, donde colocaste los estandartes.","Estandarte colocado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has llegado a una encrucijada en Zelem-melek. ¡Tu exploración de esta enorme, sinuosa y sobrecogedora área dará lugar a muchas aventuras!","'Debo regresar a la Sala Vigesimoprimera, pero debo pedirte que continúes tu exploración de Zelem-melek . Imagino que encontrarás muchos objetos de interés escondidos en los salones olvidados.\
\
'Si volvieses a la Sala Vigesimoprimera, hazme saber qué has encontrado...'","Explorando los Vastos Salones","Has comenzado tu exploración de Zelem-melek."},
[4946]={"'Flogalith is home to many large nests that contain recently-hatched whelplings and unhatched eggs. The eggs are too large to break one by one, but I have an idea!'\
\
She pulls out a small satchel and opens it to reveal many small metal containers containing explosive powder.\
\
'These are favourites of Ausma! Has she shared them with you before? I think with these you might be able to take care of those nests quite easily... quite easily indeed! You can see the rising path to Flogalith just across the channel to the north-west there.'","Molkha has given you a satchel of explosive containers to quickly destroy the many cliff-top drake nests.\
\
You should destroy drake nests in Flogalith with Molkha's bombs. The sloping path to Flogalith is to the north-west of Molkha's position.","'I could hear those bombs from here! BOOM! I am so glad Ausma introduced me to these. And to you, ${PLAYER}, of course!\
\
'But especially to the bombs.'","You have destroyed many drake nests in Flogalith.\
\
You should return to Molkha on the frozen lake south-west of Fellgát.","Talk to Molkha in the valley","Explosive Nest Removal","Destroyed drake nests (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy drake nests (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Molkha has a plan to quickly clear out many of the drake nests in Flogalith."},
[4947]={"Picked up barrels of black powder (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Elder Jurmêna has tasked you with destroying the goblin weapons of war by using their own explosives against them.","'The goblins mean to make war on Sen Chatâk. Our few able-bodied were able to scout their camp. They are building catapults and gathering barrels of hot tar.\
\
'We cannot stand against these weapons. We can barely repel the raiders with axes and bows, let alone these larger, more foul weapons.\
\
'But I believe in their greed they have given us an opening. They have been gathering barrels of black powder, no doubt for some putrid purpose. I suspect we can use their own weapons against them. If you set their black powder alight near their catapults, we can destroy both weapons with one flame.\
\
'Will you help us?'","Set alight black powder near catapults within Glúkroz.","'Oh what a sight it must have been! I wish I had seen it for myself! I can only imagine the flame and smoke that must have spewed forth. Well done, outsider!'","Return to Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk","Pick up barrels of black powder (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Elder Jangâli in Sen Chatâk.","Pick up barrels of black powder and destroy goblin catapults in Glúkroz. Glúkroz can be found north-east of Sen Chatâk.","Explosive Repercussions","Set alight catapults with black powder (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4948]={"You have delivered the supplies at the specified location.\
\
Shúkurz also asked you to whistle after dropping off the supplies.","Extending a Helping Hand","Talk to Shúkurz","Shúkurz has asked you to take fresh supplies to a supply drop.\
\
You should take some supplies from the supply area of Aslíf.","With Shúkurz's help, Náin may yet be found.","Supplies retrieved","'Well, your friend's suspicions were right. Gorgar's generals have got that Náin fellow locked up at Dhúrstrok.'","'...Fine. I -- I'll see what's happening in Dhúrstrok. Pretending to bring information on that delayed weapons shipment should be enough for them to let me in. I think.\
\
'${PLAYER}, could you send those supplies to my pals? They've been imprisoned for a while. Don't want any of them becoming dead weight on the journey ahead.\
\
'There's a supply drop location that we use. Take the stairs around the pillar to the top level -- there're some gates east of the pillar. Drop the supplies off at the gates, then give a whistle.'","<rgb=#00ff00>Whistle</rgb> at the supply drop","Retrieve supplies in Aslíf","You should talk to Shúkurz and see if he will agree to Múta's plan.","Deliver supplies","For a moment, you feel someone watching... then the sensation disappears","'I feel terrible for not realizing what Lord Náin's intentions were sooner. Even if his actions were hasty, he shouldn't suffer at Gorgar's hands or waste away in shackles. Unfortunately, we have no information about the layout of Dhúrstrok.'\
\
She pauses to ponder for a moment.\
\
'Shúkurz, you have proven yourself twice now; I am sorry we distrusted you so deeply. Would you be able to go to Dhúrstrok yourself and gather information? Gorgar's Orcs would have no reason to suspect your presence there. In return, you'd be free to take some of our supplies from the supply area downstairs.'","You have delivered the supplies and done everything Shúkurz asked of you.\
\
You should return to Aslíf on the upper tier and talk to him if he's returned.","Talk to Shúkurz in Aslíf","You have retrieved fresh supplies to deliver.\
\
You should find the drop point in front of some gates at the top level of the 'Abad-nuhbu, to the east."},
[4951]={"Sigeric is in the prison of Snowbourn.\
\
Gísling wants you to interrogate Sigeric and see if he is willing to part with any information about who sent him to undermine Snowbourn.","Talk to Sigeric","'...'","'So that wretch had more to say, eh?\
\
'He was wise to silence himself in my presence.... Such a traitor to my people will never taste freedom again.\
\
'Come then, what had he to say?'","'That arrogant fool. He would see all of the Riddermark burn for his own ends?\
\
'Fastred must be told of this immediately.'","Sigeric was revealed to be the traitor in the midst of the Men of Snowbourn.","Sigeric can be found inside the prison of Snowbourn.\
\
You should talk to Sigeric.","Talk to Fastred","'I thank you again for my freedom. I respect Fastred still, even after this wronging....\
\
'${PLAYER}, head back to the prison of Snowbourn.\
\
'Let not Sigeric rest from his ordeal; the time to question him is now. He might resist, but the time to hesistate is over... do whatever is necessary to make him talk. Rohan will not fall because we were too frightened to take the proper action.'","Fastred can be found in the Mead Hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Sigeric has proven to be a brutal traitor of Rohan, and Gísling wishes for you to tell Fastred of Sigeric's threats against the Sutcrofts.","Sigeric can be found inside the prison of Snowbourn.\
\
Sigeric refuses to cooperate with the people of Snowbourn and has now mocked your attempts to break his will. Perhaps you should take a more threatening approach.","<rgb=#FF00FF>Stare</rgb> Sigeric down and see if he talks","Sigeric does not seem willing to talk","Talk to Gísling","Extracting Information","<rgb=#FF00FF>Shake your fist</rgb> at Sigeric","Sigeric is in the prison of Snowbourn.\
\
Perhaps if you <rgb=#FF00FF>stare</rgb> Sigeric down, he will break.","'Do you honestly believe that I have anything to fear? It is not as if I shall be sent to Stangard. All I have to do is wait.\
\
'Snowbourn will lie in ashes, the fool Reeve and his filthy kin will be no more, and the rest of the Eastemnet will fall with them.\
\
'So I urge you, tell them. Tell that man I shared this prison with, tell the Reeve; it will not matter.'","Sigeric smirks slightly, but remains silent","Gísling can be found in central Snowbourn.\
\
You should report Sigeric's refusal to cooperate to Gísling."},
[4953]={"Ojo de la tormenta","Echad Garthadir, el campamento de los Montaraces en Annúminas, sufre constantes ataques.","'No sé qué horrores te encontrarás cuando llegues a Echad Garthadir, ¡así que prepárate para cualquier cosa!'","'Acabo de recibir noticias de que nuestro campamento en Annúminas está sufriendo un ataque intenso y casi constante. Echad Garthadir es nuestro único punto de apoyo en la propia ciudad, y no podemos permitirnos perderlo.\
\
'Creo que podemos encargarnos de lo que queda por hacer aquí, dentro de las tumbas. ¡Por favor, dirígete a Echad Garthadir y únete a la lucha allí!'","'Te doy la bienvenida al centro del conflicto, ${PLAYER}. Si los saqueadores de tumbas o los Gauredain te han dado problemas en el pasado, te aconsejo que te marches ahora mismo. Las batallas aquí son para auténticos guerreros.'","Echad Garthadir se encuentra a cierta distancia del Camino de los Reyes, dentro de Annúminas.\
\
Los Montaraces te han enviado a prestar ayuda a Echad Garthadir.","Habla con Adadhrond en Echad Garthadir"},
[4956]={"'Agelric told me of your efforts to drive the crebain from our crofts. You aided us greatly, but as always, the crebain have flocked back to Garsfeld.\
\
'When the crebain first arrived, they came from the west. They were simply a nuisance at first, but you can see for yourself what they have done to our crops.\
\
'I had the crofters set traps near their homes a few weeks back, but since the goblins and half-orcs raided our fields, the traps have been of little use. If you would, travel out to the crofts and thin their numbers. Also, if you could place bait in the traps, we might find at least some success against these fiends.'","Bait traps for crebain (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The crebain and traps can be found to the south-west of Garsfeld.\
\
Gísil wants you to defeat the crebain that have flocked around Garsfeld and bait traps outside the town to ensnare the foul birds.","'Very good. The crebain should no longer pose such a threat to us.\
\
'The time has come for a discussion... about your actions here and about the future of Garsfeld.\
\
'But for now, you again have my thanks.'","Gísil can be found in the Mead Hall of Garsfeld.\
\
You should return to Gísil and let him know that you have done as he directed.","Baited traps for crebain (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Eyes Out of the Sky","Gísil has noticed that, despite your efforts, crebain continue to harry the crofters.","Crebain derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Gísil at the Mead Hall of Garsfeld","Derrota a los crebain (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4957]={"The eyes and ears of Madh-fushaum, the Uruk-hai sentry in the watch-towers around the outer wall are entrusted with the safety of the entire army.","Defeat Uruk-hai sentries (0/6)","Eyes and Ears of Madh-fushaum","The wall outside of Madh-fushaum has enemies that never sleep, and are the eyes and ears of the army within. Any solid network of sentries has multiple layers, and the watch-towers along the wall make-up a strong inner layer.","Defeat Uruk-hai sentries (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The eyes and ears of Madh-fushaum, the Uruk-hai sentry in the watchtowers around the outer wall are entrusted with the safety of the entire army.","The Uruk-hai sentries were battle-hardened warriors and a crucial aspect of the White Hand army. Removing them struck a blow to the safety and coordination of the forces within Madh-fushaum.","An army of this size needs a strong network of sentries to ensure communication throughout the soldiers and can respond to incoming threats.","Uruk-hai sentry defeated (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Their army is now blind to incoming threats, but more importantly are even less aware of your passing.","Completado"},
[4958]={"You have found the source of the spiders in Cirith Ungol: the Under-gate.","'While I seek out this emissary of the Gúrzyul in the turret, you must find the source of the spiders!\
\
'You spoke of a gate in the depths of the tower...perhaps the spiders of Shelob's brood have found a way to breach it.\
\
'If that is so, we must move even more swiftly to stem the tide!\
\
'Go now, and I shall meet you in the turret!'","The Under-gate has been ripped open, exposing the tower to the tunnels of Torech Ungol!","The source of the spiders can be found somewhere within the Tower of Cirith Ungol.\
\
Legolas has asked you to find the source of Shelob's brood in the Tower of Cirith Ungol.","Eyes in the Dark","As countless spiders of Shelob's brood pour forth from the Tower of Cirith Ungol, Legolas hopes to uncover their source and prevent more from swarming into the fortress.","Completado","You have discovered the Under-gate ripped open in the depths of the Tower of Cirith Ungol. The tunnels of Torech Ungol now lead directly into the tower!\
\
You should bring word to Legolas in the turret of the Tower of Cirith Ungol as soon as you are able.","Find the source of Shelob's brood in the Tower of Cirith Ungol"},
[4959]={"Return to Neshurga in Ub Nishir with the information you've gathered on Utug-bûr.","Arrived at the Utug-bûr scouting location","Return to Neshurga in Ub Nishir","'Ah, ${CLASS}, what have you learned of the demon-pits?'\
\
You inform Neshurga of what you learned while scouting Utug-bûr.\
\
'So there are even more of these monstrous creatures pouring from Utug-bûr. That is what I feared, and it appears we are losing the battle everywhere. Thank you for bringing this information to me.'","Scout Utug-bûr from the location that Neshurga described.","Neshurga has asked you to go investigate Utug-bûr because he needs more information on what they are up against in Urash Dâr.","Scout out Utug-bûr to gather information","Reach the Utug-bûr scouting location that Neshurga described.","Reach the Utug-bûr scouting location","'Yes? You must be the ${PLAYER} of which Galâmka spoke. I am Neshurga.\
\
'I am in need of your assistance. We do not know much about our enemy that came from this Utug-bûr, this demon-pit. We have only seen these monsters when they took Maurûsh from us.\
\
'If you would, I ask that you travel to Utug-bûr and learn what you can. Along the river are hills that you may find a good vantage point, but I suggest you keep your distance from the gates of Utug-bûr, that is more danger than it is worth.'","Scouted Utug-bûr","Eyes in the Demon-pit"},
[4960]={"Egbalth can be found near one of the burned houses at Bosa's Farm in northern Kingstead.\
\
You have spotted a fallen soldier of Middlemead. You should investigate if this is the man Mágla meant for you to meet.","Thane Mágla is concerned that an agent of Wormtongue lurks within Middlemead, and hopes for you to work alongside his trusted councilman to expose the traitor.","Bosa's Farm can be found to the east of Middlemead in northern Kingstead.\
\
Thane Mágla has asked you to seek out Egbalth in hopes of aiding him in exposing the agent of Wormtongue in Middlemead.","You have encountered a slain Rohirrim.","Bosa's Farm can be found in northern Kingstead.\
\
You have arrived at Bosa's Farm to find it overrun by the White Hand. You should search the farm for any signs of life.","Travel to Bosa's Farm","Examine Egbalth","'As I mentioned, ${PLAYER}, I believe Wormtongue's influence still lingers in Kingstead.\
\
'To that end, I have kept careful watch on the people of Middlemead. Our trade routes from the Broadacres and the Stonedeans have been disrupted by the White Hand, and I sense that our fields are next. I sent one of my finest warriors to station at Bosa's Farm to the east to ensure that crops continue to flow into our settlement.\
\
'I wish for you to rally to Egbalth's side at Bosa's Farm. Perhaps you can offer him aid in warding off the White Hand as the farmhands ready the harvest for trade, and when you both return, we can speak more of our suspicions.'","Eyes in the Field","You spot a Rohirrim warrior fallen amidst the wreckage","Bosa's Farm has been overrun by the White Hand","Search for any sign of Egbalth","Egbalth's lifeless body is slumped against the side of a burned home, and brutal wounds are visible through punctures in his armour.\
\
Whether his horn was sounded or not, it is clear that aid did not arrive in time."},
[4961]={"Scout the path to the Rohirrim scout-camp","Scouted the path to the Rohirrim scout-camp","Andreg is preparing to part company with you. You should speak with him to find out where to go from here.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completing this quest will make it impossible to acquire new discoverables from Andreg and will fail the Tracking an Old Goat deed and any unresolved discoverables.</rgb>","Talk to Andreg","'Indeed, I will set you on the path to Saeradan and the Horse-lords, but first I need your assistance. My mission in this wood is to scout for signs of Gwyllion, the Old Woman of the Mountain. My efforts have proven unfruitful as of yet, but perhaps with your aid, that will change.\
\
'As we journey towards the scout-camp, perhaps you may help scout the forest between here and there? If we find signs of Gwyllion's passage, you can then deliver word of it to Saeradan.\
\
'What say you? We will need to stay along the north face of the southern hills, for that is the section I am assigned to scout, and I can only take you as far as the pass to the Isendale, for I must part ways with you there.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completing this quest will make it impossible to acquire new discoverables from Andreg and will fail the Tracking an Old Goat deed and any unresolved discoverables.</rgb>","The Rangers Saeradan, Amlan, and Andreg have tracked Gwyllion, the Old Woman of the Mountain, from the Windfells in Enedwaith to the Gravenwood of Dunland.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completing this quest will make it impossible to acquire new discoverables from Andreg and will fail the Tracking an Old Goat deed and any unresolved discoverables.</rgb>","Andreg has asked you to help him scout the Gravenwood -- specifically the path to the Rohirrim scout-camp -- for signs of Gwyllion's passage.","'We have seen strange things on this path, ${PLAYER}, and strange things are a good sign that Gwyllion has come this way.\
\
'Thank you for your help.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completing this quest will make it impossible to acquire new discoverables from Andreg and will fail the Tracking an Old Goat deed and any unresolved discoverables.</rgb>","Eyes in the Forest"},
[4962]={"'We have seen strange things on this path, ${PLAYER}, and strange things are a good sign that Gwyllion has come this way.\
\
'Thank you for your help.'","Andreg is preparing to part company with you. You should speak with him to find out where to go from here.","'Indeed, I will set you on the path to Saeradan and the Horse-lords, but first I need your assistance. My mission in this wood is to scout for signs of Gwyllion, the Old Woman of the Mountain. My efforts have proven unfruitful as of yet, but perhaps with your aid, that will change.\
\
'As we journey towards the scout-camp, perhaps you may help scout the forest between here and there? If we find signs of Gwyllion's passage, you can then deliver word of it to Saeradan.\
\
'What say you? We will need to stay along the north face of the southern hills in the <rgb=#FFFF00>South Gravenwood</rgb>, for that is the section I am assigned to scout, and I can only take you as far as the pass to the Isendale, for I must part ways with you there.'","Scout the path through the <rgb=#FFFF00>South Gravenwood</rgb> to the Rohirrim scout-camp and deal with the many threats that face the Rohirrim and Grey Company","Andreg has asked you to help him scout the <rgb=#FFFF00>South Gravenwood</rgb> -- specifically the path to the Rohirrim scout-camp -- for signs of Gwyllion's passage.","Talk to Andreg","Scouted the path through the <rgb=#FFFF00>South Gravenwood</rgb>","The Rangers Saeradan, Amlan, and Andreg have tracked Gwyllion, the Old Woman of the Mountain, from the Windfells in Enedwaith to the Gravenwood of Dunland.","Eyes in the Forest"},
[4964]={"Faroniel está en Echad Sirion, en los Lindes Oscuros.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Faroniel con las noticias de tu éxito.","Espías alaoscura derrotados en los Lindes Oscuros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Faroniel en Echad Sirion","Los ojos de Dol Guldur","Los elfos de la Hueste Dorada han establecido un campamento en las costas de los Lindes Oscuros y buscan protegerlo contra los espías del Enemigo.","'¿Has derrotado a los espías de Dol Guldur? Sus amos no deben saber cómo de pequeño es nuestro campamento.'","Se pueden encontrar crebain y huargos por todos los Lindes Oscuros.\
\
Faroniel te ha pedido que ciegues a los ojos de Dol Guldur derrotando a muchos de los crebain y huargos que rondan por los Lindes Oscuros.","Derrota a los espías alaoscura en los Lindes Oscuros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los exploradores huargo en las Lindes Oscuros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los crebain de las Tierras Brunas sirven a Saruman el Blanco, pero yo desconfío de todos los cuervos.'","'Si tienes un momento, ${PLAYER}, me gustaría hablar contigo. Nuestras fuerzas desembarcaron recientemente en esta orilla y expulsaron a los orcos tras una terrible batalla. Sin embargo, muchas criaturas oscuras siguen acechando estas cosas.\
\
'Muchos huargos y crebain rondan los Lindes Oscuros, sin duda espiando para el Enemigo en Dol Guldur. Los ojos de Dol Guldur deben ser cegado para que no sigan nuestros movimientos. Si purgaras a los crebain y huargos de estas costas, estaría muy agradecida.\
\
'Ten cuidado mientras completas tu tarea, ya que los exploradores trasgos también rondan por la orilla y podrían emboscarte.'","'¡Muy bien, ${PLAYER}! Pasará mucho antes de que los ojos de Dol Guldur se fijen en nosotros. Quizás para entonces, el resto de nuestras fuerzas se habrán unido a nosotros.'","'Los sabuesos del Enemigo son unas criaturas violentas, utilizadas como bestias de guerra, pero son lo suficientemente silenciosas para ser formidables exploradores.'","Explorador huargo derrotado en los Lindes Oscuros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4966]={"'¿Así que ahora los forasteros se interesan en los asuntos de Entibo? Bueno, vi algo un poco extraño hace unos días. La luna estaba oculta tras una nube, así que no puedo estar seguro, pero pensé que vi varias sombras cerca de la casa del Condestable, al sureste del pueblo. No estoy seguro de qué tendría eso que ver con el viejo Falco, sin embargo.'","El jardín de Falco está fallando por una razón desconocida, causando angustia entre la gente de Entibo.","'El jardín de Falco es su orgullo y alegría... Ojalá supiera cómo ayudarlo.'","'¿Dices que Lirio sabe lo que está pasando con Falco, pero no quiere decir nada? ¡Qué vergüenza para esa chica!'","'No, no, no puedo ayudarte... solo dile eso a Gammy. Simplemente no puedo...'","'¡Gammy! Ojalá no supiera lo que sé, pero lo sé. Le prometí a Falco que no diría nada... dile a Gammy que ojalá pudiera ayudar, pero no puedo.'","Habla con Gammy Cenagales en su granja","'¿Jardines? Tengo suficientes problemas con mis arañas. No puedo ayudarte en nada.'","'Solo habla con algunos de los habitantes de Entibo que están en la plaza del pueblo o en sus granjas. Uno de ellos podría saber algo sobre el jardín de Falco.'","Habla con los habitantes de Entibo","'No hay nada que pueda decirte sobre el jardín de Falco, aparte de que haría casi cualquier cosa por saber su secreto. Los jardines de todos los demás tuvieron ese horrible moho, excepto el suyo. Era el jardín más hermoso que había visto en mi vida.'","'¿Quizás puedas hablar con algunos de los otros habitantes de Entibo y ver si saben algo sobre lo que está pasando en el jardín de Falco? ¡Alguien seguramente sabe algo que podría ayudar!\
\
'Puedes encontrarlos vigilando sus propias granjas aquí en Entibo.\
\
'Necesitamos averiguar qué está pasando con el jardín de Falco, ya que él no nos lo dirá.'","'Falco siempre fue amable con Gar... Ojalá hubiera alguna manera de ayudar.'","Gammy Cenagales está en la segunda granja al norte del camino cerca de las granjas de Entibo.\
\
El conocimiento que obtuviste de la gente de Entibo será de gran interés para Gammy Cenagales, la chismosa del pueblo.","'El jardín de Falco siempre ha producido algunas de las mejores hierbas para pipa y productos... incluso mejores que los míos. No hay manera de saber qué causó la terrible plaga.'","'No sé nada sobre jardines, ¿pero te gustaría comprar una araña?'","'No, lo siento, no sé nada sobre lo que aqueja al pobre jardín de Falco.'","'¿El jardín de Falco? Era especial, sin duda... parecía capaz de resistir ese moho que apareció en los cultivos de los otros granjeros. Falco siempre fue el mejor jardinero de Entibo. Es triste si lo que dicen es cierto y se ha echado a perder.'","Ojos de Entibo","'No he visto nada fuera de lo común. Hay más animales últimamente, pero no creo que ninguno haya entrado en el jardín de Falco, o lo habríamos sabido.'","La gente de Entibo se puede encontrar cuidando y vigilando sus granjas o en el centro de Entibo.\
\
Gammy Cenagales ha recomendado que hables con algunos de los habitantes de Entibo para saber qué pasó con el jardín de Falco."},
[4967]={"Derrota hendrevail en las Gargantas del Bruinen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hendrevail derrotados en las Gargantas del Bruinen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los hendrevail pueden encontrarse en las Gargantas del Bruinen, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en las Gargantas del Bruinen, deberías encargarte de los hendrevail que han comenzado a aparecer allí.","Ojos del Enemigo","Los hendrevail, a menudo usados como espías por el Enemigo, han empezado a aparecer en las Gargantas del Bruinen."},
[4969]={"As you got closer to some of the prisoners, a shiny glint of something metal on the ground caught your eye. You should pick it up.","Eyes on the Enemy","You tell Nabatínu about the prisoners and show him the shiny button you found in the gravel.\
\
'This is a curious find,' he says, looking closely at the button. 'I have not seen its like before, but I will ask the others.\
\
'As for the prisoners, these Orcs; Utûgi, you called them? They have been patrolling the roads and attacking caravans, just as your friend Khagâmi experienced. They kill many, but they also take many prisoners. This must be where they bring them, but to what end, I do not know. I do not see them being turned into Jatsakóri, so it must be for some other evil purpose.'","You see something glinting on the ground","Talk to Nabatínu at Gadim-ûn","Investigate the prisoners","Rhadrog has asked you to scout Kôth Rau, the Ordâkhai stronghold in south-central An Shêru.","You have done what you can for the moment at Kôth Rau. You should return to Gadim-ûn and discuss what you found with Nabatínu.","You should talk to Rhadrog about Nabatínu's theory that defeating Ombátha may allow the enthralled Jatsakóri to break free.","Go to the Ordâkhai stronghold of Kôth Rau","'It's an interesting theory, but I cannot guess whether or not it would work. One thing is certain, though, someone should scout that fort, Kôth Rau. Are the Ordâkhai and the Utûgi truly cooperating, or is there tension between them?\
\
'If you would, ${PLAYER}, go and take a look. No need to go rushing in all on your lonesome, but we should learn more about what's happening there.'","Destroy banners of Barkhûsh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I fear that the only way to save the rest of the Jatsakóri would be to defeat Ombátha in battle, though I do not know if we have the strength as things currently stand. At the moment Barkhûsh was defeated, his servants suffered a moment of weakness. I think perhaps some of their power came from him, and that when a sorcerer is defeated, their spells may unravel to some degree.\
\
'I confess that I do not wish to face Ombátha. Just the thought strikes me with such dread that I begin to sweat, but I can think of no other way. Perhaps the Rangers have another idea?'","You found a decorative brass button","Kôth Rau still flies the banners of Sauron","You have come to Kôth Rau to scout out the situation at the Ordâkhai stronghold and found them flying the banners of Sauron, called Barkhûsh in this part of the world.","Talk to Rhadrog","As you destroyed banners of Barkhûsh at Kôth Rau, you noticed that they are holding prisoners here. You should assess the situation with the prisoners.","Banners destroyed (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Nabatínu worries that the only way to free the rest of the enthralled Jatsakóri may be to defeat Ombátha, which he fears may not be possible.","Pick up the shiny object"},
[4970]={"There is no sign of the Ungoledain here. Continue to head west towards Rushgate","Habla con Radagast","The defeated Ungoledain have retreated and are thought to be heading to Rushgate. Follow their tracks and look around to see where they are regrouping.","Continue to head west and scout for Ungoladan activity.","Radagast can be found in the north of the Thornholt woods.\
\
Return to Radagast and let him know what you've seen here in Rushgate.","Look to the west for Ungoladan activity","Eyes to the West","Look towards the west for any Ungoladan activity.","'It appears the Ungoledain have already been spotted heading towards Rushgate. We can't be sure if this was a small group of them or if their ranks are in far greater numbers to the west.\
\
'Track the Ungoledain, ${PLAYER}. Do not engage them though, if you can avoid it. They are in retreat and we want to keep an eye on them to see what they plan next.'","Enter Rushgate and scout for Ungoladan activity.","It is clear the Ungoledain were here and must have crossed the bridge.","'It seems the Ungoledain are moving out of Ered Mithrin. While I'm sure this isn't the last we've heard of them, I think it's safe to rest easy for now.'","There is no sign of the Ungoledain here. Continue to head into Rushgate","This location provides a good vantage point to the west"},
[4971]={"Scouted Gorthbar","'You have completed your patrol in the farthest reaches of Angmar? Excellent! I await your full report... it is vital that we know what goes on before the gates of Carn Dûm.'","'Greetings, ${PLAYER}. I have been asked by allies within the Council of the North to send capable scouts up into Angmar to help keep an eye on the movements of the Enemy.\
\
'It seems that something is astir within the dark lands of Angmar, and the Council is hard-pressed to stay abreast of all that the Enemy conspires.\
\
'In particular, I need you to scout through the lands of Himbar, Nan Gurth, and Imlad Balchorth. It will not be easy, but there are few others I would trust with this task.'","Scouted Minas Caul","Scouted Bail Dílas","Bail Dilas lies in Angmar, far to the north and east of Esteldín.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the encampment of Bail Dílas and see what forces are arrayed near the gates of Carn Dûm.","Gorthbar lies in Angmar, far to the north and east of Esteldín.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the graveyard of Gorthbar and see what dread rites the Enemy is performing in that horrid place.","Handarod is concerned with the Council of the North's efforts to track the movements of the forces of Angmar within their deepest strongholds.","Scout Bail Dílas","Minas Caul is in Angmar, far to the north and east of Esteldín.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the tower of Minas Caul and see what forces of the Enemy inhabit the Witch King's domain there.","Talk to Handarod","Eyes upon the Enemy","Scout Minas Caul","Scout Gorthbar","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the west and south of Angmar.\
\
You should report to Handarod and tell him what you have seen in the heart of Angmar."},
[4972]={"Eyesores Drifted Ashore","Cleaned up the flotsam on the beach (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The flotsam has been cleared from the shore? Thank you for your help!\
\
'Make sure you come back tomorrow, as there is always more washing up with the tides.'","Maghôrdo has asked you to clean up any flotsam you find on the island's southern beaches so that visitors will not be reminded of the peril of travelling here.","Talk to Maghôrdo","You have cleaned up the flotsam from shipwrecks along the island's southern beaches. You should report to Maghôrdo at Furtherholm's harbour, near the waterfall.","Due to the difficulty of navigating the turbulent waters of the Shield Isles, it is common for flotsam from shipwrecks to wash up on Furtherholm's southern shores.","'Navigating the waters of the Shield Isles can be quite challenging. Irregular winds, unusual currents, and reefs hidden just below the surface pose many dangers to ships if the crew is not up to the task. Because of this, it is not unusual for flotsam from shipwrecks to wash ashore on the southern beaches. Maybe it is not so good for visitors to see these things and be reminded that journeys here do not always end in the way they planned!\
\
'You would be doing me a great service if you would remove any flotsam you find on Furtherholm's southern shores.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends.</rgb>","Clean up the flotsam on the beach (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4973]={"You know that Ezôti's 'show' is no longer happening, and his animals have been freed","Ezôti's Menagerie","'Another interested set of eyes? Indeed, indeed! Rumour of my creatures has spread far and wide, but none so far as that concerning my latest acquisition!'","'Have you heard about the many animals that have been put on display in the menagerie of the Upper Ward? A man called Ezôti has gathered a number of fearsome creatures; just thinking about them fills me with dread!\
\
'He is to be found by Bith Gabâr in the Upper Ward. When I am done with my work I will go there right away!'","A man named Ezôti has assembled a fearsome collection of animals for his menagerie in the Upper Ward, and it is the talk of many folk in the Sail-haven.","Ezôti can be found by Bith Gabâr in the Upper Ward.","Talk to Ezôti by Bith Gabâr in the Upper Ward"},
[4974]={"Face the Cold","Defeat frost grims around Lake Isingmere","The frost grims along the edge of Lake Isingmere have been thinned drastically and shouldn't pose much of a threat for a while.","Deadly frost grims are appearing on the edge of Lake Isingmere and need to be defeated before their numbers grow.","Defeat frost grims around Lake Isingmere (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","If not thinned drastically, the frost grims around Lake Isingmere will eventually pose a grave threat.","The recent bout of cold weather has caused deadly frost grims to appear where the coast meets Lake Isingmere.","Sombrío de escarcha derrotado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado"},
[4976]={"Has destruido al hechicero Pesadilla en los Salones de la Noche.","Derrota a Pesadilla.","Has sido ${PLAYERNAME:apresado[m]|apresada[f]} en los Salones de la Noche y debes derrotar a Pesadilla y sus tenientes antes de que sea demasiado tarde.","Haciendo frente a tus miedos","Has vencido al espíritu cruel Pánico en los Salones de la Noche.","Derrota a Pesadilla","Derrota a Pánico","Has vencido al espíritu cruel Terror en los Salones de la Noche.","Derrota a Terror y Pánico.","Derrota a Terror"},
[4977]={"Question One:\
Belondor, Kinsman of the Fleet-fast, is married to an Umbari woman named Khâsha.","'Yes. This next one will not be easy.\
\
'The Church of the All-Seeing prized the sea-opal Abâshal, and used it to decorate its places of worship.'","Question Two:\
Azagath Sea-shadow has been known to walk through the markets of Umbar Baharbêl.","'Fine, you got it. How about this one?\
\
'The Sea-stone Mutiny, during which the Heirs of Castamir were overthrown, began in the Upper Ward of the city.'","Question Five:\
The name of this land comes from the word Umbru-mâra, which means 'Fruitful Land.'","<rgb=#FFFF00>'The Sea-stone Mutiny, during which the Heirs of Castamir were overthrown, began in the Upper Ward of the city.'</rgb>\
\
If the statement is <rgb=#00FF00>True</rgb>, stand under the green canopy\
If the statement is <rgb=#FF0000>False</rgb>, stand under the red canopy","Tafikh has challenged you to a game of Facts and Fictions, believing that you do not know enough about the people of Umbar Baharbêl and the Kindred of the Coins.","'I must admit I did not think you would defeat my game, but you have proven a master of Facts and Fictions! Well done, stranger! May you continue to use your knowledge of our land and our city to better the lives of its people! I must give you the reward I thought to keep for myself, for you have bested me in this contest as few before have done!'","Tafikh is waiting to ask you her third question.","'Ah, you came back! I did not know if you would. Does this mean you are prepared to play my game of Facts and Fictions? It will truly test how much you know about the Kindred of the Coins and the city of Umbar Baharbêl. But be warned: if you fail to answer a question correctly, it will be some time before I allow you to play again. It is only fair.\
\
'Here is how to play. Behind me you will see the ruined structure that was the Shrine of He-Who-Sees-All. The shrine is now mere rubble, as it should be; it stands as a testament now to the evils that the Empire of Ordakh inflicted upon us. To the south-east, on the left side of the ruin, I have erected a red canopy. There is a similar canopy to the south, on the right side of the ruin; that one is made of green cloth.\
\
'I will make a series of five statements. If the statement is true, you will stand under the green canopy. If the statement is false, you will stand under the red canopy. Return to me after each answer to hear the next statement. However, if you get one wrong you will need to begin my game again from the top... after spending a period of time mourning your lack of knowledge. Are you ready? Speak to me to begin.'","'¿Y bien?'","'You think you are smart? Then let us see your mastery of the language! This is the last question.\
\
'The name of this land comes from the word Umbru-mâra, which means 'Fruitful Land.''","Wrong answer! The game is over","Tafikh is waiting to ask you her fourth question.","<rgb=#FFFF00>'Belondor, Kinsman of the Fleet-fast, is married to an Umbari woman named Khâsha.'</rgb>\
\
If the statement is <rgb=#00FF00>True</rgb>, stand under the green canopy\
If the statement is <rgb=#FF0000>False</rgb>, stand under the red canopy","<rgb=#FFFF00>'The Church of the All-Seeing prized the sea-opal Abâshal, and used it to decorate its places of worship.'</rgb>\
\
If the statement is <rgb=#00FF00>True</rgb>, stand under the green canopy\
If the statement is <rgb=#FF0000>False</rgb>, stand under the red canopy","'Then let us begin.\
\
'Belondor, Kinsman of the Fleet-fast, is married to an Umbari woman named Khâsha.'","You are correct, and advance to the next round!","Talk to Tafikh","Tafikh is waiting to ask you her fifth question.","Tafikh is amazed that you answered all of her questions correctly.","<rgb=#FFFF00>'Azagath Sea-shadow has been known to walk through the markets of Umbar Baharbêl.'</rgb>\
\
If the statement is <rgb=#00FF00>True</rgb>, stand under the green canopy\
If the statement is <rgb=#FF0000>False</rgb>, stand under the red canopy","Tafikh is waiting to ask you her second question.","'Very good. A lucky guess. Next question.\
\
'Azagath Sea-shadow has been known to walk through the markets of Umbar Baharbêl.'","Question Four:\
The Sea-stone Mutiny, during which the Heirs of Castamir were overthrown, began in the Upper Ward of the city.","Question Three:\
The Church of the All-Seeing prized the sea-opal Abâshal, and used it to decorate its places of worship.","Facts and Fictions","<rgb=#FFFF00>'The name of this land comes from the word Umbru-mâra, which means 'Fruitful Land.''</rgb>\
\
If the statement is <rgb=#00FF00>True</rgb>, stand under the green canopy\
If the statement is <rgb=#FF0000>False</rgb>, stand under the red canopy","Tafikh is waiting to ask you her first question."},
[4978]={"Travel to Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade","Faded Fears","Talk to Léothred at Annâk-khurfu","Defeat Gundabad forces in Elderslade (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'We have made it to Elderslade! While we are here, we should assist the dwarves as best we can. Perhaps you should defeat some more of those Gundabad forces that we have encountered on our travels together.\
\
'Now Fróthi, where was I on Fram? Ah yes, Fram's death. Fram’s death brought new troubles for the Ai-thúda. It stirred the Orcs of the North, who had feared him, and though he left three sons, none were yet of age. The eldest, Gífica, was only ten when he succeeded Fram. The hordes of Gundabad seized upon the Ai-thúda's lack of an adult lord and caused much strife in the Wells for many years. Fram’s two elder sons died in battle with the Orcs. Gífica died in an ambush when he was only twenty-five years old, then his brother Gundamári just a year later, on a reckless quest to avenge him....'","Léothred, the Rohirric scholar, and his new friend Fróthi have been thrust ever closer towards the dangers of war in their quest to learn the truth about Fram and Scatha.","Defeated Gundabad forces in Elderslade (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Léothred can be found at Annâk-khurfu.\
\
You should talk to Léothred at Annâk-khurfu.","'While we all search to discover the truth between Fram and Scatha, perhaps we should look more closely at how Fram's death affected the Ai-thúda. We may uncover some hidden truths on our search.\
\
'Fróthi has told me that the dwarves march into Elderslade and have established a fortified post there. Elderslade so happens to be where Fram's body was found those many years ago. It is for that fact alone that we must march with the dwarves.'","Annâk-khurfu can be found in Elderslade.\
\
You should travel to Annâk-khurfu.","Gundabad forces can be found throughout Elderslade.\
\
You should defeat Gundabad forces in Elderslade.","'Have you helped the dwarves in Elderslade? Good, good! While you were away, we have been assisting the dwarves here at Annâk-khurfu. We also managed to verse each other in what we know. There are still some gaps in the story though, and something about that necklace does not sit right with us!'"},
[4980]={"¡Un crujido entre los arbustos al este indica que Faeron se acerca!","Faeron aún no te ha visto. ¡Es tu oportunidad para sorprenderlo!","'Siento esto, ${PLAYER}, pero no pude negarle a Faeron su deseo'.","Recupera el tercer alijo de los montaraces en la isla del riachuelo que hay al noreste.","Mantente alerta por si aparece Faeron ¡y píllalo en plena faena!","'Llegas tarde, ${PLAYER}. ¡Esta ronda es mía!'","Habla con Faeron junto al alijo de los montaraces","'Para los Dúnedain de Tornhad, la vida es una rutina constante, siempre preparándonos para la próxima misión. Acaba cansando después de un tiempo, ${PLAYER}. ¿Llegará alguna vez ese día para el que tanto nos preparamos? ¿Quién sabe? Por mi parte, ideo formas de mantenerme entretenido para no perder la razón.\
\
'Algunos de los nuestros se preparan para un viaje hacia el este y necesitan ciertos alijos que se encuentran ocultos por todo el Ángulo. Mithrendan me ha encargado recuperar tres de ellos y así lo haré, pero te propongo algo: ¿por qué no hacemos una competición?\
\
'Tú irás a la ubicación de cada alijo y, si llego antes que tú o consigo abrirlo sin que detectes mi presencia, ¡habré ganado! Esto me permitirá practicar mis dotes de sigilo, Mithrendan recibirá los suministros que necesita y tú pondrás a prueba tu percepción. Todos salimos ganando, ${PLAYER}. El primer alijo está al noreste de Tornhad, más allá de un estanque de aguas tranquilas, oculto entre las rocas al oeste de la base de una ruidosa cascada. ¡Tengo ganas de vencerte en este juego!'.","'Al joven Helchon le faltan años para poder negarles nada a sus mayores, lo que lo convierte en un aliado muy útil cuando necesito burlar a alguien como tú en una competición amistosa, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'¡Ah, no frunzas el ceño! ¡Al fin y al cabo, solo es un juego! ¿Qué te parece si cancelamos la competición, ${RACE}, para preservar nuestra reciente amistad? Tú puedes buscar el último alijo y llevárselo a Mithrendan, y yo le llevaré los dos primeros, por mucho que pesen. ¡Es lo justo, y así no te pondré más en evidencia!\
\
'El último alijo está en una isla en el riachuelo, a poca distancia hacia el noreste'.","El segundo alijo de los montaraces está situado justo al norte, cruzando el río, oculto en una zanja cerca del borde del acantilado occidental.","'Parece que he ganado esta ronda, ${PLAYER}. ¡Tendrás que ser más veloz si quieres ganarme en el siguiente alijo o si pretendes burlar mi sigilo!\
\
'El siguiente alijo está justo al norte, cruzando el río, oculto en una zanja cerca del borde del acantilado occidental. Te deseo buena suerte... ¡la vas a necesitar!'.","¡Has llegado al alijo antes que Faeron! ¡Ahora mantente alerta por si aparece!","'¿Qué...?'.\
\
Faeron da un salto, sobresaltado al verte llegar, y su rostro se ensombrece cuando se da cuenta de que eres tú.\
\
'Ah, me has pillado, ${PLAYER}. Sí, te dije que no iba a intentar llegar a este alijo, pero pensé que podría darte la sorpresa y ganar las tres rondas. Muy bien, muy bien. Pero ahora te toca a ti recoger este alijo y llevarlo de vuelta hasta donde está Mithrendan. ¡Disfruta de tu victoria y de tus brazos doloridos!'.\
\
Faeron te sonríe con sorna.\
\
'Quizá se me dé mejor el sigilo que perder con elegancia, ${PLAYER}, pero saber perder no es un requisito para mi cometido. Te agradezco el juego igualmente'.","Faeron aguarda junto al segundo alijo, muy satisfecho de sí mismo.","Atrapa a Faeron","El primer alijo de los montaraces está situado al noreste de Tornhad, más allá de un estanque de aguas tranquilas, oculto entre las rocas al oeste de la base de una ruidosa cascada.","'Siento este engaño, ${PLAYER}, pero Faeron insistió en que lo ayudara con esto'.\
\
¡Este no es Faeron, sino Helchon, un joven montaraz de Tornhad!","El montaraz Mithrendan ha regresado a Tornhad.","A Faeron se le ha encargado recuperar varios alijos de los montaraces como preparación para la próxima misión de los Dúnedain, pero él se empeña en convertirlo en un juego.","'Tú irás a la ubicación de cada alijo y, si llego antes que tú o consigo abrirlo sin que detectes mi presencia, ¡habré ganado! Esto me permitirá practicar mis dotes de sigilo, Mithrendan recibirá los suministros que necesita y tú pondrás a prueba tu percepción. Todos salimos ganando, ${PLAYER}. El primer alijo está al noreste de Tornhad, más allá de un estanque de aguas tranquilas, oculto entre las rocas al oeste de la base de una ruidosa cascada. ¡Tengo ganas de vencerte en este juego!'.","Recupera el alijo de montaraz","¡Al acercarte al alijo de los montaraces, detectas a alguien moviéndose con sigilo!","'Ahora te toca a ti recoger este alijo y llevarlo de vuelta hasta donde está Mithrendan. ¡Disfruta de tu victoria y de tus brazos doloridos!'.","'¿Qué te parece si cancelamos la competición, ${RACE}, para preservar nuestra reciente amistad? Tú puedes buscar el último alijo y llevárselo a Mithrendan, y yo le llevaré los dos primeros, por mucho que pesen. ¡Es lo justo, y así no te pondré más en evidencia!\
\
'El último alijo está situado en una isla en el riachuelo, a poca distancia hacia el noreste'.","Mithrendan espera el contenido del alijo de vuelta en Tornhad.","El tercer alijo de los montaraces está situado en una pequeña isla en mitad del riachuelo.","Faeron podría acercarse en cualquier momento, pero si consigues pillarlo in fraganti, ganarás el concurso.","Llega al alijo de los montaraces antes que Faeron","Faeron, maestro del sigilo","Sorprende a Faeron","Faeron aguarda junto al primer alijo de los montaraces con aire triunfante.","Faeron aguarda junto al alijo abierto con cara de satisfacción.","Lleva el contenido del alijo de los montaraces a Mithrendan en Tornhad","'Gracias por el contenido de este alijo, ${PLAYER}. Será de gran utilidad para los Dúnedain que pronto partirán hacia el este.\
\
'¿Tengo entendido que has vencido a Faeron en uno de sus innumerables desafíos? ¡Me atrevería a decir que le vendrá bien que alguien lo supere de vez en cuando! Pocos entre los Dúnedain tienen ya el tiempo o la paciencia para seguirle el juego. Aun así, es un maestro del sigilo y aporta habilidades valiosas a nuestro pueblo siempre que se centra en su deber.\
\
'Gracias de nuevo por esto, ${PLAYER:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}'.","¿Faeron pretende burlar tu guardia y llevarse el alijo de los montaraces? ¡Demuéstrale que no pasa desapercibido ante tus ojos!","El tercer alijo de los montaraces está situado en una isla en el riachuelo, a poca distancia hacia el noreste.","Pero si este no es Faeron, ¿dónde estará el sigiloso montaraz?","'El siguiente alijo está justo al norte, cruzando el río, oculto en una zanja cerca del borde del acantilado occidental. Te deseo buena suerte... ¡la vas a necesitar!'."},
[4981]={"'Tu leyenda ya está creciendo, ${PLAYER}. ¡Que crezca aún más al ayudarnos a empujar a los Trév Duvárdain aún más lejos en Fasach-falroid!'","'Fail-á-Khro está al norte, ${PLAYER}. Habla con Cána allí si aún deseas ayudar a los Trév Gállorg, incluso después de todo lo que ya has hecho por nosotros.'","'Tu victoria ha empujado a los Trév Duvárdain hacia el norte, y mi pueblo ha retomado Fail-á-Khro, ${PLAYER}. Pero aún no podemos descansar.\
\
'Regresa a Fail-á-Khro y habla con Cána si deseas ayudarnos más contra los Trév Duvárdain.\
\
'Fail-á-Khro está al norte de Aughaire, y muchos de mi pueblo lo defienden contra el enemigo.'","Cána está en Fail-á-Khro, al norte de Aughaire.\
\
Los Trév Gállorg han retomado Fail-á-Khro y ahora buscan tu ayuda para mantenerlo.","Fail-á-Khro Recuperado","Has sobrevivido al Clúcath, y Fail-á-Khro ha sido recuperado por los Trév Gállorg."},
[4982]={"Valukhâri is dismissive that the tale is nothing more than a child's fable spun for a new crowd and age. Something does not sit right with you. Take the map to your allies Rhadrog and Faeron, recently arrived here in Zajâna and gather their opinions.","'I fear I have nothing more to offer. The map you hold is likely flawed. The tale of the Fool King's Folly is little more than a children's fable, meant to frighten them from the night or keep folk from venturing into Adagím. It has served its purpose. No expedition has ever sought the fabled citadel's location.'","Rhadrog asks you to speak with Faeron","Faeron agrees and suggests you ask Rhadrog what next to do","Ask Rhadrog how to proceed at the south-west gate in Zajâna","You show the map to Rhadrog and recount the tale of the Fool King.\
\
'You were wise to bring this here, ${PLAYER}. The dwarves are long-lived and masters of stone, unless, of course, they are driven by greed and seek to hoard a treasure. Ask Faeron what his counsel may be.'","Failure Erased?","'Viznak's insight—or his paranoia—may yet serve us. At the very least, you can tell him the tale of the King's Folly and see if he can establish the connexion between the blight we face and that which claimed a generation.'","Faeron and Rhadrog agree there is a reason to investigate further. Faeron suggested you ask Rhadrog how to proceed.","'Had the Temámir not believed in what their map suggests, they would have long ago established an outpost. But they are wary. Men, however, are prideful and secretive, prone to hiding uncomfortable truths. I side with Rhadrog—tell him I believe we must inform Viznak and compel him to learn more.'","The difference in the maps provided by the scholars of Zajâna and the Temámir are pronounced. The Doorward leader believes that the map provided by Bêtam may be a fraud, or errant. You should consult with your allies from the north, Rhadrog and Faeron.","Rhadrog believes the tale may have merit and wants you to share the story and map with Faeron at the fountain square in Zajâna.","Speak with Rhadrog near the south-west gate in Zajâna","Share the story with Faeron at the fountain square Zajâna"},
[4983]={"'The Ranger? Aye, we detained him yesterday when he entered our camp unheralded.\
\
'We are under new orders as regarding the Dúnedain. It seems that they have managed to cross the lords of Edoras in some manner.\
\
'Come, let us speak more of this... in private.'","Daervunn the Ranger was detained by the Rohirrim at the Ford of Isen when he attempted to warn them of Saruman's treachery. It appears that some faction within the Golden Halls of Edoras has a grudge against the Dúnedain and has ensured that their passage through the region will not be easy.","'My hands are bound with ties that no knife can cut. Only a sharp wit will suffice to break them....'","Failure to Communicate","Grimbold has outlined his suspicions about Isengard's involvement in the orders he has received. You must find some way to free the Ranger without Grimbold's direct involvement.","Talk to Grimbold at the Ford of Isen","Grimbold is at the Ford of Isen.\
\
Daervunn has asked you to speak with Grimbold on his behalf.","'${PLAYER}! Well met... or so I would say were I not bound to a post. I came here to warn Théodred of Saruman's schemes, but I am afraid the Wizard remains a step ahead of us.\
\
'One of Grimbold's men produced a message from Edoras ordering the detainment of any Men of Dúnadan descent. It seems that Isengard may have wormed its tendrils into the nobility, if I do not miss my guess.\
\
'Now, as much as I enjoy the comforts of a cheery camp-fire and the good company of my guards, I do not suppose you could see fit to speak on my behalf with the camp commander? I suppose I might be able to free myself, but I would likely injure or kill some of Grimbold's men in the process, and I would rather not give credence to Saruman's claims against us.'"},
[4984]={"'¡Ajá!¡Luz! Lo sabía: los espejos son un antiguo sistema de iluminación de Moria. Esta tecnología es brillante, pero se olvidó hace mucho tiempo. ¡Qué descubrimiento tan increíble!'","Darri está en la Sala Vigésimoprimera.\
\
Vuelve con él y cuéntale qué pasó al girar el espejo.","El tercer espejo está en la Sala Vigésimoprimera de Zelem-melek.\
\
Debes ajustar su ángulo para alinearlo con los demás.","'¿Has intentado girar ese espejo?'","'Según tus documentos, los espejos de las cuatro esquinas de la Sala Vigésimoprimera se apuntan entre sí, excepto el tercero.\
\
'¿Podrías volver al tercer espejo y empujarlo un poco? Quiero ver qué pasa si se alinean los ángulos.'","Gira el tercer espejo para que coincida con los demás","Vuelve con Darri","Débil pero feroz","Darri quiere que compruebes si su teoría es correcta. Para ello, debes volver al tercer espejo y cambiar su ángulo para que coincida con los demás."},
[4985]={"Hay lobos en Paso de Moscagua, en la esquina noreste de los Pantanos de Moscagua, al este de Bree.\
\
Los lobos del Paso de Moscagua han estado causando problemas a un amigo del Jefe de Vigilancia Grimbriar. Grimbriar te ha pedido que reduzcas la manada como favor mientras él reúne provisiones para Anlaf.","'Anlaf debería tener esas provisiones para cuando vuelvas a la Posada Abandonada.'","'He hecho los preparativos para enviar las provisiones a la Posada Abandonada. Anlaf tendrá lo que necesita.\
\
'Has hecho un buen trabajo, deshaciéndote de esos lobos tan rápidamente. Gracias, ${PLAYER}. Es bueno saber que se puede contar contigo para enfrentarte a peligros como estos.'","'Gracias por haberte ocupado de esos lobos. El Paso de Moscagua siempre ha sido un lugar peligroso.'","'¡Un Trasgo atacó mi carro! Mi posada no tiene mucho, y lo poco que tiene es apenas suficiente. ¡Estos Trasgos serán el fin de todo!\
\
'Todavía necesito conseguir provisiones; sin ellas, los pocos clientes que tengo volverán a Bree, y nos veremos obligados a comer la comida que prepara Artemisa, ¡y eso es apenas comestible para un hobbit hambriento! Necesito que hables con el Jefe de Vigilancia Grimbriar.\
\
'Grimbriar es un buen hombre. Se asegurará de que me envíen las provisiones. Puede que necesite tu ayuda para garantizar la entrega, pero es un pequeño precio a pagar para ayudar a un establecimiento tan bueno como este, ¿no crees?'","Comercio con Bree","'Necesito tiempo para preparar las provisiones de Anlaf. Ocúpate de los lobos del Paso de Moscagua y me aseguraré de que las provisiones de Anlaf estén listas para cuando vuelvas.'","'¡Grimbriar me ha enviado las provisiones que necesitaba. Gracias, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}!'","'¡La Posada Abandonada está a salvo! ¡Al menos por ahora, tenemos las provisiones que necesitamos!'","El Jefe de Vigilancia Grimbriar se encuentra en una cabaña del Camino Verde, al norte de Bree.\
\
Anlaf te ha pedido que vayas a contarle al Jefe de Vigilancia Grimbriar su problema de suministros con la esperanza de que pueda ayudarle a conseguir las provisiones que necesita.","'¿Te ha enviado Anlaf? ¿Trasgos? Que se los quede. Prefiero ocuparme de los problemas que tenemos con los hombres de Zarquino que de los Trasgos.\
\
'Voy a necesitar algo de tiempo para reunir sus provisiones. Mientras tanto, podrías ayudarme en otro lugar. En el rincón noreste de los Pantanos de Moscagua, al este de Bree, hay un paso que conduce a las Colinas de los Vientos. Hay una guarida de lobos que causa muchos problemas a un amigo mío en la zona.\
\
'Ve allí y reduce un poco la manada. Yo me encargaré de conseguirle las provisiones a Anlaf.'","Grimbriar te espera en una cabaña del Camino Verde, al norte de Bree.\
\
El Jefe de Vigilancia Grimbriar querrá saber si has tenido éxito contra los lobos del Paso de Moscagua.","Anlaf el Despojado teme que las incursiones de los Trasgos pongan fin a su negocio. Necesita provisiones rápidamente o podría verse obligado a cerrar la Posada Abandonada.","'¡Aún no has vuelto con mis provisiones! Sin suministros, la posada no servirá de nada. La gente pasará hambre. Seguro que no quieres eso, ¿verdad? ¡Simplemente no puedes!'"},
[4986]={"Baskets, flowers, and cloth can be found in Erynos in eastern Lebennin.\
\
Glathril has asked you to gather materials so that she might craft tribute baskets for the Sisters of Lebennin.","Collected cloth in Erynos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect flowers in Erynos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. I'll just need a few moments to put all of this together.'\
\
Glathril sets to work on decorating and filling the baskets.\
\
'There! They are finished. Now, I would ask that you bring a basket to the Gilrain, the Serni, and our own river, the Sirith.\
\
'The Sisters are worthy of such tribute, and I will see that all of our folk honour the history of Lebennin.'","Place a tribute basket in the Serni","Deliver the materials to Glathril in Erynos","Collected baskets in Erynos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Glathril in Erynos","This is a good spot to place the basket","Bring a tribute basket to the Sirith","After finding their belief in the Sisters of Lebennin renewed, the people of Erynos wish to pay tribute to the Sisters of the Gilrain, Serni, and Sirith.","Bring a tribute basket to the Serni","Place a tribute basket in the Sirith","A basket can be delivered into the waters of the Gilrain to the west of Malbarth, near a waterfall along the Serni east of Ost Anglebed, and into the Sirith to the south-east of Erynos.\
\
Glathril has crafted the baskets and has asked you to deliver them into the rivers of Lebennin.","'My folk have had much to think about since the Corsairs' assault was thwarted outside our gates....\
\
'For my part, I have tried to convince my people of the importance of honouring our history. We ignored the stories of our ancestors for far too long, and I believe Lebennin has suffered for it. With your help, I would like to craft new baskets for the Sisters. The materials I need can be found about town, but you can leave the decoration to me!\
\
'Let us pay tribute to the Sisters once again, and let their waters heal the wounds of this war.'","Collect cloth in Erynos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Glathril can be found in Erynos in eastern Lebennin.\
\
You have gathered all the materials that Glathril requested, and you should now return them to her.","Faithful of the Sisters","Place a tribute basket in the Gilrain","Bring a tribute basket to the Gilrain","'Thank you for your aid, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I know the journey may have been long, but the people of Lebennin offer you their deepest thanks in helping us to honour the Sisters - no matter where they have gone to now.\
\
'If you would aid me again on the morrow, I would be grateful.'","Collected flowers in Erynos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Glathril can be found in Erynos in eastern Lebennin.\
\
You have delivered the tribute baskets into the Gilrain, Serni, and Sirith, and should now return to Glathril.","Collect baskets in Erynos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4987]={"'Lejos de mí difundir rumores, pero escuché que incluso mataste al malhechor que lideraba esa banda de rufianes. Eso habría sido un buen lío para el viejo Falco, sin duda... Gracias, ${PLAYER}.'","La casa del Condestable Bolger está ubicada al sureste de la granja de Falco Manoverde.\
\
Confrontado con la verdad, Falco Manoverde confesó que había hecho un trato turbio con los rufianes. Te ha pedido que hables con el Condestable Bolger y lo adviertas de que los bandidos vienen a quemar el pueblo.","El jardín de Falco","'¿Bandidos y rufianes? ¡Oh, cielos, en qué se ha metido el viejo Falco! Estoy seguro de que no quiso hacer daño. Será mejor que te apresures a ir con el Condestable Bolger. Su casa está al este de aquí.'","'¡Ay de mí, me has descubierto! Hice un trato con esos malvados rufianes. Me prometieron no arruinar mis cultivos si les pagaba. Lo hice por un tiempo, pero cuando dejé de pagar, cumplieron su palabra, tal como es, y arruinaron mi hermoso jardín.\
\
'Dijeron que su líder estaría muy disgustado conmigo si no les pagaba, ¡y no solo eso! Dijeron que quemarían todo el pueblo. Escuché que eso pasó en Archet, y ahora me preocupa que ocurra también en Entibo.\
\
'Sé que debería haber dicho algo antes, pero tenía tanto miedo... Este Zarquino al que intentan impresionar suena aterrador. Quizás el Condestable Bolger pueda ayudarte a detenerlos. Por favor, ve a decírselo de inmediato. ¡Su casa está al sureste de aquí!'","'¡Lo siento mucho por todo esto! Por favor, apresúrate y dile al Condestable Bolger... Estoy seguro de que esos rufianes están en camino aquí.'","'Deberías hablar con Falco nuevamente y contarle lo que has descubierto. Podría ser que esos misteriosos intrusos sean responsables de arruinar su hermoso jardín.'","La granja de Falco Manoverde está al suroeste de la granja de Gammy Cenagales.\
\
Gammy Cenagales ha sugerido que hables con Falco Manoverde nuevamente y le cuentes sobre los misteriosos intrusos que fueron vistos cerca de su jardín.","La granja de Falco Manoverde está al noroeste de la casa del Condestable Bolger.\
\
Tú y el Condestable Bolger han derrotado a los bandidos Montebruno que planeaban quemar el pueblo de Entibo. Falco se alegrará de que hayas tenido éxito.","'Creo que deberías hablar con Falco nuevamente. Quizás esos misteriosos intrusos sean responsables de arruinar su pobre jardín.\
\
'Su granja está al suroeste de aquí. Rápido, vuelve con él y cuéntale lo que aprendiste.\
\
'Espero que el viejo tonto sea más útil para ti esta vez.'","Habla con el Condestable Bolger en su granja","El jardín de Falco está fallando por una razón desconocida, causando angustia entre la gente de Entibo.","'¿Los rufianes han sido expulsados? ¿No volverán?\
\
'¡Oh, gracias! ¡Gracias a tí! Por favor, acepta esta pequeña muestra de mi gratitud.\
\
'Haré todo lo posible por no volver a tratar con los Hombres de Zarquino. Proteger mi jardín no vale la pena si destruye mi hermoso pueblo. Por favor, dile a todos lo mucho, mucho que lo siento.'","Habla con Falco Manoverde en su granja","Has expulsado con éxito a los bandidos.","'El viejo Falco nos ha puesto en una situación difícil, sin duda. Los Montebruno han estado merodeando por el bosque de Chet durante un tiempo, pero parecen volverse más audaces desde que apareció este Zarquino. Han empezado a presionar a gente como Falco. Quizás podamos poner fin a eso aquí.\
\
'Todo lo que podemos hacer ahora es esperar...'"},
[4988]={"¡El Festival de Otoño está en pleno apogeo! Únete a los hobbits de la Comarca para participar en las festividades.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completando esta misión obtendrás un mapa al Árbol de la Fiesta, donde podrás participar en el festival.</rgb>","Hueles a hojas quemadas y manzanas de caramelo, ¡el Festival de Otoño ha llegado!","Viaja al Árbol de la Fiesta para participar en el Festival de Otoño","El Festival de Otoño reparte travesuras ingeniosas y sabrosos manjares por toda la Tierra Media. Únete a la fiesta empezando por la Comarca, donde el señor Bilbo Bolsón ha dejado una última sorpresa para sus vecinos.\
\
¡Feliz otoño!","¡El Festival de Otoño está aquí!","El Festival de Otoño reparte travesuras ingeniosas y sabrosos manjares por toda la Tierra Media. Únete a la fiesta empezando por la Comarca, donde el señor Bilbo Bolsón ha dejado una última sorpresa para sus vecinos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Viaja al Árbol de la Fiesta","El Festival de Otoño reparte travesuras ingeniosas y sabrosos manjares por toda la Tierra Media. Únete a la fiesta empezando por la Comarca, donde el señor Bilbo Bolsón ha dejado una última sorpresa para sus vecinos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Tras aceptar esta misión, puedes completarla para conseguir un mapa al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca, donde podrás participar en el Festival.</rgb>","¡${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} al Festival de Otoño!"},
[4989]={"La Caída de los Hijos de la Tierra","Los Hijos de la Tierra de la facción Rauta-lehmä están acampados al este de Esteldín, en Nan Amlug.\
\
Deberías mostrarles a los traidores Rauta-lehmä que han elegido el bando equivocado en la guerra que se avecina.","Cazadores Rauta-lehmä derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has derrotado a los Hijos de la Tierra de los Rauta-lehmä en la sección oriental de Nan Amlug.","Durante muchas eras, los Hijos de la Tierra protegieron el paso por Ram Dúath contra Angmar, pero desde la traición de la tribu Suuri-lehmä por parte del Primer Cazador Jarkko y sus seguidores, los Hijos de la Tierra han quedado atrapados en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes derrotar a los Rauta-lehmä, como se hacen llamar los traidores. Demuéstrales que su traición es conocida y no será tolerada.","Derrota a los Guerreros Rauta-lehmä (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Durante muchas eras, los Hijos de la Tierra protegieron el paso por Ram Dúath contra Angmar, pero desde la traición de la tribu Suuri-lehmä por parte del Primer Cazador Jarkko y sus seguidores, los Hijos de la Tierra han quedado atrapados en las Quebradas del Norte.","Has derrotado a un buen número de Rauta-lehmä en el este de Nan Amlug.","Completado","Guerreros Rauta-lehmä derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los Cazadores Rauta-lehmä (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4990]={"Return to Sênjar in Sormedân and tell him the new queen has been defeated.","The queen flashes her mandibles and roars in rage","Find and defeat the aggressive queen bee","'Oh this is blessed news indeed!\
\
'I will wait a day, and then bring the old queen back.\
\
'It may take a few weeks, but I believe the bees will now calm themselves, under the tending of their former queen. This is a joyous day for all of Sormedân. Thank you, friend, we owe much to you.'","Fall of the Queen","Return to Sênjar in Sormedân","Defeated bee guardians (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have defeated the new queen bee","'Could I have a moment of your time, outsider? I work the land, and for many years the orchards and the bees have both been kind to my family and our village. But recently, that has all changed.\
\
'We have long worked with the bees of Medân Makhai, growing their hives and taking a share of their honeycomb to feed our families. However, a new, dark queen recently took root, driving out the former queen. The bees are newly aggressive, stinging us if we even go near their hives. We rely on their honey to feed our families and to trade with others for their goods. This winter will be a harsh one indeed if the hives remain closed to us.\
\
'Will you defeat this new queen? I managed to save the existing queen, though she was injured. Defeat the new queen, and I will be able to return the old queen back to her proper place in the hive.'","Defeat bee guardians defending the queen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Find and defeat the aggressive queen bee in Medân Makhai.","Sênjar has asked you to slay the new queen of the bees of Medân Makhai. Before you can face the queen, you must defeat the bee guardians defending the queen. Medân Makhai can be found north-west of Sormedân.","Sênjar has told you the bees of Medân Makhai have grown more aggressive since a new queen took over the hive and drove off the old queen. Sênjar has requested your aid in defeating the new queen."},
[4991]={"Lleva las manzanas a El Tío Gamyi","Manzanas caídas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Eres ${PLAYERNAME:nuevo[m]|nueva[f]}, verdad? Hay trabajo que hacer, pero yo no puedo hacerlo. Debería estar cuidando el jardín en Bolsón Cerrado, pero el Sr. Lotho dice que él y su madre ya no necesitan mis servicios. ¡Yo, que trabajé la tierra para el Sr. Bilbo y el Sr. Frodo!\
\
'Las manzanas de ese huerto se pudrirán en el suelo si nadie las recoge. ¿Por qué no vas y ves si alguna aún está buena?\
\
'Esos Sacovilla-Bolsón quizá no quieran gente común como yo en sus tierras, pero no pueden hacer nada, ¿eh? El huerto está justo en la colina al noroeste.'","Manzanas caídas","El Tío Gamyi fue despedido de sus labores como jardinero de Bolsón Cerrado por los Sacovilla-Bolsón. Antes de su despido, estaba recogiendo manzanas del huerto pero no pudo terminar.","'Si tienes tiempo, ${PLAYERNAME:Frontero[m]|Frontera[f]}, agradecería que recogieras algunas de las manzanas del huerto al oeste de Bolsón Cerrado. No tuve oportunidad de traerlas y temo que se pudran pronto.\
\
'¡Si el Sr. Bilbo o el Sr. Frodo estuvieran aquí y vieran lo que Lotho y su madre han hecho con el lugar... bueno, mejor para sus corazones que no puedan verlo, te lo aseguro!'","'¡Ese Lotho no arruinará Bolsón Cerrado mientras yo tenga algo que decir!\
\
'¡Gracias por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}!'","El huerto de manzanas de Bolsón Cerrado está justo al oeste de Bolsón Cerrado.\
\
El Tío Gamyi te ha pedido que hagas un poco de jardinería en su nombre recogiendo las manzanas caídas del huerto, seguro de que los Sacovilla-Bolsón no echarán a ${PLAYERNAME:un Frontero[m]|una Frontera[f]}.","'¡Ve a buscar esas manzanas!'","El Tío Gamyi está fuera de su casa en Bolsón de Tirada, al pie de la Colina en Hobbiton.\
\
Debes llevarle a El Tío Gamyi las manzanas que lograste salvar de los montones de manzanas.","Recoge manzanas caídas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[4993]={"'Gracias, buen ${RACE}. Ha sido una acción terrible, pero que consideré necesaria. Con la muerte de Hojasombría, el control de la Doncella Roja sobre Agamaur se verá debilitado.'","Hojasombría se encuentra en el noroeste de Agamaur.\
\
Radagast el Pardo te ha encomendado la tarea de destruir las criaturas corrompidas de Agamaur para intentar limpiar el mal del señor demacrado Ivar del pantano. Mientras no estabas, se enteró de que un gran ucorno había sido corrompido y que era la fuerza que agitaba a los otros ucornos. Te ha pedido que destruyas a Hojasombría.","'Oh, pobre, pobre Hojasombría. ¿Qué le ha pasado a este mundo para que incluso los ucornos más grandes estén ahora retorcidos y podridos? No, no es necesario que respondas... hay una Sombra en Mordor que lo explica todo.\
\
'Hojasombría debe ser destruido... es hora de que te ocupes de tu tarea.'","De alguna manera, la propia esencia del Pantano Rojo ha sido corrompida. Radagast el Pardo, un mago que ha llegado a Agamaur, busca descubrir la causa.","'Es triste, ¿no es así? Incluso las criaturas más pequeñas no pueden escapar de la corrupción de este lugar. ¿Ves? ¡Incluso las ardillas han perdido su color!'","Radagast se encuentra en el campamento de los Eglain, en el sur de Agamaur, cerca de la entrada.\
\
Radagast te envió a destruir al gran ucorno Hojasombría para intentar limpiar el mal de Ivar de Agamaur. La tarea está cumplida, es hora de regresar junto a Radagast con la trágica noticia de tu éxito.","'Has realizado una tarea terrible pero, al mismo tiempo, es el acto más misericordioso para estas pobres criaturas.'","'Hojasombría era una criatura muy vieja y sabia... La Doncella Roja no debe volver a extender su corrupción.'","'Este es un día terrible para todos nosotros. Dannasen me ha explicado que el pantano fue corrompido hace mucho tiempo, antes de la guerra, y que si la corrupción continúa en la actualidad, es obra de una criatura a la que él llama Doncella Roja. Por lo que sé, esta Doncella Roja fue en su día una de las amables Doncellas del Río que sucumbió a la terrible corrupción de sus tierras. Su mano ahora destruye todo lo que toca.\
\
'Por desgracia, hay un gran ucorno aquí, Hojasombría, que ha sido influenciado por el poder de la Doncella Roja, y su odio agita a los otros ucornos. Lamentablemente, esta criatura vieja y sabia debe ser destruida. Estoy seguro de que encontrarás a Hojasombría en algún lugar al noroeste, entre los otros ucornos.\
\
'Debes permitir que esta pobre criatura descanse en paz.'","El roble caído","'Por desgracia, estos días tan malos han llegado a nosotros.'"},
[4994]={"'The guards were careless, and Braigiar and I took advantage of their lapse to escape. We planned to run to the prince of Rohan's camp in the Gravenwood, but...'\
\
Radanir winces and clutches his leg.\
\
'They cut us off from the straight path out of the village, and we had to take the long way. At every turning, it seemed that there were more and more of the Falcon-clan. Braigiar fought bravely, but there were simply too many foe-men. He fell in the centre of the village, and I ran. I twisted my leg jumping from a rock as their arrows rained around me, but somehow I made it to safety.\
\
'We cannot leave Braigiar to them, ${PLAYER}. Théodred has agreed to help carry his body back here. Go to Tûr Morva and find where Braigiar fell. He deserves better than to be left in that town of jackals.'","Braigiar's body is in the centre of the village of Tûr Morva, where he fell during his escape with Radanir.\
\
Radanir has asked you to recover Braigiar's body from the centre of Tûr Morva.","'You have to recover Braigiar's body, ${PLAYER}. I would do it myself, in a heart beat, if it was not for this leg. I would stand no chance against the Falcon-clan.\
\
'Braigiar fell in the centre of the village. Théodred has agreed to help carry him from the village; you must just show him where our friend lies.'","'Thank you for recovering the body of our friend, ${PLAYER}. He is now at peace.'","Find Braigiar's body, and Théodred will carry it back to the encampment","You stare at Braigiar's fallen form and wonder how many other friends must die within the walls of Tûr Morva.","Talk to Radanir at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras","Braigiar was slain when he and Radanir tried to escape from Tûr Morva. Radanir was wounded and wants you to retrieve the body of his friend.","Radanir is at the forward encampment in Tâl Methedras.\
\
Radanir will be pleased to know that you have recovered Braigiar's body.","Fallen Ranger"},
[4995]={"Talk to Thranduil","Defeated Elf-wights (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Must we now fight our own? By some dark necromancy, Sauron has infused the bodies of our fallen with vile spirits and brought them back to fight their former brethren. These were once good Men and Elves, but now they move without thought, animated by vile spirits. We must slay these wights, and put an end to this worst affront of Sauron.'","Thranduil can be found at Echad-in-Edhil.\
\
You should talk to Thranduil.","Soldiers who fell in battle have been brought back as horrifying wights to fight against their fellows.","Elf-wights and fallen soldier wights can be found in Parth Daenath.\
\
You should lay to rest your slain fellows.","Defeated fallen soldier wights (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Elf-wights (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fallen Soldiers","Defeat fallen soldier wights (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The wights are no more? Then the bodies of our fallen no longer move in anguish, and may return to their rest. Should the Dark Lord send these spirits against us once again, we will be ready. I thank you for what you have done this day.'"},
[4996]={"'Oh, you noticed those old ruins out there in the Gorge did you? I must admit, they are from before even my time, so I know little about them.\
\
'You could ask Ordhrien about them, she is a fair bit older than myself and may know more.'","Fallen Stones and Forgotten Tales","Erymeldir claims to know little of the ancient Elvish ruins within the Limlight Gorge, saying that they were abandoned even before he was born\
\
He suggested that you may want to ask Ordhrien about them as she is a good bit older than he.","Talk to Ordhrien","You discovered a number of unimagineably old ruins within the Limlight Gorge. They appear to be Elvish, but it is impossible to say what age they may have hailed from.","'Erymeldir said that you should ask me about those ruins?\
\
'His ignorance has less to do with his tender age than it does with his flighty nature and lack of interest in anything that does not catch his fancy at the moment.\
\
'Any child of Lórien could have told you what they were, for once they were part of Lórien itself, long ago.\
\
'If you wish to know more about them, you should speak with the Gorge itself, for fragments of the spirits that once dwelt there with us yet remain, for those who know what to look for. Return to the Gorge by starlight and look more closely at those faded lights you have seen in your wanderings, and you may learn of its past.'"},
[4997]={"Fallen Supplies","Recupera suministros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dargumë can be found at Asbaj-khîrfin.\
\
You should bring the supplies to Dargumë.","Bring the supplies to Dargumë","Suministros recuperados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I see, some of the crates broke during the fall. Hopefully, if I sort through what you did manage to recover, I will soon enough find my tools and supplies. Treasure hunting awaits after all! Thank you, ${CLASS}!'","An accident involving a supply cart has left the dwarves' supplies strewn about Máttugard.","'I ventured out here in Máttugard to hunt for treasure. It is a passion of mine, you see. I would already be out there hunting for it if it were not for the fact that I am still awaiting my tools and supplies. There was a supply cart travelling behind us. The supply cart met an unfortunate accident and all that it carried, including my tools and supplies, tumbled out and fell a great distance!\
\
'If you are able, would you locate the fallen supplies for me? I would be most grateful to be reunited with the tools I need to hunt for treasure!'","Supplies can be found in northern Máttugard.\
\
You should recover supplies.","These supplies were ruined during the fall"},
[4998]={"Árboles Caídos","'Gracias, ${PLAYER}... es trágico que estas pobres criaturas hayan debido ser destruidas, pero a veces así es cuando las sombras crecen.'","Derrota Ucornos en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los Ucornos del norte del Bosque de los Trolls han sido corrompidos por algún poder oscuro y han comenzado a colaborar con los trolls silvanos y otros siervos del Enemigo.","Thoroniel está apostada al sur y al oeste del Gladdalf, en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Debes regresar con Thoroniel y comunicarle que has cumplido su petición.","Ucornos derrotados en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hay más amenazas en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls que solo arañas, ${PLAYER}. Muy al norte y al este de aquí hay un pantano que llamamos el Gladdalf. Allí han aparecido trolls silvanos, peligrosos siervos del Enemigo. También habitan allí criaturas conocidas como Ucornos, de las que la leyenda cuenta que están emparentadas con los antiguos Onodrim.\
\
'Ay, estos Ucornos, aunque siempre algo salvajes, han sido corrompidos por algún poder oscuro y han empezado a actuar en conjunto con los trolls silvanos. No creo que quede esperanza alguna para ellos.\
\
'Si tú y tus compañeros pudierais viajar al Gladdalf, esas pobres criaturas deberían ser puestas en reposo. ¿Haríais esto?'","Habla con Thoroniel","Los Ucornos pueden encontrarse en el Gladdalf, en el norte del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Thoroniel te ha pedido a ti y a tus compañeros que acabéis con los Ucornos del norte del Bosque de los Trolls."},
[4999]={"Maddened marsh-lurkers can be found at Gilvamyr and Gladden Falls in the Gladden Fields. A few may also be found wandering the Gladden Fields.\
\
You have encountered a number of maddened marsh-lurkers stalking the Gladden Fields. You must defeat them.","Defeated maddened marsh-lurkers in the Gladden Fields (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","It is unfortunate that they could not be healed of the malady that overtook them, but you have prevented the maddened marsh-lurkers from doing more harm to the other inhabitants of the Gladden Fields.","Fallen to Madness","You have defeated many maddened marsh-lurkers in the Gladden Fields.","Some of the marsh-lurkers in the Gladden Fields have succumbed to a sudden, mysterious madness. To Radagast's dismay, the creatures seemingly cannot be turned from whatever corruption has taken hold of them.\
\
You should defeat them before they bring more harm to the other inhabitants of the Gladden Fields.","A sudden, mysterious madness has overtaken some of the creatures that dwell in the Gladden Fields.","Completado","Defeat maddened marsh-lurkers in the Gladden Fields (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
}
